			<personalityDescription>Howard is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. His tactics shift constantly, his decisions keep enemies guessing, and his sheer momentum makes him nearly impossible to stop once he sets his sights on something. Howard feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around him. It weighs on him, but he refuses to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. </personalityDescription>
