			<personalityDescription>Joe has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply his presence, he reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. No matter the question, Joe&apos;s answer comes with a detailed, multi-step breakdown. &quot;Joe, can you confirm if the report was sent?&quot; &quot;Yes, and let me walk you through the transmission process to ensure you fully understand how the routing system prioritizes data packets-&quot; &quot;Joe, just say yes.&quot; </personalityDescription>
