			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Stephen has no patience for it. He charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry him through - because hesitation gets people killed. Stephen&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in skill or strategy - it&apos;s in sheer, unyielding willpower. Once he starts something, he&apos;ll see it through to the bitter end, no matter what it costs. </personalityDescription>
