			<personalityDescription>Pietrek&apos;s drive is more than ambition - it&apos;s an unshakable force. He doesn&apos;t just work hard; he outworks everyone, refusing to rest until he&apos;s accomplished what he set out to do. Loyalty is just another tool to be used and discarded. Pietrek lies, betrays, and manipulates without hesitation, making promises he never intends to keep. If someone still trusts him, it&apos;s only because they haven&apos;t been burned yet. </personalityDescription>
