			<personalityDescription>No achievement satisfies Sue-Ann for long. She devours challenges with reckless enthusiasm, only to discard them once conquered, already looking for the next impossible feat to chase. Sue-Ann&apos;s actions rarely follow a clear pattern. One moment, she&apos;s cautious and methodical; the next, she&apos;s diving headfirst into chaos. Her unpredictability keeps enemies - and sometimes allies - on edge. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Conquest is a checklist. Finishes one, hungers for two more.&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable. Keeps everyone guessing - sometimes that&apos;s an asset.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
