			<personalityDescription>Every situation is a potential fight in Ritchelle&apos;s mind. She doesn&apos;t care if it&apos;s an argument, a rivalry, or a full-scale war - she treats them all the same: something to be won, and preferably in the loudest, most aggressive way possible. Ritchelle doesn&apos;t just react to situations - she creates them. She manipulates events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering her way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing her game all along. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees all conflict as war. Solves everything loud and hard.&lt;br&gt;- Pulls strings from the dark. Never in the spotlight, always in control.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
