			<personalityDescription>To Rubén, control isn&apos;t a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He dictates every move, barks orders without question, and refuses to tolerate disobedience. In his world, authority isn&apos;t earned - it&apos;s enforced. No matter how bleak things get, Rubén refuses to let doubt take hold. He reminds his unit why they fight, why they push forward, and why they can&apos;t afford to give up - because in his mind, defeat is only a state of mind. </personalityDescription>
