			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Lutfie carves a path forward with unwavering determination. She doesn&apos;t ask for permission and doesn&apos;t wait for approval - Lutfie acts, and others either follow or get left behind. Lutfie treats every piece of gear like a lifeline, stockpiling supplies in hidden caches and refusing to part with anything that might prove useful. Even when others go without, she holds tight to what she&apos;s gathered - just in case. </personalityDescription>
