			<personalityDescription>Musfira sees every resource as her to claim and her to keep. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage or simple supplies, she takes what she can and shares only when absolutely necessary - if at all. Musfira knows how to navigate difficult conversations without causing unnecessary conflict. She chooses her words carefully, smoothing over tensions and ensuring that problems get solved without making enemies. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 74%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thinks the company&apos;s inventory is theirs. Good luck prying it loose.&lt;br&gt;- Knows when to talk, and more importantly, when not to.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
