			<personalityDescription>Bobby thrives on momentum, always pressing forward with an intensity that makes backing down seem impossible. He refuses to slow down, always demanding more, pushing himself and everyone around him past their limits. Bobby knows exactly how to get under people&apos;s skin, and sometimes he does it on purpose. He claims it&apos;s to sharpen teamwork, but really, he just likes seeing how people react. &quot;You two gonna figure this out, or should I start placing bets?&quot; </personalityDescription>
