			<personalityDescription>Nicol is always watching, always analyzing, never letting her guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, she stays one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. Nicol plays by her own rules, which change depending on what benefits her most. She&apos;s not a villain - she just doesn&apos;t see the point in letting things like loyalty or honesty get in the way of a good deal or an easy victory. </personalityDescription>
