			<personalityDescription>Enough is never enough for Drew. She overcommits, overkills, and overcompensates, whether it&apos;s unloading an entire magazine into a crippled enemy or turning a simple job into an all-consuming mission. If restraint is a virtue, Drew never learned it. Drew chases every high, every challenge, every risk like she&apos;s possessed. Whether it&apos;s wealth, battle, or adrenaline, she can&apos;t stop herself from pushing further, faster, and harder - because the moment she slows down, she gets bored. And that is unacceptable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 62%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overcommits, overkills, overdoes. Restraint is a foreign concept.&lt;br&gt;- Restless, reckless, always hunting the next rush. Can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
