			<personalityDescription>Breeda locks onto her objectives with laser precision. Distractions, doubts, and setbacks don&apos;t faze her - once she set her sights on something, she follows through until the job is done. Breeda has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply her presence, she reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
