			<personalityDescription>Masayoshi never acts on impulse - every move he makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, he plays the long game, ensuring he always comes out ahead. Explosions, alarms, everything falling apart - Masayoshi doesn&apos;t even flinch. While others are shouting, scrambling for cover, panicking, he&apos;s coolly assessing the situation. &quot;Relax,&quot; he says, reloading like it&apos;s just another drill. &quot;If they were gonna kill us, they&apos;d have done it already.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every move is measured. Long-game thinker, never impulsive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
