			<personalityDescription>For Hamaama, hesitation is just another form of failure. She throws herself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, she never slows down. Hamaama isn&apos;t just quick - she&apos;s calculated. She anticipates problems before they arise and maneuvers people and situations to her advantage. By the time others react, she&apos;s already executing her next move. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hesitation rejected. Decisions made mid-charge. High risk, high volatility.&lt;br&gt;- Anticipates, then executes. Already in motion while others are thinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
