			<personalityDescription>Melka always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. She knows when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. Melka doesn&apos;t panic - she makes a dry remark and keeps moving. &quot;We&apos;re outnumbered ten to one.&quot; Melka nods. &quot;Oh good, that&apos;s an even fight.&quot; Her lance isn&apos;t sure if she&apos;s fearless or just too dead inside to care anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Times every deal perfectly. Leaves the rest of us holding the receipt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
