			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Jack has no interest in. They maneuver through life like a shadow, twisting words, bending loyalties, and setting traps that only they know how to avoid. Jack weighs every decision carefully, considering all angles before taking action. They values logic over impulse, ensuring that every move they make is well-thought-out and serves a greater purpose. </personalityDescription>
