			<personalityDescription>Devera doesn&apos;t just keep up - she stays ahead. She spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. Devera doesn&apos;t believe in second chances or sentimental attachments. If someone can&apos;t keep up, they&apos;re left behind. She sees emotions as liabilities, and nothing - not guilt, grief, or regret - will slow her down. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always two moves ahead. Makes the rest of us look slow.&lt;br&gt;- Past the point of caring. Job gets done. That&apos;s all.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
