			<personalityDescription>Samiya doesn&apos;t just think ahead - she sees ahead. She plays the long game, maneuvering people and events to her advantage, making sure every move she makes strengthens her position while others scramble to keep up. Enemy forces closing in? Samiya still finds time to compliment someone for their &quot;magnificent trigger discipline&quot; or the lance&apos;s scout for &quot;nailing that stealthy approach.&quot; Some think it&apos;s just her way of keeping morale up. Others think she&apos;s stalling, trying to keep herself from processing the violence happening around her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays the long game like it&apos;s short. Everyone else is just a pawn.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
