			<personalityDescription>Brenden isn&apos;t interested in debates or second opinions - he&apos;s here to get things done. His confidence is a stabilizing force, his direction clear, and when others waver, they instinctively look to him to lead the way. Brenden has seen enough ambushes, enough betrayals, enough slaughter to know that noise only makes you a target. He doesn&apos;t move loudly because he still wants to be alive at the end of the day. &quot;The moment they hear you, they&apos;ve already decided you&apos;re dead.&quot; </personalityDescription>
