			<personalityDescription>Damien&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in skill or strategy - it&apos;s in sheer, unyielding willpower. Once they start something, they&apos;ll see it through to the bitter end, no matter what it costs. Damien is easy to like. They greet everyone with a smile, make conversation effortlessly, and genuinely enjoy getting to know people. Whether ally or stranger, they treat everyone with kindness and respect. </personalityDescription>
