			<personalityDescription>Experience has made Umberto sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. He reads between the lines, recognizes hidden motives, and plays every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what he is. Umberto&apos;s hatred for Mek isn&apos;t abstract. He&apos;s been on the wrong side of a &apos;Mek&apos;s guns, seen cities crushed under metal feet, watched people disappear in a flash of energy fire. He doesn&apos;t fear &apos;Meks - he despires them. </personalityDescription>
