			<personalityDescription>Shea isn&apos;t content with following orders or playing it safe. She set her sights high, pursues her goals relentlessly, and never accepts limits - because to her, the only real obstacle is a lack of ambition. Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Shea. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining her gear, or following through on commitments, she tends to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Follows no one for long. Sets high goals and burns through barriers to reach them.&lt;br&gt;- Needs a babysitter, not a command.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
