			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Julian doesn&apos;t just want success - he demands it. He climbs over anyone in his way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In his mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Julian knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what he wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts deals, cuts throats - climbs to the top by any means.&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like strings - never needs to raise a voice.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
