			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Bahari&apos;s world. He delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, he makes sure they know it. &quot;This is fine,&quot; Bahari says, standing in the open as artillery shells rain down. &quot;I&apos;ve seen worse.&quot; He hasn&apos;t. He definitely hasn&apos;t. But he&apos;ll keep up the act until either the battle ends or someone physically drags him to cover. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
