			<personalityDescription>Vladislav doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. He does what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in his world, only the strong deserve to survive. Vladislav rarely takes others seriously, rolling his eyes at concerns he doesn&apos;t find valid. Whether it&apos;s a risky plan, a personal grievance, or a suggestion he thinks is dumb, he shuts it down with a snide remark and moves on. </personalityDescription>
