			<personalityDescription>To Galvin, convention is just another obstacle. He thrives on experimentation, always refining, adjusting, and thinking ahead of the curve, refusing to settle for &quot;the way things have always been done.&quot; Galvin operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, he&apos;s playing it safe; the next, he&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with him is a challenge - predicting him is impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hates convention. Always refining, never satisfied with &quot;standard.&quot;&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
