			<personalityDescription>Clyde sees every situation as a business opportunity. If there&apos;s money to be made, they&apos;re already working the angles, cutting deals, and making sure they walk away with the biggest share - preferably at someone else&apos;s expense. Clyde has a way of making everyone feel welcome. Whether it&apos;s a rookie looking for guidance or an old rival at a bar, their easygoing nature and open demeanor put people at ease, breaking down walls before they&apos;re even built. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns every crisis into a payday.&lt;br&gt;- Walks into a room, tension walks out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
