			<personalityDescription>Jesús&apos;s mind is razor-sharp, cutting through noise and distractions to find the truth hidden beneath. He notices patterns, anticipates outcomes, and always seems to be one step ahead of the game. In the modern military, most people keep their distance - losing friends is inevitable. Not Jesús. He remembers every name, every fallen comrade, and he&apos;ll make damn sure no one in his unit dies feeling alone. Whether it&apos;s an arm around your shoulders before battle or a whispered, &quot;We&apos;ve got this,&quot; before charging into hell, Jesús refuses to let the universe turn him cold. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Filters out the noise. Cuts straight to what matters.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
