			<personalityDescription>Kadija treats every piece of gear like a lifeline, stockpiling supplies in hidden caches and refusing to part with anything that might prove useful. Even when others go without, she holds tight to what she&apos;s gathered - just in case. Kadija grips hands like she&apos;s afraid to let go, like she&apos;s holding onto something real in a universe where people vanish in an instant. Her lance has seen it before - she shakes hands like it might be the last time. And too often, it is. </personalityDescription>
