			<personalityDescription>Nazeeh isn&apos;t just smart - he understands why people do what they do. He offers sharp observations, unexpected wisdom, and just the right words to make others think twice. Whether leading or advising, his insight makes him a valuable ally. Nazeeh tracks wins and losses, not just his own, but everyone&apos;s. How many battles won, how many contracts failed, how many comrades lost. He used to think if he could just get ahead, just win enough, it would mean something. But the names on the &quot;Losses&quot; side of his ledger keep growing, and he&apos;s starting to realize - maybe, in this life, nobody really wins. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows what drives people - and how to use it. Dangerous in the right seat.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
