			<personalityDescription>Andy doesn&apos;t believe in &quot;enough.&quot; No matter how much wealth or influence he accumulates, he always craves more, scheming and manipulating to ensure that every deal tilts in his favor. Andy doesn&apos;t need recognition - he just wants his people to succeed. Whether in battle, in planning, or in moments of doubt, he offers steady, unwavering support that reminds others they&apos;re never truly alone. </personalityDescription>
