			<personalityDescription>In Shaun&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. He seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the only one left standing. Shaun refuses to do anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s war, business, or pleasure, he throws himself into everything with a level of intensity that&apos;s exhilarating - or terrifying, depending on where you stand. </personalityDescription>
