			<personalityDescription>Allecra has a knack for thinking on her feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, she&apos;s always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. Empathy is a luxury Allecra doesn&apos;t afford herself. She operates with cold efficiency, avoiding emotional entanglements and unnecessary attachments. Others may struggle with choices - she simply makes them and never looks back. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sharp tongue, sharper brain. Dangerous in any conversation.&lt;br&gt;- No attachments. No hesitation. No heart, either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
