			<personalityDescription>Arif sees through people like glass. He picks apart their motives, exploits their weaknesses, and predicts their actions before they even realize what they&apos;re going to do. It&apos;s not empathy - it&apos;s just another tool for survival. Arif doesn&apos;t pretend to be something he&apos;s not. He speaks his mind, stays true to his beliefs, and refuses to put on a mask just to impress others. What you see is exactly what you get. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Picks targets apart like it&apos;s instinct. Cold, fast, surgical.&lt;br&gt;- What you see is what you get - no polish, no bullshit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
