			<personalityDescription>Khaled doesn&apos;t apologize - because he never sees a reason to. Whether he&apos;s bending the rules, running his mouth, or making an outrageous demand, he does it all with absolute confidence and zero regret. Khaled fights because he has to, but his mind is always elsewhere - strolling through the jungles of some uncharted world, watching the sunrise over a crystalline ocean, or fighting through a battlefield that isn&apos;t real, where no one dies and every shot is just for sport. War has a way of pulling him back to reality, violently. </personalityDescription>
