			<personalityDescription>Katherine always wants more - more money, more power, more influence. No matter how much they have, it&apos;s never enough, and they&apos;re always looking for the next way to add to their wealth and status. Katherine has seen too much, lost too much, to care anymore. The only thing that matters is getting the job done, and if that means making brutal decisions, so be it. In their world, kindness is just another word for weakness. </personalityDescription>
