			<personalityDescription>Adriana acts first and deals with the consequences later. She thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Adriana refuses to let hardship define her. She&apos;s weathered every storm life has thrown at her, adapting, enduring, and proving that no amount of pain or pressure can break her will. </personalityDescription>
