			<personalityDescription>Lysandra knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for her own. She pulls strings, applies pressure, and always ensures that the cost of her success is paid by someone else. Lysandra has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect her. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to her, it&apos;s all just noise. She does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, but never pulls weight - others carry the burden.&lt;br&gt;- Sees war as noise. Filters everything but orders.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
