			<personalityDescription>Callum follows a plan to the letter and expects others to do the same. Once he has made a decision, nothing short of disaster - or outright force - will make him change course. Walk into the depot, and you will be greeted. Loudly. &quot;Ah-HA! The HERO of the battlefield RETURNS to my humble domain! What grand treasures do you seek today, O&apos; Mighty Warrior?&quot; It&apos;s impossible to take him seriously - but it&apos;s also impossible to leave in a bad mood. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Follows plans rigidly. Won&apos;t adapt unless forced. Expects total conformity.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
