			<personalityDescription>Stephanie has a sharp eye for the right moment to strike - whether it&apos;s on the battlefield, in business, or in personal dealings. She&apos;s always looking for an angle, ready to seize any advantage that presents itself. Stephanie doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action she takes is calculated to serve her own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always scanning for openings. Strikes fast when advantage appears.&lt;br&gt;- No favors, no debts. Operates on pure self-interest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
