			<personalityDescription>Sally refuses to quit, no matter how tough the fight gets. She keeps pushing forward, adapting, enduring, and overcoming, because in her mind, the only real defeat is giving up. While she doesn&apos;t seek attention, Sally notices everything. She listens more than she speaks, analyzes before she acts, and values deep conversations over shallow chatter. Her quiet nature makes her words all the more impactful when she chooses to share them. </personalityDescription>
