			<personalityDescription>Callum understands that no one has all the answers - not even him. He remains open to ideas, quick to learn from mistakes, and always willing to adapt when a better path presents itself. Callum doesn&apos;t just prepare for combat - he prepares for everything. Solar flares, total infrastructure collapse, a sudden rebellion - he has plans for all of it. &quot;Laugh all you want, but when the comms go dark and the supply lines fail, I&apos;ll be the one still standing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
