			<personalityDescription>Hildborg naturally takes control of every situation, expecting others to follow their lead without question. Whether on the battlefield or in command, they believe that authority is best wielded with absolute confidence - and little room for dissent. Hildborg&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. They can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what they want. </personalityDescription>
