			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Narin keeps moving. She refuses to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. If something actually goes smoothly, Narin gets nervous. &quot;This was too easy,&quot; she mutters while reviewing logs. &quot;Nothing ever works this well. Either we missed something, or something&apos;s about to hit the fan.&quot; No one takes her seriously - until she&apos;s right. Again. </personalityDescription>
