			<personalityDescription>Lacina is a walking powder keg, always a moment away from igniting. Her temper flares fast and burns bright, leaving little room for reason once she&apos;s set on a path - whether right or wrong. Lacina is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. She looks out for her allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. </personalityDescription>
