			<personalityDescription>Daniel walks into every room like he owns it and onto every battlefield like victory is already assured. Whether it&apos;s skill, luck, or sheer arrogance, Daniel makes it look easy - and he makes sure everyone knows it. Daniel believes he&apos;s the best, and he acts like it. Whether he&apos;s fighting for his life, strategizing, or calling the shots, he never doubts himself - even when he really should. </personalityDescription>
