			<personalityDescription>Bushra doesn&apos;t leave anything to chance. She analyzes, adapts, and executes with precision, always thinking three steps ahead to ensure she controls the game rather than being a piece in it. Bushra knows that every battle might be her last. So why not enjoy herself while she can? If she&apos;s going out, she&apos;s going out with a smirk and a last-minute confession. &quot;If this is it, I need you to know... I&apos;ve always looked great doing this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
