			<personalityDescription>Gorgonio doesn&apos;t do safe. He thrives in the unknown, the uncertain, the dangerous - where risk is high and the rewards even higher. Whether it&apos;s luck, skill, or sheer nerve, he always seems to come out the other side with a grin. Gorgonio does what&apos;s required, nothing more, nothing less. He isn&apos;t lazy - he just sees ambition as a fool&apos;s game, one that leads to stress, betrayal, and an early grave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Avoids safety by choice. Risk is the goal. Somehow, keeps surviving.&lt;br&gt;- Not lazy, just finished trying. No threat, no spark.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
