			<personalityDescription>Cheiltje doesn&apos;t just like to lead - she needs to. Every decision, every plan, every battle has to go her way, and she expects absolute obedience. Anything less is just another problem to be dealt with. Cheiltje keeps everything - ammo, supplies, spare parts - because you never know when you&apos;ll need them. She refuses to let go of anything useful, even if it means stockpiling more than she could ever realistically use. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Must be in charge. Demands obedience - anything else is interference.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps everything that isn&apos;t nailed down. Doesn&apos;t share. Doesn&apos;t trust.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
