			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Sandrina has no interest in. She keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in her world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Sandrina knows hesitation gets people killed. She acts fast, takes risks, and makes hard decisions before anyone else has a chance to second-guess. In her mind, the only people who wait are the ones who don&apos;t live long enough to regret it. </personalityDescription>
