			<personalityDescription>Nadeem has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, his sharp mind and keen perception give him an edge in any encounter. Nadeem doesn&apos;t just sign off on jobs - he walks around his workstation three times first, knocks on it in a very specific pattern, and occasionally sniffs the air before nodding. &quot;Standard procedure,&quot; he says. It&apos;s not. </personalityDescription>
