			<personalityDescription>Survival depends on knowing when to listen. Alcander watches, absorbs, and learns from everything around him, filtering out noise and focusing only on what will keep him ahead of the game. Alcander doesn&apos;t just fear fire - he hates it. Flamethrowers, explosions, even the glow of overheating systems make his breath catch in his throat. He fights like he&apos;s always one step ahead of an Inferno only he can see. &quot;No. No fire. I don&apos;t care how cold it is - I said no.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Filters signal from noise - fast learner, situationally sharp.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
