			<personalityDescription>Dallas doesn&apos;t waste time on altruism - every deal, every alliance, every action is about securing her own advantage. If helping someone else happens to benefit her too, all the better - but if it doesn&apos;t, she won&apos;t waste a second thought on them. Dallas&apos;s presence alone is enough to lift spirits. Her confidence is contagious, her words ignite courage, and her actions prove that even against impossible odds, there&apos;s always a way forward. </personalityDescription>
