			<personalityDescription>Seong-Shin isn&apos;t interested in debates or second opinions - they&apos;re here to get things done. Their confidence is a stabilizing force, their direction clear, and when others waver, they instinctively look to them to lead the way. Seong-Shin knows how to navigate difficult conversations without causing unnecessary conflict. They choose their words carefully, smoothing over tensions and ensuring that problems get solved without making enemies. </personalityDescription>
