			<personalityDescription>Vernon doesn&apos;t believe in rules - only results. He&apos;ll step on allies, deceive enemies, and manipulate anyone in his way, all with a cold efficiency that leaves no room for doubt or regret. Vernon doesn&apos;t waste a single calorie. Every meal is planned, every extra bite stored for later. While others celebrate after a mission with a feast, Vernon quietly pockets leftovers. &quot;Might need it later,&quot; he mutters. His squad jokes about it - until they&apos;re starving behind enemy lines and he&apos;s the only one still eating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks rules, breaks people. Leaves no one behind - unless it benefits them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
