			<personalityDescription>Leila doesn&apos;t just have confidence - they have certainty. In their mind, they&apos;re always the smartest, strongest, and most capable person around, and anyone who disagrees is simply too blind to see it. Even when Leila offers help, it comes wrapped in barely concealed disdain. Their advice drips with superiority, their compliments feel backhanded, and every conversation leaves people wondering if they&apos;ve just been insulted. </personalityDescription>
