			<personalityDescription>Orliber wears his confidence like a badge of honor, parading his victories with flair and dismissing setbacks as temporary blips. His unwavering belief in his own prowess often blinds him to potential dangers, even as he dazzles onlookers with his bold, if misguided, bravado. Orliber&apos;s quiet most of the time, but when he speaks, his words are sharp and to the point. He doesn&apos;t have the energy for small talk or politeness anymore. &quot;It&apos;s not that I&apos;m angry. I&apos;m just tired of pretending it didn&apos;t happen.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Flaunts wins, shrugs off losses. Blind spots hidden behind bravado.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
