			<personalityDescription>When the moment demands action, Keera doesn&apos;t hesitate. She thrives in high-pressure situations, cutting through doubt and disorder with a clear, unwavering sense of purpose. Enough is never enough for Keera. She overcommits, overkills, and overcompensates, whether it&apos;s unloading an entire magazine into a crippled enemy or turning a simple job into an all-consuming mission. If restraint is a virtue, Keera never learned it. </personalityDescription>
