			<personalityDescription>Am doesn&apos;t coddle - she drives people forward. Her words are sharp, her expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around her survive. If she&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because she refuses to let them fail. Am doesn&apos;t waste breath in combat. Orders, reports, warnings - they&apos;re all short, direct, and immediate. &quot;Move left.&quot; &quot;Enemy incoming.&quot; &quot;Cover me.&quot; No extra words. No wasted time. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, expects more - pressure makes diamonds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
