			<personalityDescription>Thien-Mai isn&apos;t just thinking ahead - they&apos;re willing to burn down the present to create the future they envision. They pursue their ideals with relentless conviction, and if others can&apos;t see the brilliance of their plan, they&apos;re just obstacles to be removed. Thien-Mai gives because they know what it&apos;s like to have nothing. They&apos;ll take the hard jobs, give up their share, and put themself in danger for the sake of others - even when it costs them more than they can afford to lose. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will torch the now to build the future. Cold fire in the bones.&lt;br&gt;- Gives more than they should. Probably won&apos;t stop until it breaks them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
