			<personalityDescription>Bruin never acts without a plan. Every move she makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time her opponents realize what&apos;s happening, she&apos;s already won. Bruin has a natural ability to sense what others are feeling. She listens without judgment, offers genuine support, and always seems to know exactly what someone needs to hear - whether they realize it or not. </personalityDescription>
