			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fine line between bravery and recklessness, but Florin doesn&apos;t care. He leaps before he looks, convinced that if no one else dares to try, it just means he&apos;s the only one bold enough to succeed. Florin doesn&apos;t see the point in chasing titles or prestige. As long as he&apos;s comfortable and things run smoothly, he has no interest in making life harder for himself just to impress others. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps before thinking. Believes boldness is its own justification.&lt;br&gt;- Happy to coast. Won&apos;t break things - won&apos;t fix them either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
