			<personalityDescription>A constant storm of anger simmers beneath Pierrick&apos;s surface, ready to explode at the slightest provocation. They don&apos;t just despise their enemies - they barely tolerates allies, seeing them as temporary conveniences rather than comrades. Pierrick moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze them - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. They do what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
