			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Steve - it&apos;s an obsession. He sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in his relentless pursuit of fortune. Steve has a way of making everyone feel welcome. Whether it&apos;s a rookie looking for guidance or an old rival at a bar, his easygoing nature and open demeanor put people at ease, breaking down walls before they&apos;re even built. </personalityDescription>
