			<personalityDescription>Treise&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as her ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, she indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. Treise has seen too much to care about petty concerns. She ignores emotions, disregards complaints, and barely acknowledges those she considers beneath her. If someone isn&apos;t immediately useful, they might as well not exist. </personalityDescription>
