			<performanceExamScore>67</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Kieran doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer him something in return. His survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. Kieran feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around him. It weighs on him, but he refuses to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 65%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If it doesn&apos;t benefit them, they&apos;re not interested - period.&lt;br&gt;- Carries others&apos; pain. Could break under it, but hasn&apos;t yet.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
