			<personalityDescription>Aoife&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. She adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in her favor. Aoife&apos;s words carry weight because they come from a place of honesty. She doesn&apos;t waste time with false flattery or empty promises - when she speaks, people listen, because they know she means it. </personalityDescription>
