			<personalityDescription>Bernard never hesitates to take the lead, charging headfirst into danger with unshakable confidence. He believes that decisive action wins battles and refuses to back down, even when the odds are stacked against him. There&apos;s no middle ground with Bernard - everything is turned up to eleven. He doesn&apos;t just prepare; he over-prepares. He doesn&apos;t just act; he goes all out. If there&apos;s a way to dial it back, he hasn&apos;t found it yet. </personalityDescription>
