			<personalityDescription>Madalyn never does anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s firepower, preparation, or just sheer intensity, she goes all-in, often pushing beyond what&apos;s necessary - or even reasonable. Madalyn sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. She takes what she needs, wrings every ounce of value out of those around her, and discards them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. </personalityDescription>
