			<personalityDescription>Misty&apos;s loyalty is measured in cash, and the only flag she follows is the one that pays her the most. If the contract is right, she&apos;ll fight for anyone, against anyone - principles be damned. The universe is broken, and Misty knows it. She doesn&apos;t get involved in arguments, doesn&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly doesn&apos;t stick her neck out for anyone. As far as she&apos;s concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
