			<personalityDescription>Lou refuses to settle for mediocrity. Every step they take is calculated, every move designed to propel them forward - because in their mind, staying still is just another form of failure. Nothing satisfies Lou for long. They hoard wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand their fortune - no matter the cost to those around them. </personalityDescription>
