			<personalityDescription>Kathryn doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. She weaves half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while she walks away unscathed - and usually richer. Kathryn sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. She takes what she needs, wrings every ounce of value out of those around her, and discards them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. </personalityDescription>
