			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Abdul-Hamid has no interest in. He maneuvers through life like a shadow, twisting words, bending loyalties, and setting traps that only he knows how to avoid. Abdul-Hamid doesn&apos;t care about honor or fair fights - only winning. He exploits weaknesses, sacrifices pawns when necessary, and always fights on his terms. If the enemy expects a straight fight, they&apos;ve already lost. </personalityDescription>
