			<personalityDescription>Vikki doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. Vikki never hesitates to step up when someone needs help. If there&apos;s a problem, she&apos;s handling it, if someone&apos;s struggling, she&apos;s lifting them up. She makes sure everyone succeeds - not just herself. &quot;You don&apos;t leave your people behind,&quot; she says simply. </personalityDescription>
