			<personalityDescription>No matter how many times Rick gets knocked down, he gets back up stronger. He takes every hit, every loss, every failure, and turns it into fuel to keep moving forward. Rick doesn&apos;t just fight - he makes sure his gear is invisible until it&apos;s too late. From terrain-matching coatings to active concealment tricks, he takes hiding his equipment as seriously as he takes the fight itself. &quot;If they don&apos;t see it coming, they don&apos;t get a chance to react. That&apos;s the whole point.&quot; </personalityDescription>
