			<personalityDescription>Naomi doesn&apos;t dwell on uncertainty. She processes information quickly, chooses a course of action, and moves forward without hesitation - confident that momentum is the key to victory. There&apos;s no room for doubt in Naomi&apos;s world - she already knows she&apos;s right. She speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of her valuable time. </personalityDescription>
