			<personalityDescription>Trusting Xiao-gang is a mistake most people only make once. He weaves a careful web of half-truths and false assurances, making it nearly impossible to tell where his real motives lie - until he&apos;s already gotten what he wanted. Xiao-gang doesn&apos;t just think something could go wrong - he&apos;s sure of it. &quot;The comms will cut out.&quot; &quot;The terrain is unstable.&quot; &quot;The enemy definitely has backup waiting.&quot; Sometimes he&apos;s right. Sometimes he&apos;s wrong. Either way, he worries enough for the whole squad. </personalityDescription>
