			<performanceExamScore>37</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Arabella doesn&apos;t care about honor or fair fights - only winning. She exploits weaknesses, sacrifices pawns when necessary, and always fights on her terms. If the enemy expects a straight fight, they&apos;ve already lost. &quot;Alright, Trash Panda, you take point. Princess, you cover the left flank. Trouser Snake, you-&quot; &quot;Arabella, I swear, stop calling me that.&quot; But Arabella doesn&apos;t stop. Ever. Once you&apos;re assigned a nickname, it sticks. If you don&apos;t like it? Too bad. That just makes her say it more. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No honor, no hesitation - just results.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
