			<personalityDescription>Lanny is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, he brings an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. Lanny goes into every battle assuming he&apos;ll be the last one left. He fights like backup isn&apos;t coming, like no one else is going to save the day. &quot;Hope for the best, plan for the worst,&quot; he mutters, &quot;And the worst is usually me alone, fighting to the end.&quot; </personalityDescription>
