			<personalityDescription>Martha thrives on audacity. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether she&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, she does it all with a smirk and a shrug. Martha listens before she speaks, always considering different perspectives before making decisions. She values input from others and is quick to adapt when presented with new information. </personalityDescription>
