			<personalityDescription>To Allecra, every situation holds potential - they just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into their gain, they never lets an opening go to waste. Allecra refuses to rely on digital records, still handwrites reports, and triple-checks every automated system by hand. &quot;What happens when the system crashes?&quot; they ask, tapping their paper records. &quot;I&apos;ll still know where everything is. Will you?&quot; </personalityDescription>
