			<personalityDescription>Nicky is never satisfied - his hunger for power, resources, and dominance knows no limits. He devours opportunities, crushes competition, and takes what he wants without hesitation. Sooner or later, even his allies will wonder if they&apos;re next. &quot;Nicky is moving to cover now. Nicky is reloading. Nicky would appreciate it if someone covered Nicky while Nicky does this.&quot; His squad has learned that if Nicky suddenly stops narrating himself, something has gone very wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 76%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will strip allies for parts if they&apos;re the last thing left to take.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
