			<personalityDescription>Some call it persistence, others call it sheer stubbornness - Makaila just calls it doing what needs to be done. She doesn&apos;t waste time complaining or doubting; she simply pushes forward until the job is finished. Makaila doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow her down. Every decision, every action is a step toward her goal. While others waver or compromise, she stays locked onto her objective, no matter what it takes to get there. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Quiet, relentless persistence. Gets it done or dies trying.&lt;br&gt;- Laser-focused. Doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise - just advances.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
