			<personalityDescription>Planning has never been Chiara&apos;s strong suit. She follows instinct over strategy, letting adrenaline and quick thinking dictate her path. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&apos;t - but either way, she never hesitates. Chiara has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect her. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to her, it&apos;s all just noise. She does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy ignored. Runs on instinct and adrenaline. Sometimes lucky, always fast.&lt;br&gt;- Sees war as noise. Filters everything but orders.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
