			<personalityDescription>To Fontanne, every situation is a battlefield, and she plays it like a master tactician. She anticipates actions before they happen, positioning herself for success while others struggle to keep up. Fontanne&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. She adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in her favor. </personalityDescription>
