			<personalityDescription>Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Thomas. They&apos;ve seen what chasing those things does to people, and they&apos;re perfectly happy staying right where they are, watching others run themselves into the ground. Thomas clutches onto everything they can get their hands on, unwilling to share or let anything slip through their fingers. They&apos;ll betray, deceive, and exploit if it means keeping themself ahead - because in their mind, scarcity is just another battlefield. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Eyes open, but already checked out. Let others chase ghosts.&lt;br&gt;- Grips every scrap like it&apos;s life support. Won&apos;t share. Won&apos;t blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
