			<personalityDescription>Distractions are for other people - Brian doesn&apos;t indulge them. He keeps his attention locked onto the task at hand, tuning out anything that doesn&apos;t push him closer to success. Brian doesn&apos;t pressure people - he makes them think they&apos;re making their own choices. His calm demeanor, well-placed words, and ability to read a situation let him guide conversations where he wants them to go, without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been led. </personalityDescription>
