			<personalityDescription>Karla enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, she sees no reason to deny herself what she desires. Karla doesn&apos;t just stay in shape - she pushes herself beyond reason. If the squad is running drills, she&apos;s doing extra laps. If they&apos;re training, she&apos;s doing push-ups between maneuvers. She treats her body like a weapon, and she&apos;s determined to keep it sharpened at all times. </personalityDescription>
