			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Aycin&apos;s world. She steps forward without looking back, her decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether she&apos;s right or wrong, she never lingers in uncertainty. Aycin didn&apos;t get this far by being naive. She&apos;s seen every trick, survived every scam, and learned how to play the game better than most. She trusts no one, always keeps an edge, and makes sure she&apos;s the one doing the exploiting - not the other way around. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;br&gt;- Not fooled easily. Seen the worst, and learned to profit from it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
