			<personalityDescription>Connor knows hesitation gets people killed. He acts fast, takes risks, and makes hard decisions before anyone else has a chance to second-guess. In his mind, the only people who wait are the ones who don&apos;t live long enough to regret it. Connor doesn&apos;t argue - he explains, as if talking to a child who just can&apos;t grasp the obvious. Every interaction feels like a lesson, delivered with an exasperated sigh and the unshakable certainty that he&apos;s always right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves fast. Makes the call before anyone else dares.&lt;br&gt;- Every correction feels like a lecture. Grates on nerves fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
