			<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Veera like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. She fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Veera doesn&apos;t care about honor or fair fights - only winning. She exploits weaknesses, sacrifices pawns when necessary, and always fights on her terms. If the enemy expects a straight fight, they&apos;ve already lost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fueled by anger. Never lets an insult slide - on or off the field.&lt;br&gt;- No honor, no hesitation - just results.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
