			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as &quot;good enough&quot; in Kalena&apos;s world. They push harder, works longer, and refuse to stop until they&apos;re exactly where they want to be - because to them, success is the only acceptable outcome. Kalena doesn&apos;t believe in manufacturer guarantees. They don&apos;t care what the specs say - they need proof. So they push every piece of equipment past its redline, just to make sure it holds up when it really matters. &quot;If it survives me, it&apos;ll survive a battlefield.&quot; </personalityDescription>
