			<personalityDescription>Fadhila is never caught off guard. They read situations in real time, adjust their strategy on the fly, and always have a backup plan - or three. No matter how bad things get, they find a way to turn the fight in their favor. Fadhila never leaves anything at default. If there&apos;s a way to fine-tune performance, they&apos;ll find it. If a system feels even slightly off, they&apos;re adjusting it before anyone else even notices. &quot;You changed the parameters again?&quot; someone groans. &quot;The old settings were inefficient,&quot; they reply without looking up. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads the battlefield like a map he drew himself.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
