			<personalityDescription>Acyutayu&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, he&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Acyutayu never explains why he does it, but he&apos;ll slip into different accents at the worst possible times. It&apos;s hard to tell if it&apos;s deliberate misdirection or just habit. &quot;Reckon we hit &apos;em hard, real cowboy style - or perhaps a more refined approach is in order, oui?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
