			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as overconfidence in Mirra&apos;s mind. Whether she&apos;s got the skills to back it up or not is irrelevant - she steps into every situation like she&apos;s already won and lets reality catch up later. Mirra doesn&apos;t believe in waiting for the right moment - she makes the moment right. Her determination fuels everything she does, propelling her forward no matter the obstacles in her way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 76%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Confidence exceeds ability. May succeed through force of will - or get others killed.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t wait for chances - builds them. Momentum is the fuel.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
