			<personalityDescription>Dirkje-Jacobse gives because she knows what it&apos;s like to have nothing. She&apos;ll take the hard jobs, give up her share, and put herself in danger for the sake of others - even when it costs her more than she can afford to lose. &quot;We&apos;re walking into a trap,&quot; Dirkje-Jacobse mutters as the mission briefing ends. &quot;How do you know?&quot; someone asks. &quot;Because we&apos;re still breathing - means the universe isn&apos;t done screwing with us yet.&quot; No matter the odds, no matter how good things look, Dirkje-Jacobse is always prepared for something to go wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Gives more than they should. Probably won&apos;t stop until it breaks them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
