			<personalityDescription>When the moment demands action, Fu doesn&apos;t hesitate. They thrive in high-pressure situations, cutting through doubt and disorder with a clear, unwavering sense of purpose. While others waste time with diplomacy, Fu gets straight to the point. They value efficiency over politeness and doesn&apos;t believe in dancing around the truth. Some find their approach refreshing - others just find it frustrating. </personalityDescription>
