			<personalityDescription>Tan-ming sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, he doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in his mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. No amount of scrubbing can wash the blood from his hands. Tan-ming showers until his skin is raw, sterilizes his gear twice before every battle, and wipes down every surface he touches. He tells himself it&apos;s just habit, but deep down, he knows - no matter how hard he tries, some stains never come out. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Truth hits hard. So do they. Doesnt apologize for either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
