			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Carl has no patience for it. He charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry him through - because hesitation gets people killed. Carl refuses to stand still, his mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. His adaptability keeps him one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. </personalityDescription>
