			<personalityDescription>Joan&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. She can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what she wants. When others falter, Joan stands firm. She doesn&apos;t just inspire with words - she leads through action, proving time and again that perseverance, heart, and sheer determination can turn the tide of any battle. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Born dealmaker. If they&apos;re smiling, you&apos;ve already lost something.&lt;br&gt;- Morales never lower than their voice. That says something.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
