			<personalityDescription>Meney carries a permanent chip on his shoulder, always ready to turn a disagreement into a full-blown confrontation. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s words or fists - what matters is proving he won. Meney doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights - he believes in surviving. He&apos;ll lie, cheat, betray, and destroy without hesitation, because in his world, there&apos;s no room for second place. If someone isn&apos;t strong enough to keep up, they don&apos;t deserve to be here. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries resentment like armor. Needs to win, no matter the cost.&lt;br&gt;- Fair fights are for fools. Ruthless, deceptive, and deadly efficient.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
