			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as half-measures with Edeen. Everything she does is full-throttle, fueled by relentless determination and an unwillingness to accept anything less than total victory. Edeen thrives in chaos. She&apos;s quick on her feet, always thinking three steps ahead, and can turn a pile of spare parts into a battlefield advantage. If there&apos;s a problem, she doesn&apos;t complain - she just findsa a solution. </personalityDescription>
