			<personalityDescription>Annuziata acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, they prefer action over hesitation - sometimes to their own detriment. Annuziata struts through every situation with an air of undeniable superiority, convinced that their mere presence guarantees victory. Their self-assurance borders on arrogance, leaving little room for any doubts - even when caution would be wise. </personalityDescription>
