			<personalityDescription>Tim lives by one rule: act now, figure out the details later. He barrels through obstacles with sheer confidence, trusting that if things go wrong, he&apos;ll deal with it when he gets there - assuming he even cares. Tim isn&apos;t content with where he is - his eyes are always on the horizon. He sees every challenge as a stepping stone, every setback as a lesson, all leading toward the future he&apos;s determined to claim. </personalityDescription>
