			<personalityDescription>Paulette isn&apos;t just chasing a dream - they&apos;re clawing for survival in a universe that doesn&apos;t care. They know ambition alone won&apos;t get them there, and they&apos;re willing to fight, bleed, and sacrifice to make sure they&apos;re not just another forgotten warrior. Paulette doesn&apos;t just distrust technology - they despire it. They&apos;ve seen MekWarriors suffocate from malfunctioning life support systems, watched targeting software glitch and send friendly fire downrange. People think war kills warriors. Paulette knows the truth: technology is far more efficient. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fighting for more than glory - fighting to be remembered. Survival with purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
