			<personalityDescription>Alexandru doesn&apos;t let morality get in the way of what he wants. Rules, ethics, and ideals are just obstacles to be sidestepped when necessary - he does whatever works, and if that means playing dirty, so be it. Alexandru doesn&apos;t just hear callsigns - he remembers them. Every hero, every ace, every fallen comrade - he keeps a mental log. &quot;Stormbringer? Yeah, I fought against them once. Tough bastard. Still out there?&quot; </personalityDescription>
