			<personalityDescription>Hwen-thiang doesn&apos;t just keep up - he stays ahead. He spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. Hwen-thiang doesn&apos;t believe in taking the high road - not when the low road is so much more satisfying. He remembers every slight, every insult, and every moment someone underestimated him, and he takes special pleasure in evening the score. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always two moves ahead. Makes the rest of us look slow.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t get even. Gets creative.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
