			<personalityDescription>Brann&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Brann has run dry before - been left without ammo, without working equipment, without a damn chance. Now, she picks up everything she can, because she knows the day will come when no one is resupplying her. And when that day comes? She&apos;ll be the only one still armed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
