			<personalityDescription>Nessa has a knack for thinking on their feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, they&apos;re always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. There&apos;s no telling what Nessa will do next, and that&apos;s what makes them dangerous. Their moods swing wildly, their plans shift without warning, and their reactions can be as destructive to their allies as they are to their enemies. </personalityDescription>
