			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Antiokh believes he&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against him, he refuses to stop striving for the future he knows he can reach. Antiokh doesn&apos;t just prepare for combat - he prepares for everything. Solar flares, total infrastructure collapse, a sudden rebellion - he has plans for all of it. &quot;Laugh all you want, but when the comms go dark and the supply lines fail, I&apos;ll be the one still standing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes they&apos;re destined for more. Each battle is a stepping stone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
