			<personalityDescription>Rute never doubts themself, even when they absolutely should. They struts into battle like they&apos;ve already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions their skills, they&apos;ll be the first to bet their wages on proving them wrong. Rute doesn&apos;t escape because they&apos;re afraid - they do it because  they&apos;ve seen what happens when people refuse to retreat. They&apos;re learned that sometimes, the difference between living and dying is knowing when to run. And they never hesitate when that time comes. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never doubts, even when wrong. Swagger first, strategy later.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
