			<personalityDescription>Brian lives life on his own terms, never second-guessing himself or feeling bad for taking risks. He&apos;ll say what others won&apos;t, do what others fear, and walk away grinning, no matter the fallout. Even when Brian offers help, it comes wrapped in barely concealed disdain. His advice drips with superiority, his compliments feel backhanded, and every conversation leaves people wondering if they&apos;ve just been insulted. </personalityDescription>
