			<personalityDescription>Sofronio doesn&apos;t just have ideas - they make others believe in them. Their passion, confidence, and unwavering certainty make people rally behind them, convinced that they&apos;re leading them toward something greater than themselves. Sofronio has a habit of stretching the truth - sometimes a little, sometimes a lot. Whether it&apos;s exaggerating their accomplishments, fudging numbers, or making promises they can&apos;t keep, they always find a way to make themself look better than they really are. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries people with sheer force of belief. Dangerous charisma.&lt;br&gt;- Shines up mediocrity like it&apos;s gold - good at making nothing sound impressive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
