			<personalityDescription>Haydar is convinced he can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. He stretches himself thin, takes on risks he shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether he can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of his vocabulary. Yet. Haydar doesn&apos;t waste time on people or ideas he deems unimportant. If he thinks someone&apos;s opinion is useless, he brushes them off without a second thought and moves forward on his own terms. </personalityDescription>
