			<personalityDescription>Adelan is always spoiling for a fight, whether it&apos;s on the battlefield or in a bar. He thrives on confrontation and never backs down, turning even the smallest slight into an excuse to throw a punch - or fire a shot. Mercy is just another word for weakness in Adelan&apos;s mind. He eliminates threats before they become problems and never lets emotions stand in the way of his ambition. </personalityDescription>
