			<personalityDescription>Matthew knows hesitation gets people killed. They act fast, takes risks, and make hard decisions before anyone else has a chance to second-guess. In their mind, the only people who wait are the ones who don&apos;t live long enough to regret it. Matthew&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. They can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what they want. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves fast. Makes the call before anyone else dares.&lt;br&gt;- Born dealmaker. If they&apos;re smiling, you&apos;ve already lost something.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
