			<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Oriana refuses to be infected. She knows she&apos;s the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment she does, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. In a brutal world where hope is a rare commodity, Oriana refuses to let it die. Even when everything is crumbling, her words, actions, and sheer force of will remind others that there&apos;s still something worth fighting for. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats doubt like weakness. Believes they&apos;re the best - and fights like it.&lt;br&gt;- Has a way of making the impossible feel inevitable.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
