			<personalityDescription>Gratia doesn&apos;t just reach for power - she grabs for it, no matter the cost. Her ambition drives her to overextend, making enemies and burning bridges as she chases goals that always seem just out of reach. One day, she&apos;ll push too far, and there&apos;ll be no coming back. Gratia jokes because if she stops, she might have to actually think about what&apos;s happening. The losses, the suffering, the weight of everything - it&apos;s too much. So instead, she cracks another joke, forces another grin, and keeps moving like nothing&apos;s wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition outweighs sense. Making enemies faster than allies.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
