			<personalityDescription>Weinna doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - she believes in winning. She bends, breaks, and rewrites the rules to suit her needs, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. Weinna cycles through comms channels like she&apos;s flipping through music stations. Squad chatter, command directives, even open frequencies - if anyone is talking, she&apos;s listening. &quot;Weinna, stay on our channel!&quot; &quot;I am - mostly.&quot; </personalityDescription>
