			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Myah carves a path forward with unwavering determination. They don&apos;t ask for permission and don&apos;t wait for approval - Myah acts, and others either follow or get left behind. Nothing slows Myah down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. They grind forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in their mind, stopping is just another way of dying. </personalityDescription>
