			<personalityDescription>Vanora knows what she wants and isn&apos;t afraid to take charge. Whether on the battlefield or in a briefing room, she speaks with confidence and expects to be heard - hesitation is not in her vocabulary. Vanora doesn&apos;t just multitask - she needs to. If she focuses on just one thing, the weight of everything else creeps in. The war, the losses, the endless cycle. So she keeps her mind running on everything at once - because stopping means thinking, and thinking means facing reality. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Speaks with confidence, expects compliance. No tolerance for indecision.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
