			<personalityDescription>Every decision Dorothy makes is rooted in logic and foresight. She doesn&apos;t get caught up in reckless ambition or emotional distractions - she plays the long game, ensuring that her choices serve a greater strategy. Dorothy says what she means and means what she says. She doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - her words and actions come from a place of honesty, making her a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Long-game thinker. Doesn&apos;t blink at setbacks - plans for aftermath.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
