			<personalityDescription>Ralyn understands that no one has all the answers - not even her. She remains open to ideas, quick to learn from mistakes, and always willing to adapt when a better path presents itself. Ralyn doesn&apos;t just fight - she narrates the moment. Whether it&apos;s ancient war poetry, battlefield elegies, or lines of verse that no one else recognizes, she speaks as if she&apos;s seen this all before. &quot;Bent double, we cursed through sludge; till towards our distant rest began to trudge.&quot; </personalityDescription>
