			<personalityDescription>Some call it persistence, others call it sheer stubbornness - Branko just calls it doing what needs to be done. He doesn&apos;t waste time complaining or doubting; he simply pushes forward until the job is finished. Branko doesn&apos;t just maintain his gear - he talks to it. &quot;Alright, sweetheart, let&apos;s not jam on me today.&quot; His sidearm gets a pep talk before every battle, and his knife? He&apos;s got a name for that, too. His squad has stopped questioning it - it seems to work. </personalityDescription>
