			<personalityDescription>Charlie lives for the thrill of the impossible, drawn to challenges that make others hesitate. Rules, limits, and second thoughts don&apos;t interest him - only the rush of proving that nothing is beyond his reach. No matter how many times Charlie gets knocked down, he gets back up stronger. He takes every hit, every loss, every failure, and turns it into fuel to keep moving forward. </personalityDescription>
