			<personalityDescription>Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Aga. They&apos;ve seen what chasing those things does to people, and they&apos;re perfectly happy staying right where they are, watching others run themselves into the ground. Aga doesn&apos;t just want to prove themself - they need to. They throw themself into battles, push limits, and take on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show they&apos;re worthy of something bigger. </personalityDescription>
