			<personalityDescription>Vilena sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, she doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in her mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. Vilena doesn&apos;t just prepare for battle - she reads the battlefield before it even starts. A bird flying against the wind? Bad sign. A weapon jam during pre-check? Worse. If something feels off, she adjusts her approach immediately. Others call it paranoia, but Vilena swears it&apos;s saved her life before. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 60%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Truth hits hard. So do they. Doesnt apologize for either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
