			<personalityDescription>Bhusnu believes the best defense is an overwhelming offense, always pushing forward and keeping up the pressure. Hesitation is weakness, and he refuses to give his opponents a chance to recover. Bhusnu isn&apos;t content with where he is - his eyes are always on the horizon. He sees every challenge as a stepping stone, every setback as a lesson, all leading toward the future he&apos;s determined to claim. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes in pressure. Always attacking. No room for defensive fallback.&lt;br&gt;- Not satisfied with now. Every obstacle is part of the climb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
