			<personalityDescription>Cheng-hao refuses to stand still, his mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. His adaptability keeps him one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. Cheng-hao isn&apos;t just skeptical - he&apos;s haunted by past failures. The cutting-edge weapons that jammed, the prototype that failed, the experimental implants that fried their users from the inside out. He doesn&apos;t hate innovation - he just knows that in war, new means untested, and untested means deadly. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brains always five moves ahead - can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
