			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Justin has a knack for thinking on their feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, they&apos;re always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. Justin hands out nicknames like candy. It&apos;s easier than remembering real names - because real names come with memories. With losses. With faces they&apos;d rather not picture when they try to sleep. As long as they&apos;re &apos;Deadeye&apos; or &apos;Hellhound&apos; or &apos;Bulldozer&apos;, they don&apos;t have to think about how many real names they&apos;ve already forgotten. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sharp tongue, sharper brain. Dangerous in any conversation.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
