			<personalityDescription>Gaira always wants more - more money, more power, more influence. No matter how much she has, it&apos;s never enough, and she&apos;s always looking for the next way to add to her wealth and status. Gaira doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. She sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if she has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Wants it all - wealth, power, status - and wont stop clawing.&lt;br&gt;- Trust is earned. Rarely given.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
