			<personalityDescription>Netro doesn&apos;t believe in stopping - ever. No setback, no injury, no force in the universe can keep them from pushing forward until they&apos;ve achieved what they set out to do. Netro&apos;s foot taps to a rhythm that no one else can hear. Maybe it&apos;s an old war march, maybe it&apos;s the echoes of battles past, or maybe it&apos;s just their way of staying present. They don&apos;t talk about it, but some nights, when everything is quiet, they&apos;re still tapping. Like they&apos;re counting down to something only they know is coming. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t stop. No matter the damage, they push until it&apos;s done.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
