			<personalityDescription>Immacolata approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. They don&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. Immacolata&apos;s secret isn&apos;t just dangerous - it&apos;s damning. If someone uncovered the truth, they wouldn&apos;t just lose trust - they&apos;d lose everything. They&apos;re not trying to hide it for their own sake; they&apos;re trying to protect the people who would be destroyed by the fallout. &quot;If you find out... you&apos;ll have to choose between turning me in or running. And I don&apos;t think you&apos;re ready for that choice.&quot; </personalityDescription>
