			<personalityDescription>Riley doesn&apos;t believe in impossible. Every setback is just another problem to solve, every failure a lesson to be learned. No matter how long it takes or how hard the road, he refuses to turn back. Once, Riley might have wanted more, but now? He&apos;s seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Riley has long since stopped caring. </personalityDescription>
