			<personalityDescription>Taweel clutches onto everything he can get his hands on, unwilling to share or let anything slip through his fingers. He&apos;ll betray, deceive, and exploit if it means keeping himself ahead - because in his mind, scarcity is just another battlefield. No matter the cost, Taweel refuses to let his allies fall. He pushes himself to exhaustion, takes risks no one else will, and puts others before himself - even when it means he&apos;s the one left bleeding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grips every scrap like it&apos;s life support. Won&apos;t share. Won&apos;t blink.&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds for others, and wont stop until everyones safe.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
