			<personalityDescription>Caimile doesn&apos;t let morality get in the way of what she wants. Rules, ethics, and ideals are just obstacles to be sidestepped when necessary - she does whatever works, and if that means playing dirty, so be it. Caimile doesn&apos;t believe in fighting from afar. She moves in fast, cuts down space, and engages up close where she can see the fear in her opponent&apos;s eyes. &quot;Why keep your enemies at a distance when you can make sure they stay down?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Morality optional - does what works, not what&apos;s right.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
