			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fine line between bravery and recklessness, but Lindsay doesn&apos;t care. She leaps before she looks, convinced that if no one else dares to try, it just means she&apos;s the only one bold enough to succeed. Lindsay doesn&apos;t wait for things to happen - she makes them happen. Whether it&apos;s seizing the initiative in battle, fixing a problem before it escalates, or taking charge when others hesitate, she&apos;s always one step ahead. </personalityDescription>
