			<personalityDescription>Susan lives life on her own terms, never second-guessing herself or feeling bad for taking risks. She&apos;ll say what others won&apos;t, do what others fear, and walk away grinning, no matter the fallout. Susan doesn&apos;t just let things go. If an enemy targets her, shoots in her direction, or even looks at her the wrong way, she&apos;s making damn sure they regret it. &quot;You scratched my armor? Bad move. Now you&apos;re my problem.&quot; </personalityDescription>
