			<personalityDescription>Duygu never met a fight she didn&apos;t think she could win. Whether it&apos;s in combat, making bets, or mouthing off to the wrong people, Duygu jumps in without thinking - because, really, what&apos;s the worst that could happen? Duygu has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. She gets frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding her annoyance. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overestimates self. Picks fights, makes bets, mouths off. No fear - no filter.&lt;br&gt;- Barks before they speak. Might bite.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
