			<personalityDescription>Borik doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer him something in return. His survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. Borik doesn&apos;t just fight - he collects proof of his victories. Spent shell casings, pieces of damaged armor, insignias from defeated foes - his personal space is covered in relics from past engagements. &quot;You keep all this junk for a reason?&quot; someone asks. Borik smirks. &quot;It&apos;s not junk. It&apos;s history.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If it doesn&apos;t benefit them, they&apos;re not interested - period.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
