			<personalityDescription>Mercy is just another word for weakness in Ethel&apos;s mind. She eliminates threats before they become problems and never lets emotions stand in the way of her ambition. Most people aren&apos;t worth Ethel&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how she sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath her notice, she brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
