			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a bad idea, Ángel will be the first to try it. He hates waiting, hates planning, and definitely hates being told to slow down - because he always believes the best way forward is straight through the enemy. In a brutal world where hope is a rare commodity, Ángel refuses to let it die. Even when everything is crumbling, his words, actions, and sheer force of will remind others that there&apos;s still something worth fighting for. </personalityDescription>
