			<personalityDescription>Chi-Fun knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for her own. She pulls strings, applies pressure, and always ensures that the cost of her success is paid by someone else. Chi-Fun&apos;s trash talk isn&apos;t cruel - it&apos;s just how she interacts. If she&apos;s not making fun of you, it&apos;s probably a bad sign. &quot;Oh, you actually got it right this time? Guess miracles do happen.&quot; </personalityDescription>
