			<personalityDescription>Carmen never met a fight she didn&apos;t think she could win. Whether it&apos;s in combat, making bets, or mouthing off to the wrong people, Carmen jumps in without thinking - because, really, what&apos;s the worst that could happen? War isn&apos;t personal for Carmen - it&apos;s a business. She weighs risks like investments, treats allies like temporary partners, and knows that in the end, survival isn&apos;t about honor - it&apos;s about profit. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overestimates self. Picks fights, makes bets, mouths off. No fear - no filter.&lt;br&gt;- Treats battle like a spreadsheet. Risk/reward to the decimal.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
