			<personalityDescription>Egor puts in the work, no matter how long it takes. Whether it&apos;s maintaining their combat unit, planning battle strategies, or honing their skills, they refuse to cut corners - because in their mind, effort is what separates the competent from the dead. Experience has made Egor sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. They read between the lines, recognize hidden motives, and play every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what they are. </personalityDescription>
