			<personalityDescription>Angelo&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. He takes and takes, pushing himself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. His drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. Angelo doesn&apos;t just fight - he loots. Every battle is a chance to pick up better weapons, spare armor, or rare tech. If it&apos;s not nailed down, he&apos;s already figuring out how to use it. &quot;Waste not, want not. That guy&apos;s not using those boots anymore, so I will.&quot; </personalityDescription>
