			<personalityDescription>Matt doesn&apos;t see the point in chasing titles or prestige. As long as he&apos;s comfortable and things run smoothly, he has no interest in making life harder for himself just to impress others. Power and influence mean nothing to Matt unless they can be bought. He thrives on backdoor negotiations, whispered exchanges in dimly lit rooms, and untraceable contracts. If there&apos;s a way to twist the system for personal gain, he&apos;s already ahead of the game. </personalityDescription>
