			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Alannah, the kind that makes people listen when they speak and follow when they lead. They don&apos;t need to prove themself - they already know where they stand. Alannah doesn&apos;t just think they&apos;re invincible - they act like it. They take unnecessary risks, dismisses warnings, and underestimate opponents, convinced that sheer skill (or luck) will always pull them through. One day, it won&apos;t. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t posture - just leads. Speaks, and others follow without question.&lt;br&gt;- Ignores danger, overestimates skill. One day, luck will run out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
