			<personalityDescription>Dulari doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - she believes in winning. She bends, breaks, and rewrites the rules to suit her needs, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. Dulari has watched entire towns vanish under &apos;Mek fire. She&apos;s seen warriors pulped by autocannons meant for armored targets. And the worst part? Most MekWarriors don&apos;t seem to care, they just continue walking forward like nothing happened.&quot; </personalityDescription>
