			<personalityDescription>Yoo-Mee doesn&apos;t acknowledge fear as anything more than a passing thought. They move forward with unwavering certainty, meeting every challenge as if failure were never a possibility. Yoo-Mee sees every resource as their to claim and their to keep. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage or simple supplies, they take what they can and shares only when absolutely necessary - if at all. </personalityDescription>
