			<personalityDescription>Inez believes she&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against her, she refuses to stop striving for the future she knows she can reach. Inez has a habit of letting things slide - deadlines, promises, even basic maintenance. She always means to get around to it, but somehow, there&apos;s always something more interesting or pressing to focus on instead. </personalityDescription>
