			<personalityDescription>For Losaki, there&apos;s always a next step, a bigger challenge, a greater prize to chase. No victory is ever enough - she&apos;s always looking beyond the horizon for the next opportunity to climb higher. Losaki has every mission, training session, and equipment check meticulously scheduled. She even sets reminders for &quot;Check Ammo Reserves&quot; and &quot;Pre-Battle Meditation.&quot; Her squad laughs at her - until they realize she&apos;s never the one caught off-guard when an op gets moved up at the last minute. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No victory lasts. Chasing the next big thing is the real drive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
