			<personalityDescription>Rachel doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer her something in return. Her survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. Rachel never forgets a slight, no matter how small. Whether it&apos;s a lost bet, a sarcastic remark, or someone taking her favorite mug, she finds ways to get back at people - usually with just enough humor to keep it from being outright malicious. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If it doesn&apos;t benefit them, they&apos;re not interested - period.&lt;br&gt;- Holds a grudge tighter than a cockpit harness.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
