			<personalityDescription>Jeffrey makes decisions in the heat of the moment, trusting gut instinct over careful planning. Whether in battle or conversation, he acts first and thinks later - sometimes to great effect, sometimes to great regret. Jeffrey doesn&apos;t let rules, ethics, or principles get in the way of what he wants. If bending the truth, cutting corners, or making shady deals gives him an edge, he won&apos;t lose a wink of sleep over it. </personalityDescription>
