			<performanceExamScore>55</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Bhadradeha thrives on audacity. They don&apos;t hesitate, don&apos;t second-guess, and certainly don&apos;t blush. Whether they&apos;re making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, they do it all with a smirk and a shrug. Bhadradeha jokes, grins, and cracks a smirk even when things are falling apart. &quot;Bhadradeha, we&apos;re pinned down.&quot; Smile. &quot;Bhadradeha, command just abandoned us.&quot; Grin. &quot;Bhadradeha, what the hell is so funny?&quot; &quot;Nothing,&quot; they say, still smiling. &quot;What else can we do?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Built from brass and boldness. No filter, no fear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
