			<personalityDescription>Riley feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around them. It weighs on them, but they refuse to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. Riley doesn&apos;t just fight - they make sure their gear is invisible until it&apos;s too late. From terrain-matching coatings to active concealment tricks, they take hiding their equipment as seriously as they take the fight itself. &quot;If they don&apos;t see it coming, they don&apos;t get a chance to react. That&apos;s the whole point.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 83%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries others&apos; pain. Could break under it, but hasn&apos;t yet.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
