			<personalityDescription>Yolanthe lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, she never slows down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. Yolanthe knows how to navigate difficult conversations without causing unnecessary conflict. She chooses her words carefully, smoothing over tensions and ensuring that problems get solved without making enemies. </personalityDescription>
