			<personalityDescription>Nick&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. They scrutinize every action, correct every mistake before it happens, and exert their will so thoroughly that those around them rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Nick dreams of things that should not exist - impossible shapes, unknowable sounds, and colors that don&apos;t belong in this universe. They talk about it like it&apos;s a joke, but there&apos;s a thin edge to their voice. &quot;Yeah, I dream in high definition now. Too bad it&apos;s always something that wants to kill me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
