			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Lyudmila has no patience for it. She charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry her through - because hesitation gets people killed. Lyudmila always seems like she&apos;s one bad moment away from snapping. Whether it&apos;s a broken piece of gear, a slow-witted subordinate, or just a long day, her irritation simmers just beneath the surface, waiting for an excuse to boil over. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Relies on audacity and instinct. High survivability or quick death.&lt;br&gt;- Complains the whole op. Still finishes first.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
