			<personalityDescription>Toini has no patience for obstacles - they remove them. Promotions, power, and prestige don&apos;t come to those who wait; they go to those who take them, and Toini fully intends to claim what they believe is their. Nothing satisfies Toini for long. They hoard wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand their fortune - no matter the cost to those around them. </personalityDescription>
