			<personalityDescription>Ruffina refuses to settle for mediocrity. Every step she takes is calculated, every move designed to propel her forward - because in her mind, staying still is just another form of failure. Survival depends on knowing when to listen. Ruffina watches, absorbs, and learns from everything around her, filtering out noise and focusing only on what will keep her ahead of the game. </personalityDescription>
