			<personalityDescription>Rules, plans, and decisions are set in stone as far as Chris is concerned. He follows them without question and expects everyone else to do the same, regardless of the circumstances. In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Chris refuses to become just another manipulator. He holds onto his integrity, even when it costs him, because he knows that if he loses that, he&apos;s lost everything. </personalityDescription>
