			<personalityDescription>Mirable moves like she&apos;s got an internal reactor running at full burn. Whether it&apos;s work, combat, or downtime, she tackles everything with relentless enthusiasm, always ready for the next challenge. Mirable doesn&apos;t care what people think of her. Whether she&apos;s bragging, bending the truth, or cutting corners, she does what she wants without hesitation or embarrassment. </personalityDescription>
