			<personalityDescription>Aeneas doesn&apos;t just give - he gives big. Whether it&apos;s picking up the tab, upgrading a friend&apos;s &apos;Mek, or spreading wealth where it&apos;s needed, he believes that success means nothing if you can&apos;t share it. Aeneas&apos;s patience is razor-thin, and it shows. Every delay, every misstep, every pointless conversation feels like nails on a chalkboard. He doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense - just get to the point and do the job right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Generosity&apos;s big, loud, and hard to miss - keeps spreading the wealth like it&apos;ll never run out.&lt;br&gt;- Pressure builds fast. Don&apos;t let it vent on you.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
