			<personalityDescription>Lisa knows best - just ask her. Whether it&apos;s battle tactics, logistics, or how to hold a damn coffee cup, she has an opinion and makes sure everyone hears it. If Lisa had more hands, she would probably try to do everyone&apos;s job at the same time. Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Lisa. She&apos;s seen what chasing those things does to people, and she&apos;s perfectly happy staying right where she is, watching others run themselves into the ground. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Has input on everything. Micromanages down to the trivial.&lt;br&gt;- Eyes open, but already checked out. Let others chase ghosts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
