			<personalityDescription>Tracy&apos;s energy is impossible to ignore. She drives conversations, sparks ideas, and keeps people moving, her sheer momentum pulling others along whether they&apos;re ready or not. Tracy doesn&apos;t panic - she makes a dry remark and keeps moving. &quot;We&apos;re outnumbered ten to one.&quot; Tracy nods. &quot;Oh good, that&apos;s an even fight.&quot; Her squad isn&apos;t sure if she&apos;s fearless or just too dead inside to care anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 67%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Their energy drags others into action. Momentum becomes group inertia.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
