			<personalityDescription>For Cheng-Dong, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible she is. She dismisses advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that her skills and luck will always carry her through, no matter the risk. Cheng-Dong has seen too much, lost too much, to care anymore. The only thing that matters is getting the job done, and if that means making brutal decisions, so be it. In her world, kindness is just another word for weakness. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 44%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees every warning as noise. Trusts skill to bail them out - always.&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds others, not themself. Doesn&apos;t lose sleep.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
