			<personalityQuirk>ZERO_G_PARALYSIS</personalityQuirk>
			<personalityQuirkDescriptionIndex>2</personalityQuirkDescriptionIndex>
			<reasoning>9</reasoning>
			<performanceExamScore>36</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>To August, every situation holds potential - he just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into his gain, he never lets an opening go to waste. August has been in zero-G before, and he hated every second of it. No control, no weight, no sense of where danger could come from. He&apos;s seen people drift away, unable to stop themselves, watched them disappear into the black, helpless. &quot;You lose control up here? You don&apos;t get it back. You just keep floating until something kills you or you run out of air.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats crisis as currency. Turns every shift into personal gain.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
