			<personalityDescription>Wealth, power, and influence mean little to Rita if she can&apos;t use them to help those around her. She sees generosity as more than just kindness - it&apos;s a responsibility, one she takes seriously. Rita doesn&apos;t waste time on people or ideas she deems unimportant. If she thinks someone&apos;s opinion is useless, she brushes them off without a second thought and moves forward on her own terms. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 28%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats generosity like duty - takes it as seriously as rank.&lt;br&gt;- Brushes off anything that doesn&apos;t serve immediate purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
