			<personalityDescription>There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Nicholas. He grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if he stops moving, he might have to face what he&apos;s lost along the way. Nicholas&apos;s squad has learned not to bunk near him unless they want to hear a full mission replay at 3 AM. &quot;Take the flank - no, not that way! Damn it-&quot; He barks commands, mutters tactics, and sometimes lets out a low chuckle - like he just won a fight that never happened. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
