			<personalityDescription>Khaleela doesn&apos;t go down easy. Even when the odds are stacked against her, she grits her teeth, digs in, and keeps pushing forward. She&apos;s the kind of fighter who walks out of a wrecked &apos;Mek, bleeding but grinning, ready for round two. Khaleela is always ready for action, diving headfirst into challenges with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s a new mission, a tough fight, or a high-stakes gamble, she thrives on the thrill of what&apos;s next. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grits teeth, keeps moving. Bleeding, grinning, ready for more.&lt;br&gt;- First to volunteer - might need a leash.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
