			<personalityDescription>Don follows a plan to the letter and expects others to do the same. Once they have made a decision, nothing short of disaster - or outright force - will make them change course. Don has an instinct for survival, a mind for improvisation, and a knack for turning disadvantages into strengths. No matter how dire the situation, they always find a way to come out on top. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Follows plans rigidly. Won&apos;t adapt unless forced. Expects total conformity.&lt;br&gt;- Survives through smarts. Always finds the angle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
