			<personalityDescription>Dayana meets everyone with suspicion and barely concealed aggression, always expecting betrayal. She sees the universe as a battlefield, where trust is a liability and violence is the only language that truly matters. Dayana&apos;s hunger is endless - victory, wealth, status, she craves it all. Even when she has more than enough, it never feels like enough, and she&apos;ll push boundaries until there&apos;s nothing left to take. </personalityDescription>
