			<personalityDescription>Xavier is always watching, always analyzing, never letting his guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, he stays one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Xavier knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what he wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
