			<personalityDescription>Anna-Magdalena never misses an opportunity. She&apos;s quick to turn setbacks into advantages, shifting gears effortlessly when a better option appears. If someone hesitates, she&apos;ll already be three moves ahead, making the most of their hesitation. Anna-Magdalena wears the uniform, the gear, the weight of the war - but none of it ever feels real. She moves like she&apos;s trapped in armor that isn&apos;t her own, unsure if the person she once was is even still underneath it all. &quot;I don&apos;t know if this body was ever mine. I just know it&apos;s the only one I&apos;ve got.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 91%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns losses into leverage. Capitalizes while others hesitate.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
