			<personalityDescription>Sirarpie refuses to quit, no matter the odds. Whether facing superior firepower or an impossible mission, she grits her teeth and pushes forward - because failure is simply not an option. When others falter, Sirarpie keeps moving. She refuses to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. </personalityDescription>
