			<personalityDescription>Gautier follows a plan to the letter and expects others to do the same. Once they have made a decision, nothing short of disaster - or outright force - will make them change course. Gautier never sits back and lets events unfold - they&apos;re always moving, always planning, always ensuring they&apos;re the one shaping the outcome rather than reacting to it. </personalityDescription>
