			<personalityDescription>Tabito&apos;s patience is as short as his temper is explosive. He doesn&apos;t wait, doesn&apos;t deliberate - he reacts, fast and forceful, often leaving those around him scrambling to keep up. Tabito has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. He gets frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding his annoyance. </personalityDescription>
