			<personalityDescription>Tyra thrives on thinking outside the box. Whether it&apos;s unconventional tactics, custom modifications, or creative problem-solving, she&apos;s always finding new ways to gain an edge where others see dead ends. Tyra can&apos;t fully prove her belief in machine compatibility, but she knows it&apos;s real. She&apos;s seen people fight like legends in one machine, then struggle in another. &quot;Call it superstition if you want. All I know is, when you find your ride, everything just works.&quot; </personalityDescription>
