			<personalityDescription>Shirley&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Shirley has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. She lies, cheats, and takes whatever she pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In her mind, the only crime is getting caught. </personalityDescription>
