			<personalityDescription>Rafaela has big dreams and no intention of staying in the background. Whether it&apos;s becoming a legendary warrior, a feared commander, or a name spoken with respect across the Inner Sphere, she&apos;s always pushing herself toward something greater. Rafaela has a talent for convincing others to do the hard work while she reaps the rewards. She plays on emotions, dangles promises just out of reach, and always manages to walk away with more than she put in. If someone ends up shortchanged, that&apos;s their problem. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Has big goals and no plans to stay in the shadows. Ambition drives every move.&lt;br&gt;- Lets others do the work, then pockets the rewards with a smile.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
