			<personalityDescription>Vesa moves through life with absolute certainty, her presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When she speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Vesa doesn&apos;t believe in aimless effort - every action, every decision serves a purpose. She keeps her eyes on the prize, unwilling to let anything pull her off course. </personalityDescription>
