			<personalityDescription>Millicente doesn&apos;t see the point in fighting for a bigger slice of the pie when she&apos;s already got enough to get by. Others can stress over promotions and prestige - she&apos;ll take her time, do what&apos;s necessary, and enjoy life without all the extra pressure. Millicente isn&apos;t heartless, just detached. She doesn&apos;t feel the need to intervene, fix things, or fight for anything beyond her own survival. If someone expects her to care, they&apos;ll be sorely disappointed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows their lane. Won&apos;t leave it. Won&apos;t look up.&lt;br&gt;- Detached, not cruel - but don&apos;t count on backup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
