			<personalityDescription>Every move Gjorgjina makes is intentional. They never fight just for the sake of it - they maneuver, control engagements, and dictate the pace of battle, making sure every skirmish ends on their terms. Nothing moves Gjorgjina anymore. Loss, suffering, and chaos are just background noise, and they don&apos;t waste energy pretending to care. Whether someone lives or dies, wins or loses - it&apos;s all the same in the end. </personalityDescription>
