			<personalityDescription>A constant storm of anger simmers beneath Jorge&apos;s surface, ready to explode at the slightest provocation. He doesn&apos;t just despise his enemies - he barely tolerates allies, seeing them as temporary conveniences rather than comrades. Jorge is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. He rolls his eyes, mutters under his breath, and gets annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, he still gets the job done. </personalityDescription>
