			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Tamasi avoids - it&apos;s something she seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, She meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Tamasi sees every challenge as an opportunity, but her hunger for success often blinds her to reality. She pushes past safe margins, ignoring warnings, convinced that as long as she keeps moving forward, nothing can stop her - until it does. </personalityDescription>
