			<personalityDescription>Caitie doesn&apos;t waste time on altruism - every deal, every alliance, every action is about securing her own advantage. If helping someone else happens to benefit her too, all the better - but if it doesn&apos;t, she won&apos;t waste a second thought on them. Caitie says exactly what&apos;s on her mind, with no concern for sugarcoating or social niceties. If the truth is harsh, so be it - she sees no point in dressing it up. </personalityDescription>
