			<personalityDescription>Florian acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, he prefers action over hesitation - sometimes to his own detriment. Florian refuses to accept anything less than perfection. He puts in the time, the effort, and the relentless focus needed to ensure that when the moment comes, he&apos;s ready for anything. </personalityDescription>
