			<personalityDescription>Abdullahi doesn&apos;t entertain the idea of failure. Whether it&apos;s natural talent, unbreakable will, or sheer force of personality, they carry themself like someone who expects to win - and usually does. Abdullahi has a knack for turning every situation into a payday. Whether it&apos;s salvage rights, lucrative contracts, or well-placed investments, they always find a way to make sure their time and effort result in cold, hard cash. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Failure isn&apos;t an option. Victory is an expectation, not a goal.&lt;br&gt;- Always walks away with more than they came in with. Smiles while others scrape.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
