			<personalityDescription>Pat meets everyone with suspicion and barely concealed aggression, always expecting betrayal. He sees the universe as a battlefield, where trust is a liability and violence is the only language that truly matters. Pat has a way of making people believe in themselves, even when they don&apos;t. His steady confidence and unwavering support push others beyond their limits, proving that they&apos;re stronger than they ever realized. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Assumes betrayal by default. Treats trust as a tactical error.&lt;br&gt;- Boosts confidence in others - makes people hit harder than they think they can.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
