			<personalityDescription>Jasmine enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, she sees no reason to deny herself what she desires. Jasmine doesn&apos;t fight in silence - she fights with pure, raw energy. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into combat or firing a devastating salvo, she lets out a gut-wrenching, primal scream. &quot;If you&apos;re not shouting, you&apos;re not really in the fight!&quot; </personalityDescription>
