			<personalityDescription>Abeni can talk to anyone and make them feel like an old friend. Her charm, humor, and ability to find common ground make her the kind of person others naturally gravitate toward, whether she&apos;s leading a unit or sharing a drink. Abeni storms into battle bare-legged and completely unbothered, treating the absence of pants like it&apos;s a tactical decision. If anyone asks, she&apos;ll claim it&apos;s for better mobility - but really, she just hates the feel of fabric on her legs. &quot;Look, pants slow me down. You want me fast, or you want me fashionable?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Uses charm like armor - might be hiding something deeper.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
