			<personalityDescription>Mirvat&apos;s loyalty is measured in cash, and the only flag she follows is the one that pays her the most. If the contract is right, she&apos;ll fight for anyone, against anyone - principles be damned. Mirvat writes because it&apos;s the only way to process the things she&apos;s seen. The words are sharp, brutal, and honest in a way that scares even her sometimes. &quot;If I don&apos;t put it down on paper, it stays in my head. And trust me - you don&apos;t want it staying there.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will shoot for anyone if the money&apos;s good. Morals not included.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
