			<personalityDescription>Mark doesn&apos;t hesitate when faced with the impossible - He meets it head-on, with a steady gaze and an unshakable will. He knows that fear is inevitable, but surrender is a choice. Mark never gives a straight answer. He dodges questions, avoids commitments, and keeps people guessing about where he really stands. It&apos;s not outright lying - it&apos;s just never letting anyone get close enough to see the truth. </personalityDescription>
