			<personalityDescription>Jo treats every challenge like a war of attrition - she doesn&apos;t have to be the fastest or the strongest, just the one still standing at the end. And she always is. To Jo, restraint is a foreign concept. She surrounds herself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy her endless cravings - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
