			<personalityDescription>Ramil doesn&apos;t apologize - because they never see a reason to. Whether they&apos;re bending the rules, running their mouth, or making an outrageous demand, they do it all with absolute confidence and zero regret. While the squad sleeps, Ramil patrols, cleans their gear, and tweaks their HUD. &quot;Somebody&apos;s gotta be awake,&quot; they say, sipping yet another cup of cold, bitter coffee. They insist it&apos;s not paranoia - they just prefer the quiet, the way the battlefield feels different under starlight. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never apologizes, never looks back.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
