			<personalityDescription>Megan doesn&apos;t bend, doesn&apos;t break, and certainly doesn&apos;t back down. Her resolve is a force of nature, pushing her forward even when everything else is telling her to stop. Megan has a knack for finding strange things in the ruins of battlefields - enemy insignias, discarded dog tags, fragments of &apos;Mek armor with odd markings. Her squad jokes that she could start a museum, but they&apos;ve all seen her pull out a bent bullet casing mid-fight, rub it like a lucky charm, and somehow walk away unscathed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t bend, won&apos;t quit. Will alone drives them forward.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
