			<personalityDescription>Richard&apos;s got a talent for finding loopholes, exploiting technicalities, and twisting situations to his advantage. If someone assumed he&apos;d play fair, that&apos;s on them - he never promised to play by the rules. Richard doesn&apos;t just want - he takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, he ensures every advantage lands in his pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Slips through cracks and loopholes like it&apos;s a game.&lt;br&gt;- Takes first, asks never. If it&apos;s not nailed down, it&apos;s already theirs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
