			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Apollo refuses to bend. He will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in his mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Apollo lives life on his own terms, never second-guessing himself or feeling bad for taking risks. He&apos;ll say what others won&apos;t, do what others fear, and walk away grinning, no matter the fallout. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;br&gt;- Risk-taker, loudmouth, and proud of it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
