			<personalityDescription>Iolanda doesn&apos;t see the point in chasing titles or prestige. As long as she&apos;s comfortable and things run smoothly, she has no interest in making life harder for herself just to impress others. Iolanda builds her life on lies, and she&apos;s good at it. False identities, rigged contracts, and backroom deals are just part of the game she plays. The real trick isn&apos;t just fooling people - it&apos;s making sure they never realize they&apos;ve been fooled at all. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Happy to coast. Won&apos;t break things - won&apos;t fix them either.&lt;br&gt;- Lives in a house of cards and dares you to knock.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
