			<personalityDescription>Ema rarely entertains arguments or second opinions - she&apos;s already made up her mind. When others try to offer input, she waves them off with a sigh or a curt reply, making it clear she doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense. Ema has watched too many people lose themselves to war. She refuses to let that happen to her. No matter how bad things get, no matter how much she&apos;s lost, she still stands tall, unshaken, and unbroken. If she has to fight, she&apos;ll do it with dignity. </personalityDescription>
