			<personalityDescription>Janetta lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, she never slows down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. Janetta&apos;s voice is steady, unfazed, even when things go sideways. She sings because it helps, because someone has to act like everything&apos;s still under control. &quot;If Janetta&apos;s still singing,&quot; someone mutters, &quot;then maybe we&apos;re not totally screwed yet.&quot; </personalityDescription>
