			<personalityDescription>Trupti&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Trupti has a sharp mind and a keen eye for details. She quickly picks up on patterns, sees through deception, and understands situations faster than most, making her a formidable strategist both on and off the battlefield. </personalityDescription>
