			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Mona keeps moving. She refuses to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. Mona doesn&apos;t waste time on altruism - every deal, every alliance, every action is about securing her own advantage. If helping someone else happens to benefit her too, all the better - but if it doesn&apos;t, she won&apos;t waste a second thought on them. </personalityDescription>
