			<personalityDescription>No achievement satisfies Abdul-Muhaimin for long. He devours challenges with reckless enthusiasm, only to discard them once conquered, already looking for the next impossible feat to chase. It doesn&apos;t matter if he&apos;s relaxing, performing his duties, or handling reports - Abdul-Muhaimin makes sure everything is where it&apos;s supposed to be. Files? Sorted. Tools? Arranged by frequency of use. Supplies? Restocked and labeled. No one questions his methods anymore - because when they need something fast, Abdul-Muhaimin already has it ready. </personalityDescription>
