			<personalityDescription>If Sadie isn&apos;t in control, she isn&apos;t comfortable. She orchestrates every move, dictates every step, and ensures that nothing happens without her approval - because, in her mind, no one else can be trusted to do it right. Sadie doesn&apos;t check in, doesn&apos;t follow up, and doesn&apos;t worry about what gets left behind. If something was truly important, someone else would have reminded her - or better yet, handled it themselves. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Needs full control to function. Dictates every step, permits nothing unsupervised.&lt;br&gt;- Leaves loose ends like it&apos;s a strategy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
