			<personalityDescription>Stevan always seems like he&apos;s one bad moment away from snapping. Whether it&apos;s a broken piece of gear, a slow-witted subordinate, or just a long day, his irritation simmers just beneath the surface, waiting for an excuse to boil over. Stevan&apos;s not just excessively throwing down NavPoints for fun. He&apos;s seen people die because they missed a critical detail. He maps everything - not because he needs to, but because if he doesn&apos;t, he&apos;s terrified he&apos;ll miss something important. And in war, one wrong step means someone doesn&apos;t come home. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Complains the whole op. Still finishes first.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
