			<personalityDescription>For Jayda, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible they are. They dismiss advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that their skills and luck will always carry them through, no matter the risk. Trusting Jayda is a mistake most people only make once. They weave a careful web of half-truths and false assurances, making it nearly impossible to tell where their real motives lie - until they&apos;ve already gotten what they wanted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees every warning as noise. Trusts skill to bail them out - always.&lt;br&gt;- Smiles like a friend, schemes like an enemy. Don&apos;t turn your back.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
