			<personalityDescription>Tanya&apos;s hunger for success, power, and experience is bottomless. She consumes challenges, pushes boundaries, and refuses to settle for anything less than total domination - because anything less would be a waste. Tanya doesn&apos;t intentionally ignore responsibilities - she just gets caught up in her own world. Whether it&apos;s distractions, forgetfulness, or a lack of organization, things tend to slip through the cracks more often than they should. </personalityDescription>
