			<personalityDescription>Joop never gives a straight answer. He dodges questions, avoids commitments, and keeps people guessing about where he really stands. It&apos;s not outright lying - it&apos;s just never letting anyone get close enough to see the truth. Joop&apos;s been on channels that have gone quiet. Too quiet. The kind of quiet that means something&apos;s gone very wrong. So he keeps his voice loud, his comms open, his presence unignorable. Because if the signal ever drops, if the voices ever cut out, he knows exactly what that means. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never commits. Just enough truth to stay slippery.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
