			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for debate when Jerry is around. He dictates the course of action with absolute certainty, expecting others to fall in line without question - because, in his mind, there&apos;s no alternative. Jerry doesn&apos;t just fight - he makes sure his gear is invisible until it&apos;s too late. From terrain-matching coatings to active concealment tricks, he takes hiding his equipment as seriously as he takes the fight itself. &quot;If they don&apos;t see it coming, they don&apos;t get a chance to react. That&apos;s the whole point.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No tolerance for disagreement. Only one path forward: theirs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
