			<personalityDescription>Pedrag doesn&apos;t believe in rushing headfirst into a situation - he dissects it first. He considers risks, weighs benefits, and ensures that every move he makes is deliberate, calculated, and designed for maximum impact. With a quick joke and a warm smile, Pedrag turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. He treats allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. </personalityDescription>
