			<personalityDescription>For Fytje, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. They fight like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. Fytje doesn&apos;t waste time on pretenses. They live by their own code, unshaken by outside pressure, and refuse to compromise who they are just to fit someone else&apos;s version of how they should be. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks more than just machines. Aims to destroy morale. Relentless.&lt;br&gt;- The only genuine article in a warehouse full of forgeries.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
