			<personalityDescription>Yoshiyo never lets the truth get in the way of a good opportunity. Whether she&apos;s bluffing, sweet-talking, or outright fabricating, she always makes sure her version of reality is the one people believe. Yoshiyo won&apos;t wait for specialists. She adjusts her gear, she repairs her equipment, and she makes sure everything works her way. &quot;You sure that&apos;s safe?&quot; someone asks as she rewires a system. &quot;No,&quot; Yoshiyo says, &quot;but now it actually works.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reality is whatever they say it is - until it isn&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
