			<personalityDescription>Ion sees adaptability as another word for indecision. Once he commits to a course of action, there&apos;s no turning back - no matter how much the situation changes around him. There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Ion. He grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if he stops moving, he might have to face what he&apos;s lost along the way. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Views flexibility as weakness. Once committed, won&apos;t pivot.&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
