			<personalityDescription>Adana doesn&apos;t do safe. She thrives in the unknown, the uncertain, the dangerous - where risk is high and the rewards even higher. Whether it&apos;s luck, skill, or sheer nerve, she always seems to come out the other side with a grin. Adana doesn&apos;t just lead - she inspires. Whether through quiet words of reassurance or a rallying cry before battle, she fuels those around her with the drive to keep moving, keep fighting, and keep believing in victory. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Avoids safety by choice. Risk is the goal. Somehow, keeps surviving.&lt;br&gt;- Not just a leader - makes people want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
