			<personalityDescription>Thuyen never second-guesses herself - why would she, when she&apos;s always right? Every word, every step; every decision is made with the certainty of someone who expects the universe to bend to her will. Thuyen doesn&apos;t believe in rushing headfirst into a situation - she dissects it first. She considers risks, weighs benefits, and ensures that every move she makes is deliberate, calculated, and designed for maximum impact. </personalityDescription>
