			<personalityDescription>Gregg refuses to accept anything less than perfection. He puts in the time, the effort, and the relentless focus needed to ensure that when the moment comes, he&apos;s ready for anything. Gregg always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. He knows when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. </personalityDescription>
