			<personalityDescription>Dinesh measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To him, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw he has no intention of indulging. Dinesh&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. He can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what he wants. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Emotion is leverage, not weakness. Hesitation isn&apos;t tolerated.&lt;br&gt;- Born dealmaker. If they&apos;re smiling, you&apos;ve already lost something.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
