			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Esther refuses to be either. They rush headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Esther never stands still. Esther has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to their side. Whether they&apos;re negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking their way out of trouble, their confidence and charm make it hard to say no. </personalityDescription>
