			<personalityDescription>Ben doesn&apos;t bend, doesn&apos;t break, and certainly doesn&apos;t back down. His resolve is a force of nature, pushing him forward even when everything else is telling him to stop. Ben&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s his ability to manipulate. He spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, he&apos;s already taken what he wanted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t bend, won&apos;t quit. Will alone drives them forward.&lt;br&gt;- Lies like breathing. By the time truth lands, they&apos;re long gone and richer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
