			<personalityDescription>Some people call it grit, others call it madness, but Bunme doesn&apos;t care what they think. No matter how much the world tries to grind her down, she keeps going, long after anyone else would have quit. Bunme doesn&apos;t just steal - she takes. Money, gear, secrets - nothing is off-limits. She sees ownership as a temporary state, and if someone isn&apos;t strong or smart enough to hold onto what&apos;s theirs, they don&apos;t deserve to keep it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grit or madness - hard to tell. Doesn&apos;t care. Just keeps moving.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t believe in ownership - only opportunity.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
