			<personalityDescription>Thaddeus thrives on thinking outside the box. Whether it&apos;s unconventional tactics, custom modifications, or creative problem-solving, he&apos;s always finding new ways to gain an edge where others see dead ends. Thaddeus is the spark that ignites every situation. His charisma, ambition, and relentless drive make him impossible to ignore, drawing people in and pushing events forward with sheer force of will. </personalityDescription>
