			<personalityDescription>Kimberly&apos;s mind is a finely tuned weapon, cutting through distractions and deceptions with precision. She knows exactly when to push, when to hold back, and when to strike for maximum effect. Every insult, every disagreement, every minor inconvenience is a personal attack in Kimberly&apos;s mind. She holds grudges for years, going out of her way to make sure anyone who crosses her regrets it, even if it costs her more than it&apos;s worth. </personalityDescription>
