			<personalityDescription>Once Phil commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake his resolve once he&apos;s made up his mind. No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Phil tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. He refuses to play politics or pretend to be something he isn&apos;t, even if it makes him enemies. </personalityDescription>
