			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Feheen is probably already doing it. He doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - he buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Feheen doesn&apos;t just chase profits - he extracts them. He cuts costs, exploits loopholes, and squeezes every last drop out of a deal, no matter who gets shortchanged in the process. If there&apos;s money to be made, morality is just an inconvenience. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases danger for fun. Dares what others dismiss. Laughs off rules.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts corners for profit. If youre in the way, youre the margin.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
