			<personalityDescription>Ellis is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. They look out for their allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. Ellis pranks because if they stop, they&apos;ll have to process the horror around them. Every practical joke is a distraction, a way to keep things light even when the air feels like death. The day Ellis stops joking is the day their squad knows things have truly gone to hell. </personalityDescription>
