			<personalityDescription>Wladimir doesn&apos;t care what people think of him. Whether he&apos;s bragging, bending the truth, or cutting corners, he does what he wants without hesitation or embarrassment. Wladimir doesn&apos;t trust command, strategy reports, or maps drawn by people who have never stepped foot here. He trusts locals. He knows that understanding them is the difference between life and death. &quot;You ignore them, you die. It&apos;s that simple. And when you do, they won&apos;t mourn you. They&apos;ll say you deserved it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
