			<personalityDescription>Alex knows where they want to be, and they know how to get there. With a mix of charm, strategy, and just the right amount of risk-taking, they maneuver their way toward success, making the right allies and cutting loose the dead weight as needed. Alex doesn&apos;t just call out enemy movements - they break them down step by step. &quot;They&apos;re flanking left, which makes sense given their formation, but what they don&apos;t realize is that their advance pattern leaves a small gap in their center-left quadrant, which - &quot; &quot;Alex, just shoot them.&quot; </personalityDescription>
