			<personalityDescription>Jennifer has a way of making problems disappear - for the right price. She knows who to bribe, who to blackmail, and how to twist the system to her advantage. She&apos;s technically not breaking the law... She&apos;s just making sure it works in her favor. Jennifer has stopped believing in long-term plans, in saving up, in waiting for better days. She&apos;s seen too many people die with regrets, too many final moments filled with &apos;what ifs&apos;. She refuses to be one of them. &quot;I don&apos;t care what comes next. Right now, I&apos;m alive. And that means I take everything life has to offer.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t solve problems - sells the solutions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
