			<personalityDescription>Ahlaam is always working an angle, always looking for a way to manipulate the situation to her advantage. She plays people like a chessboard, making sure they never realize they were just another piece in her game. Ahlaam has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, her sharp mind and keen perception give her an edge in any encounter. </personalityDescription>
