			<personalityDescription>Colina has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, her sharp mind and keen perception give her an edge in any encounter. Colina is up before dawn, already running drills while the rest of the squad is barely conscious. &quot;Morning is when the real warriors prepare,&quot; she says, sipping a steaming-hot cup of coffee while everyone else groans. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees the field like a map - knows where it&apos;s going before it moves.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
