			<personalityDescription>Karen sees every resource as her to claim and her to keep. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage or simple supplies, she takes what she can and shares only when absolutely necessary - if at all. Karen once showed up late to a fight. She doesn&apos;t talk about what happened afterward, but her squad didn&apos;t walk away intact. Now, she&apos;s never late. Never behind. Never a second off schedule. Because if she is, it means someone else might not make it. And she refuses to let that happen again. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thinks the company&apos;s inventory is theirs. Good luck prying it loose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
