			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Aileen refuses to bend. She will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in her mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Aileen doesn&apos;t overthink - she acts, and it works. Her decisions come fast and with absolute confidence, as if guided by something deeper than thought. Some call it reckless. Aileen calls it natural talent. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t hesitate. Trusts instinct. Scary how often that&apos;s enough.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
