			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Elif is the rock they lean on. She doesn&apos;t just stand her ground - she inspires others to do the same, proving that true strength comes from never backing down, no matter how impossible the fight may seem. Elif sees rules as obstacles, not boundaries. If there&apos;s a shortcut to be taken or a loophole to exploit, she&apos;ll find it - ethics and fairness be damned. </personalityDescription>
