			<personalityDescription>Most people call it bravery, but Gracie just calls it fun. She thrives on chaos, laughs in the face of danger, and treats every brush with death like just another story to tell over drinks. Gracie has been there - the silence stretching on too long, the slow realization that no one&apos;s responding. If she speaks, it&apos;s because she needs to hear someone answer back. &quot;Someone say something. Just... anything. I don&apos;t care what.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Danger is entertainment. Laughs at risk. Borderline thrill-seeker.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
