			<personalityDescription>Lillian doesn&apos;t just accept corruption - she thrives in it. She manipulates the system, exploits those beneath her, and trades favors like currency. In her world, loyalty is bought, power is for sale, and morality is a weakness. Lillian simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even her own well-being are secondary to whatever she deems important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of her inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 66%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty&apos;s just a receipt - they only back who pays best.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t track gear, doesn&apos;t track people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
