			<personalityDescription>Dana doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. She does what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in her world, only the strong deserve to survive. Dana refuses to take half-measures. If something needs to go down, it needs to stay down. She doesn&apos;t just eliminate threats - she obliterates them. &quot;One shot? Cute. I fired twenty just to be sure.&quot; </personalityDescription>
