			<personalityDescription>Max approaches every task with an obsessive level of precision. From the way he maintains his gear to the way he plans a mission, nothing escapes his scrutiny - because perfection isn&apos;t optional, it&apos;s necessary. Max always takes the time to think about how his actions affect others. Whether it&apos;s checking in on his comrades, giving credit where it&apos;s due, or offering help without being asked, he makes sure people feel valued and respected. </personalityDescription>
