			<personalityDescription>Bryan refuses to waver, no matter the odds. Once they set a goal, they see it through with unshakable determination, standing firm even when everything around them is falling apart. Bryan doesn&apos;t do calm. Even when things aren&apos;t urgent, they&apos;re tense, wired, ready to react. Every noise, every movement, every shift on the battlefield is something they&apos;re already preparing for. &quot;Relax? We&apos;re in a warzone. Relax after we survive.&quot; </personalityDescription>
