			<personalityDescription>When Biljana sets her sights on something, she doesn&apos;t stop until its her. No obstacle is too great, no challenge too daunting - her relentless pursuit of her objectives defines everything she does. Every word Biljana speaks is calculated. She twists the truth, plays people against each other, and makespretends to care just enough to gain trust before using it to her advantage. If someone thinks she&apos;s being sincere, they&apos;re already her next victim. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Locked in once committed. Obstacles don&apos;t deter - just delay.&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like cards - gets close, gains trust, exploits it fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
