			<personalityDescription>Patience and restraint have never been Shirley&apos;s strengths. She acts first, thinks later, and rarely regrets it - because in her mind, slowing down is just another way of losing. Shirley doesn&apos;t believe in aimless effort - every action, every decision serves a purpose. She keeps her eyes on the prize, unwilling to let anything pull her off course. </personalityDescription>
