			<personalityDescription>Maryann doesn&apos;t just have confidence - they have certainty. In their mind, they&apos;re always the smartest, strongest, and most capable person around, and anyone who disagrees is simply too blind to see it. Maryann goes into every battle assuming they&apos;ll be the last one left. They fight like backup isn&apos;t coming, like no one else is going to save the day. &quot;Hope for the best, plan for the worst,&quot; they mutter, &quot;And the worst is usually me alone, fighting to the end.&quot; </personalityDescription>
