			<performanceExamScore>55</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Hako thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Hako simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Bullets fly, explosions shake the ground, and Hako? Hako&apos;s singing. &quot;Hako, why the hell are you singing right now?&quot; someone shouts. &quot;Gotta keep morale up!&quot; she yells back - right before nailing a perfect headshot while still holding a tune. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Momentum addict. Planning seen as weakness. Lets consequences catch up later.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
