			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy soaked in blood, Dylan refuses to be just another killer. They cling to the belief that there&apos;s a better way, even as war drags on around them, testing convictions that grow harder to uphold with every battle. Dylan doesn&apos;t just see the game being played - they play it better than everyone else. They spot weaknesses, exploit blind spots, and read people like open books. By the time others realize they&apos;ve been outmaneuvered, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Holds tight to idealism. War tests it, but they endure - for now.&lt;br&gt;- Playing three games at once and winning all of them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
