			<personalityDescription>Most people call it bravery, but Silvia just calls it fun. She thrives on chaos, laughs in the face of danger, and treats every brush with death like just another story to tell over drinks. Silvia hates slow, cautious approaches. If there&apos;s a shortcut that might work, she&apos;s taking it. If there&apos;s a wild, untested alternative, she&apos;s all in. &quot;Yeah, yeah, it might backfire. But if it doesn&apos;t, we just saved a ton of time.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Danger is entertainment. Laughs at risk. Borderline thrill-seeker.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
