			<personalityDescription>Shaidah knows what she wants and isn&apos;t afraid to take charge. Whether on the battlefield or in a briefing room, she speaks with confidence and expects to be heard - hesitation is not in her vocabulary. Shaidah knows how to get the most out of people and situations. Whether it&apos;s leveraging favors, bending the rules, or pushing people just hard enough to get results, she always makes sure she&apos;s coming out ahead. </personalityDescription>
