			<personalityDescription>Diana never second-guesses herself - why would she, when she&apos;s always right? Every word, every step; every decision is made with the certainty of someone who expects the universe to bend to her will. Diana doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only results. She&apos;ll lie, cheat, steal, and betray without a second thought if it serves her interests. If someone expected honor or fairness from her, they were already doomed to fail. </personalityDescription>
