			<personalityDescription>Dorin has never met a fight he didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, he runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Dorin has stopped trying to understand the things he sees in his sleep. Vast shapes moving beneath black water, whispers in languages that scrape across his mind, the sense that something is watching him even after he wakes. &quot;There&apos;s something down there. And it knows my name.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
