			<personalityDescription>Sevgi&apos;s energy is impossible to ignore. She drives conversations, sparks ideas, and keeps people moving, her sheer momentum pulling others along whether they&apos;re ready or not. Sevgi&apos;s calendar is obsessive. She logs every mission, every deployment, every injury. She tracks trends - how long the average warrior lasts in the unit; how many more battles her squad can take before the odds catch up. She&apos;s seen the numbers, and she knows. There&apos;s a date circled in red. She won&apos;t say what it means, but she checks it every day. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Their energy drags others into action. Momentum becomes group inertia.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
