			<personalityDescription>Sanwari believes she&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against her, she refuses to stop striving for the future she knows she can reach. Sanwari moves through life like a ghost, detached from the surrounding chaos. Orders are followed, tasks are completed, but there&apos;s no fire behind her actions - just a quiet acceptance that nothing really changes. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes they&apos;re destined for more. Each battle is a stepping stone.&lt;br&gt;- Operates on autopilot. Body moves. Mind&apos;s already gone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
