			<personalityDescription>Corazon acts first and deals with the consequences later. They thrive on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Corazon doesn&apos;t apologize - because they never see a reason to. Whether they&apos;re bending the rules, running their mouth, or making an outrageous demand, they do it all with absolute confidence and zero regret. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Instinct-driven. Bold or foolish - depends on the day. Decisive, not always smart.&lt;br&gt;- Never apologizes, never looks back.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
