			<performanceExamScore>49</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Compromise is just another word for weakness in Jorge&apos;s mind. He doesn&apos;t negotiate or accommodate - he dictates, expecting the world to move according to his vision, whether others like it or not. Jorge sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. He takes what he needs, wrings every ounce of value out of those around him, and discards them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees compromise as failure. Imposes vision regardless of input.&lt;br&gt;- Treats people like tools - breaks them, bins them, moves on.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
