			<personalityDescription>Waqar thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Waqar simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Waqar always seems to be up to something. They disappear without explanation, answer questions with vague half-smiles, and always seem to know more than they should. &quot;Relax. If I were planning something shady, you wouldn&apos;t know until it was too late.&quot; </personalityDescription>
