			<personalityDescription>Roshanara&apos;s greatest skill isn&apos;t combat or strategy - it&apos;s deception. Every deal, every handshake, every carefully crafted story is just another step in keeping up the illusion of who she wants people to believe she is. Roshanara doesn&apos;t just hear people - she listens. Whether it&apos;s a new strategy, a fresh perspective, or a hard truth, she takes in information without letting pride or stubbornness get in the way of growth. </personalityDescription>
