			<personalityDescription>Flavia doesn&apos;t dwell on uncertainty. They process information quickly, chooses a course of action, and moves forward without hesitation - confident that momentum is the key to victory. Flavia puts in the work, no matter how long it takes. Whether it&apos;s maintaining their combat unit, planning battle strategies, or honing their skills, they refuse to cut corners - because in their mind, effort is what separates the competent from the dead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Processes quickly. Chooses, moves, adapts. Keeps the initiative.&lt;br&gt;- Puts in the hours. Refuses shortcuts - effort equals survival.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
