			<personalityDescription>Dragana has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to her side. Whether she&apos;s negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking her way out of trouble, her confidence and charm make it hard to say no. Dragana moves with deadly precision once she&apos;s actually in the fight - but getting to that point is another story. Tripping over her own boots, misjudging doorways, and misfiring controls are just part of the package. &quot;I&apos;m great under pressure. Getting there&apos;s the problem.&quot; </personalityDescription>
