			<personalityDescription>Once Lada sets her sights on something, there&apos;s no shaking her. She&apos;ll keep coming, keep working, and keep fighting long after others would have given up, proving that sheer force of will can sometimes be the most dangerous weapon of all. Lada has a way of making everyone feel welcome. Whether it&apos;s a rookie looking for guidance or an old rival at a bar, her easygoing nature and open demeanor put people at ease, breaking down walls before they&apos;re even built. </personalityDescription>
