			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Rory doesn&apos;t believe in waiting for the right moment - they make the moment right. Their determination fuels everything they do, propelling them forward no matter the obstacles in their way. Rory&apos;s hands never stop moving - because if they do, they might remember. Remember the times they couldn&apos;t signal for help, when orders were lost in the chaos, when a simple gesture could&apos;ve saved someone but didn&apos;t come in time. They talk with their hands because the alternative is letting them be still - and stillness brings nothing but ghosts. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t wait for chances - builds them. Momentum is the fuel.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
