			<personalityDescription>Irutxeta isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - she simply doesn&apos;t think about them. She jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for her, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. Irutxeta doesn&apos;t care about honor, mercy, or sentiment - only results. She dissects every situation with ruthless precision, seeing people as assets, obstacles, or liabilities. If a sacrifice needs to be made, she won&apos;t hesitate to pull the trigger. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No thoughts of consequence. Laughs at disaster, races toward it.&lt;br&gt;- Values results over sentiment. Cold strategist - sacrifices without pause.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
