			<personalityDescription>Pippo charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. He believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. Pippo doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer him something in return. His survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. </personalityDescription>
