			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Angell - it&apos;s an obsession. She sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in her relentless pursuit of fortune. People rally behind Angell because she makes them believe. Her confidence, determination, and unwavering presence push others to go beyond their limits, knowing that if she&apos;s leading, victory feels possible. </personalityDescription>
