			<personalityDescription>Liberaratore acts before thinking, always ready to throw himself into a fight at the slightest provocation. Patience isn&apos;t his strong suit, and keeping Liberaratore in check is often as dangerous as facing the enemy. Liberaratore doesn&apos;t fight in silence - he fights with pure, raw energy. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into combat or firing a devastating salvo, he lets out a gut-wrenching, primal scream. &quot;If you&apos;re not shouting, you&apos;re not really in the fight!&quot; </personalityDescription>
