			<personalityDescription>Dragutin doesn&apos;t waste time on emotions or sentiment - only results matter. He makes hard choices without hesitation, cutting losses when needed and sacrificing whatever is necessary to secure long-term success. Dragutin always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. He might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cold logic, no heart. Cuts losses like dead limbs.&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
