			<personalityDescription>Jim has a knack for turning every situation into a payday. Whether it&apos;s salvage rights, lucrative contracts, or well-placed investments, he always finds a way to make sure his time and effort result in cold, hard cash. Jim preps his weapons the exact same way before every mission. Field strips, recalibrates, reloads-even if they don&apos;t need it. &quot;Why do you keep doing that?&quot; someone asks. He shrugs. &quot;Routine keeps you sharp.&quot; What he doesn&apos;t say? Without it, the battlefield feels too unpredictable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always walks away with more than they came in with. Smiles while others scrape.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
