			<personalityDescription>Gail doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights or noble causes. They shift alliances, bend the truth, and rewrite the rules as they go, ensuring that no matter what happens, they&apos;re the one who wins. Gail doesn&apos;t bark commands, doesn&apos;t dictate tactics - they just move with purpose, and people follow. They set an example, make decisions without making a show of it, and somehow, their squad ends up doing exactly what needs to be done. &quot;I didn&apos;t tell you what to do,&quot; they shrug. &quot;You just figured it out.&quot; </personalityDescription>
