			<personalityDescription>Ricarda never acts on impulse - every move she makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, she plays the long game, ensuring she always comes out ahead. Incoming fire? Ricarda smiles. A brutal melee? She&apos;s grinning. No one knows if it&apos;s nerves, confidence, or just something deeply wrong with her, but when the fight gets ugly, her smile only gets wider. Her squad isn&apos;t sure whether it&apos;s reassuring or deeply unsettling. </personalityDescription>
