			<personalityDescription>In Vedette&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. She seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. &quot;What if the drop zone is compromised? What if the intel is wrong?&quot; &quot;What if we don&apos;t have enough ammo?&quot; Vedette&apos;s mind never stops calculating risks, even when they&apos;re already in the fight. Her squad tries to reassure her, but the way she keeps checking her weapon makes it clear - she&apos;s already expecting the worst. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees kindness as weakness. Destroys problems before they form.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
