			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for doubt in Melita&apos;s world - she already knows she&apos;s right. She speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of her valuable time. Melita wakes up some nights with her hands shaking, convinced she can still feel something breathing against her skin. She doesn&apos;t know if it&apos;s the nightmares or something worse bleeding through the cracks of reality. &quot;It&apos;s not just a dream. I know what I saw.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t listen. Speaks like a prophet, ignores dissent like noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
