			<personalityDescription>Ludmila has a natural ability to sense what others are feeling. She listens without judgment, offers genuine support, and always seems to know exactly what someone needs to hear - whether they realize it or not. &quot;That&apos;s a snake plant. Tough as hell, doesn&apos;t need much, survives in low light. Kind of like us.&quot; Ludmila&apos;s the type to compare a campaign to crop rotation and an ambush to invasive species competition. Her squad has learned to just nod along when she starts explaining plant biology mid-patrol. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads people like a book. Knows when to speak - and when not to.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
