			<performanceExamScore>45</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Betty plays to win, and she doesn&apos;t care how messy it gets. Whether it&apos;s business, politics, or the battlefield, she exploits weaknesses, eliminates competition, and ensures she&apos;s the last one standing - no matter the cost. Betty doesn&apos;t just use her equipment - she abuses it. She pushes everything past its rated limits, just to find out where they break. &quot;If it fails now, that means it would&apos;ve failed in combat.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays dirty, wins clean. Eliminates threats without blinking - cost is irrelevant.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
