			<personalityDescription>Linda moves like they&apos;ve got an internal reactor running at full burn. Whether it&apos;s work, combat, or downtime, they tackle everything with relentless enthusiasm, always ready for the next challenge. Crowds fuel them. Linda enjoys the spotlight, telling the best stories, leading the wildest celebrations, and making sure everyone is having a good time. If there&apos;s action, they&apos;re in the middle of it, keeping the momentum alive. </personalityDescription>
