			<personalityDescription>Graham doesn&apos;t just look down on others - he barely acknowledges them. He sees himself as superior in every way, treating allies as tools and enemies as annoyances. If someone disagrees with him, it&apos;s because they&apos;re too stupid to understand why he&apos;s right. Graham doesn&apos;t waste time on moral debates - he does what needs to be done. If that means breaking promises, cutting corners, or stepping over someone to get ahead, so be it. </personalityDescription>
