			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as overconfidence in Panthea&apos;s mind. Whether she&apos;s got the skills to back it up or not is irrelevant - she steps into every situation like she&apos;s already won and lets reality catch up later. Panthea&apos;s energy is contagious. She has a way of making even the worst situations seem manageable, keeping morale high with a well-timed joke, an inspiring speech, or a simple &quot;You&apos;ve got this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
