			<personalityDescription>The world can throw everything it has at Susie, and she&apos;ll still keep going. Her strength isn&apos;t in speed or skill alone, but in sheer refusal to accept defeat, no matter how far the odds are stacked against her. Susie struts through every situation with an air of undeniable superiority, convinced that her mere presence guarantees victory. Her self-assurance borders on arrogance, leaving little room for any doubts - even when caution would be wise. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps going no matter the odds. Wins by outlasting.&lt;br&gt;- Believes presence alone guarantees victory. Confidence smothers caution.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
