			<personalityDescription>For Hadiya, hesitation is just another form of failure. She throws herself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, she never slows down. Hadiya feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around her. It weighs on her, but she refuses to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. </personalityDescription>
