			<personalityDescription>Bryan says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. Bryan always double-checks the locks. If someone says a door is sealed, he&apos;ll check anyway. If someone insists an override is definitely disabled, he&apos;ll still run his test. It&apos;s not personal - he just knows better than to trust assumptions. </personalityDescription>
