			<personalityDescription>Krista doesn&apos;t waste time with hesitation - once a decision is made, she commits fully. On the battlefield, she acts with precision and confidence, knowing that in the chaos of war, a fast decision is often better than a perfect one. Krista&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s her ability to manipulate. She spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, she&apos;s already taken what she wanted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commits fast, no waffling. Values momentum over precision. Trusts instinct.&lt;br&gt;- Lies like breathing. By the time truth lands, they&apos;re long gone and richer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
