			<personalityDescription>Alegra doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. Alegra doesn&apos;t do calm. Even when things aren&apos;t urgent, she&apos;s tense, wired, ready to react. Every noise, every movement, every shift on the battlefield is something she&apos;s already preparing for. &quot;Relax? We&apos;re in a warzone. Relax after we survive.&quot; </personalityDescription>
