			<personalityDescription>The line between confidence and recklessness is one Raquel never bothers to acknowledge. They act on impulse, ignores warnings, and barrel forward at full speed, trusting that they&apos;ll figure things out before it&apos;s too late. Raquel doesn&apos;t waste time on moral debates - they do what needs to be done. If that means breaking promises, cutting corners, or stepping over someone to get ahead, so be it. </personalityDescription>
