			<personalityDescription>Selina locks onto her objectives with laser precision. Distractions, doubts, and setbacks don&apos;t faze her - once she set her sights on something, she follows through until the job is done. Caring is a curse Selina can&apos;t shake. She feels the weight of every loss, every sacrifice, and every person she couldn&apos;t save. No matter how much it hurts, she refuses to stop trying - because if she does, she&apos;s no better than the monsters she fights. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 38%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Locks in on goals and doesn&apos;t let go. Setbacks don&apos;t register - only results.&lt;br&gt;- Hurts with every loss. Still shows up. Still cares.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
