			<personalityDescription>Rules, plans, and decisions are set in stone as far as Mona is concerned. She follows them without question and expects everyone else to do the same, regardless of the circumstances. To Mona, every situation holds potential - she just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into her gain, she never lets an opening go to waste. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rules are law. Doesn&apos;t adjust for context. Orders must be obeyed.&lt;br&gt;- Treats crisis as currency. Turns every shift into personal gain.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
