			<personalityDescription>Awareness is Hervé&apos;s greatest weapon. He reads people like a battlefield, catching the smallest shifts in expression or intent, ensuring he&apos;s never the one taken by surprise. Hervé can talk to anyone and make them feel like an old friend. His charm, humor, and ability to find common ground make him the kind of person others naturally gravitate toward, whether he&apos;s leading a unit or sharing a drink. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads people like terrain. Sees the shift before the strike.&lt;br&gt;- Uses charm like armor - might be hiding something deeper.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
