			<personalityDescription>Ramziyya believes that hesitation is just another way to lose. She trusts her instincts, makes the call, and commits fully - because in her mind, the worst decision is no decision at all. No matter how bleak things get, Ramziyya refuses to let doubt take hold. She reminds her unit why they fight, why they push forward, and why they can&apos;t afford to give up - because in her mind, defeat is only a state of mind. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts instincts over perfection. Believes any action is better than none.&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to let despair settle in. Might be the reason the line holds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
