			<personalityDescription>John never forgets a slight, no matter how small. Whether it&apos;s a lost bet, a sarcastic remark, or someone taking his favorite mug, he finds ways to get back at people - usually with just enough humor to keep it from being outright malicious. John doesn&apos;t complain about food because he&apos;s been through worse. He&apos;s starved before. He&apos;s had weeks where meals weren&apos;t an option. So if it&apos;s even remotely edible, he eats it - because he knows what it&apos;s like when there&apos;s nothing left to eat at all. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Holds a grudge tighter than a cockpit harness.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
