			<personalityDescription>Hanskarl makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through his unshakable resolve, his fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where he reminds someone of their worth, he sparks hope in even the darkest times. Hanskarl eats for survival, not pleasure. He&apos;ll consume anything that keeps him moving, from high-energy nutrient bricks to mysterious battlefield leftovers. &quot;Food is fuel,&quot; he shrugs, gnawing on something vaguely resembling jerky. &quot;Doesn&apos;t matter what it is as long as it works.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 28%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Even the cynics listen to them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
