			<personalityDescription>Some call it bravery, others call it stubbornness, but Adam simply sees it as doing what needs to be done. No matter the stakes, no matter the danger, He refuses to take a step back when it matters most. Once Adam sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no shaking him. He&apos;ll keep coming, keep working, and keep fighting long after others would have given up, proving that sheer force of will can sometimes be the most dangerous weapon of all. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stubborn courage. Holds ground when others retreat. Reliable in critical moments.&lt;br&gt;- Once committed, won&apos;t let go. Willpower becomes weapon.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
