			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Patrick doesn&apos;t trust anyone to provide for him, so he keeps everything for himself. Every credit, every round of ammo, every salvageable scrap is hidden away because he knows that when things go bad, only those who&apos;ve prepared will survive. Patrick doesn&apos;t see gray areas or moral debates. He sees right and wrong, us and them. The enemy isn&apos;t just someone on the other side - they&apos;re a stain that needs to be wiped out. &quot;I don&apos;t want to hear about &apos;understanding them.&apos; I want to hear that they&apos;re dead.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Survivalist mindset. Would rather let others go without than run dry.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
