			<personalityDescription>Enrique lives life on his own terms, never second-guessing himself or feeling bad for taking risks. He&apos;ll say what others won&apos;t, do what others fear, and walk away grinning, no matter the fallout. Enrique has seen enough ambushes, enough betrayals, enough slaughter to know that noise only makes you a target. He doesn&apos;t move loudly because he still wants to be alive at the end of the day. &quot;The moment they hear you, they&apos;ve already decided you&apos;re dead.&quot; </personalityDescription>
