			<personalityDescription>Brita doesn&apos;t just react to situations - she creates them. She manipulates events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering her way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing her game all along. Brita weaves lies so seamlessly into the truth that even she might start believing them. From forged documents to fabricated histories, she&apos;s built her success on smoke and mirrors, always staying one step ahead of the truth. </personalityDescription>
