			<personalityDescription>Henrika doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer her something in return. Her survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. Henrika isn&apos;t just skeptical - she&apos;s haunted by past failures. The cutting-edge weapons that jammed, the prototype that failed, the experimental implants that fried their users from the inside out. She doesn&apos;t hate innovation - she just knows that in war, new means untested, and untested means deadly. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- If it doesn&apos;t benefit them, they&apos;re not interested - period.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
