			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fire in Toshi&apos;s eyes that never dims, a relentless drive that refuses to acknowledge limits. Whether facing a challenge or simply making her presence known, she moves through life like she&apos;s already won. Toshi fights hard, fast, aggressive - but it never feels natural. There&apos;s a hesitation in her movements, a disconnect between body and instinct, like she&apos;s piloting herself instead of simply existing. &quot;I move because standing still feels worse.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fire-eyed. Acts like the outcome&apos;s already certain - and it favors them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
