			<personalityDescription>Awareness is Aili&apos;s greatest weapon. She reads people like a battlefield, catching the smallest shifts in expression or intent, ensuring she&apos;s never the one taken by surprise. Aili makes it seem like she&apos;s a team player, but everything she does is carefully crafted to benefit herself first. She&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for her, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the one standing on top. </personalityDescription>
