			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Hsuang-tsung&apos;s world. He steps forward without looking back, his decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether he&apos;s right or wrong, he never lingers in uncertainty. Hsuang-tsung is convinced he can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. He stretches himself thin, takes on risks he shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether he can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of his vocabulary. Yet. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;br&gt;- Thinks confidence replaces planning. Runs headfirst into collapse.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
