			<personalityDescription>Sabra makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through their unshakable resolve, their fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where they remind someone of their worth, they spark hope in even the darkest times. Sabra&apos;s habit of making clothes started after too many cold nights, too many friends without enough gear. If they can&apos;t keep them alive in a fight, the least they can do is keep them warm after. &quot;You wear it, you remember why you survived. And you don&apos;t waste it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Even the cynics listen to them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
