			<personalityDescription>Donald&apos;s energy is impossible to ignore. He drives conversations, sparks ideas, and keeps people moving, his sheer momentum pulling others along whether they&apos;re ready or not. Donald&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just his skill, but his ability to think. He sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when he moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. </personalityDescription>
