			<personalityDescription>Gaylene always puts herself first. Whether it&apos;s resources, recognition, or survival, she makes sure she comes out on top - even if it means leaving others behind. Crowds fuel her. Gaylene enjoys the spotlight, telling the best stories, leading the wildest celebrations, and making sure everyone is having a good time. If there&apos;s action, she&apos;s in the middle of it, keeping the momentum alive. </personalityDescription>
