			<personalityDescription>Fakhruddin moves through life with absolute certainty, his presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When he speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Fakhruddin doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only results. He&apos;ll lie, cheat, steal, and betray without a second thought if it serves his interests. If someone expected honor or fairness from him, they were already doomed to fail. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commands attention by presence alone. No showmanship - just certainty.&lt;br&gt;- No loyalty, no hesitation - if it helps, they&apos;ll do it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
