			<personalityDescription>Electra doesn&apos;t waste time with indecision or second-guessing - they make the call and expects others to keep up. Electra isn&apos;t rude, just efficient - after all, in the heat of battle, clear orders save lives. Crowds fuel them. Electra enjoys the spotlight, telling the best stories, leading the wildest celebrations, and making sure everyone is having a good time. If there&apos;s action, they&apos;re in the middle of it, keeping the momentum alive. </personalityDescription>
