			<personalityDescription>Minerva approaches everything with methodical precision. She doesn&apos;t believe in shortcuts or luck - only in putting in the work, refining her craft, and ensuring that she never leaves anything to chance. Minerva has an instinct for reading between the lines. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield, a business deal, or a negotiation, she sees angles others miss and exploits them before anyone realizes what&apos;s happening. </personalityDescription>
