			<personalityDescription>Dan isn&apos;t just tough - he&apos;s unshakable. Setbacks don&apos;t discourage him, and suffering doesn&apos;t slow him down. He keeps pushing forward, no matter how much it hurts, because giving up simply isn&apos;t an option. Dan never forgets a slight, no matter how small. Whether it&apos;s a lost bet, a sarcastic remark, or someone taking his favorite mug, he finds ways to get back at people - usually with just enough humor to keep it from being outright malicious. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unshakable. Keeps pushing - giving up isn&apos;t in the vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Holds a grudge tighter than a cockpit harness.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
