			<personalityDescription>Hashim makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through his unshakable resolve, his fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where he reminds someone of their worth, he sparks hope in even the darkest times. Hashim has hidden stockpiles everywhere. Rations in the storage bay, extra weapons in unmarked crates, an escape route planned for any disaster. People think he&apos;s paranoid - until the first real crisis hits. &quot;What do you mean you didn&apos;t pack three months&apos; worth of emergency food?&quot; </personalityDescription>
