			<personalityDescription>Maddelena doesn&apos;t just react to situations - they create them. They manipulate events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering their way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing their game all along. Maddelena isn&apos;t just prepared - they&apos;re ready for everything. Because they&apos;ve seen what happens when people aren&apos;t. The last time someone forgot to check their equipment, they didn&apos;t come back. The last time a squad got sloppy, they left a graveyard behind. They won&apos;t make those mistakes. They can&apos;t afford to. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 36%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pulls strings from the dark. Never in the spotlight, always in control.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
