			<personalityDescription>Bodgana plays to win, and she doesn&apos;t care how messy it gets. Whether it&apos;s business, politics, or the battlefield, she exploits weaknesses, eliminates competition, and ensures she&apos;s the last one standing - no matter the cost. Bodgana has an instinct for reading between the lines. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield, a business deal, or a negotiation, she sees angles others miss and exploits them before anyone realizes what&apos;s happening. </personalityDescription>
