			<personalityDescription>Adriaan&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. He adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in his favor. Adriaan doesn&apos;t waste a single calorie. Every meal is planned, every extra bite stored for later. While others celebrate after a mission with a feast, Adriaan quietly pockets leftovers. &quot;Might need it later,&quot; he mutters. His squad jokes about it - until they&apos;re starving behind enemy lines and he&apos;s the only one still eating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into leverage without blinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
