			<personalityDescription>In a brutal world where hope is a rare commodity, Ross refuses to let it die. Even when everything is crumbling, their words, actions, and sheer force of will remind others that there&apos;s still something worth fighting for. Before every battle, Ross insists on running a final check. Formation assignments? Confirmed. Backup comms? Verified. Extraction routes? Plotted and re-plotted. &quot;The battlefield is messy enough,&quot; they mutter. &quot;No reason we have to be.&quot; The others may roll their eyes, but when things go wrong, their plans are why they make it out alive. </personalityDescription>
