			<personalityDescription>Death is always a step behind, but Lucie refuses to run. They faces down overwhelming odds with grim determination, knowing that if they fall, it will be on Lucie&apos;s  terms, with a smoking battlefield left in their wake. Every move Lucie makes is intentional. They never fight just for the sake of it - they maneuver, control engagements, and dictate the pace of battle, making sure every skirmish ends on their terms. </personalityDescription>
