			<personalityDescription>Some call it persistence, others call it sheer stubbornness - Kang-chor just calls it doing what needs to be done. He doesn&apos;t waste time complaining or doubting; he simply pushes forward until the job is finished. Kang-chor has an instinct for reading between the lines. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield, a business deal, or a negotiation, he sees angles others miss and exploits them before anyone realizes what&apos;s happening. </personalityDescription>
