			<personalityDescription>Michele doesn&apos;t just want success - she demands it. She climbs over anyone in her way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In her mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Michele approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. She doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. </personalityDescription>
