			<personalityDescription>Once Crystal sets her sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping her. She thrives on momentum, constantly pushing herself and those around her to reach new heights. Quick-thinking and perceptive, Crystal sees the angles others miss. Whether she&apos;s navigating a battlefield or a negotiation, her ability to read the room and adjust makes her a force to be reckoned with. </personalityDescription>
