			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as half-measures with Tom. Everything he does is full-throttle, fueled by relentless determination and an unwillingness to accept anything less than total victory. Tom has zero food standards. Expired rations? Still good. Field scavenged supplies? Edible. Some questionable protein paste found in a destroyed base? &quot;If it doesn&apos;t kill me, it&apos;s food.&quot; His squad is horrified - he doesn&apos;t even hesitate before taking a bite. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Zero moderation. All-in, every time. Victory or wreckage.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
