			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>To Huda, every situation is a battlefield, and she plays it like a master tactician. She anticipates actions before they happen, positioning herself for success while others struggle to keep up. Huda&apos;s compliments aren&apos;t just encouragement. They&apos;re last words in disguise. She wants the last thing someone hears before they die to be something good. Her squad knows that when she stops fighting to say, &quot;You really handled that situation well,&quot; it means she doesn&apos;t think they&apos;re making it out alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats life like a wargame. Makes moves - doesn&apos;t take chances.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
