			<personalityDescription>Mayukhi doesn&apos;t believe in &quot;too much.&quot; Her personal stores overflow with spare parts, rations, and hidden stashes of wealth; all tucked away where no one else can get to them. When scarcity comes knocking, she&apos;ll be the one still standing. Mayukhi doesn&apos;t waste time on people or ideas she deems unimportant. If she thinks someone&apos;s opinion is useless, she brushes them off without a second thought and moves forward on her own terms. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t believe in &quot;enough.&quot; Everything not claimed is a future asset.&lt;br&gt;- Brushes off anything that doesn&apos;t serve immediate purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
