			<personalityDescription>Camilla doesn&apos;t believe in second chances or sentimental attachments. If someone can&apos;t keep up, they&apos;re left behind. She sees emotions as liabilities, and nothing - not guilt, grief, or regret - will slow her down. Camilla is at her best when the sun&apos;s down. While the rest of the squad struggles through late-night operations, she&apos;s fully alert, reacting faster, making sharper calls. &quot;Midnight raids, night drops, stealth ops? That&apos;s my time to shine,&quot; she says, adjusting her visor. Some wonder if she even sleeps - or if she just waits for daylight to pass. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 84%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Past the point of caring. Job gets done. That&apos;s all.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
