			<personalityDescription>Mitch sees the universe as one giant stockpile, and he&apos;s determined to take the biggest share. Every resource and every opportunity is something to be claimed, and he refuses to be left wanting. If Mitch&apos;s on your side today, don&apos;t count on him tomorrow. He&apos;s an expert at playing both sides, shifting allegiances, and making sure he always lands on top - no matter who he has to betray. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees the galaxy as a buffet - won&apos;t leave until the table&apos;s cleared.&lt;br&gt;- Bet on them betraying you. The only sure thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
