			<personalityDescription>Once Jorge sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping him. He thrives on momentum, constantly pushing himself and those around him to reach new heights. Jorge doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. He sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if he has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
