			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Olkben doesn&apos;t just take charge - she demands it. Every situation must unfold according to her design, and she has little patience for anyone who questions her authority. Olkben never lets the chaos of battle stop her from throwing in a well-timed flirt. Explosions in the background? Enemy fire raining down? She&apos;s still casually complimenting someone&apos;s voice over the comms. &quot;You know, if we survive this, you owe me dinner for saving your ass just now.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Authority is non-negotiable. No tolerance for dissent.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
