			<personalityDescription>Samantha doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. They weave half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while they walk away unscathed - and usually richer. Samantha has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. They get frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding their annoyance. </personalityDescription>
