			<personalityDescription>Sweeney sees every conflict as a failure long before the first shot is fired. He believes in finding solutions beyond violence, even when surrounded by those who see war as the only answer. Sweeney always has a target in mind, and he won&apos;t stop until he reaches it. Every move he makes is another step toward his objective, and he doesn&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t get him closer to success. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats conflict as preventable. Stands against a tide of warmongers.&lt;br&gt;- Eyes on the target. Won&apos;t waste time on anything that doesn&apos;t move the needle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
