			<personalityDescription>Makabee refuses to back down, no matter the circumstances. Once they set their mind on something, there&apos;s no changing it - whether that&apos;s holding the line in battle or refusing to admit they were wrong. Makabee enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, they see no reason to deny themself what they desire. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t back down, even when wrong. Holds the line - and the grudge.&lt;br&gt;- No impulse control - if they want it, they take it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
