			<personalityDescription>Patricia always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear she thinks she&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, she has a way of making others feel small without ever raising her voice. Patricia doesn&apos;t just want to win - she needs to. When things get desperate, she doesn&apos;t hesitate. She&apos;ll break rules, take risks no sane person would, leave others behind if it means claiming victory. Because in the end, in war, second place is just another name for dead. </personalityDescription>
