			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Tesfaye refuses to be either. He rushes headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Tesfaye never stands still. Tesfaye lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, he never slows down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Speed over safety. Bravery or recklessness - depends on the day.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t hit the brakes - doesn&apos;t know they exist.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
