			<personalityDescription>Erwin has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. He can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get his way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where he wants them to go. Erwin has seen too many people abuse their gear, rush their startup sequences, ignore the warning hum of a system under stress. He refuses to do the same. &quot;You listen to it, you learn from it, and it will take care of you in return.&quot; </personalityDescription>
