			<personalityDescription>Naofumi doesn&apos;t believe in playing it safe. He thrives on risk, constantly pushing limits and daring fate to keep up - because to him, caution is just another word for hesitation. Naofumi is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. He looks out for his allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. </personalityDescription>
