			<personalityDescription>Sasha never doubts herself, even when she absolutely should. She struts into battle like she&apos;s already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions her skills, she&apos;ll be the first to bet her wages on proving them wrong. Survival depends on knowing when to listen. Sasha watches, absorbs, and learns from everything around her, filtering out noise and focusing only on what will keep her ahead of the game. </personalityDescription>
