			<personalityDescription>No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Johnny tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. They refuse to play politics or pretend to be something they aren&apos;t, even if it makes them enemies. Long shifts, tight deadlines, and endless problems - Johnny copes by folding. A few seconds between tasks, a break between work cycles, even during long meetings, their fingers move, folding something small, something precise. It doesn&apos;t interfere with their work. If anything, it seems to help them focus. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Tells the truth even when it hurts. Especially when it hurts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
