			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Hanna&apos;s eyes. She meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in her way is just another problem to crush. Hanna has a sharp mind and a quick understanding of how things work. Whether it&apos;s battlefield tactics, business deals, or reading people, she picks up on the important details fast and uses them to her advantage. </personalityDescription>
