			<personalityDescription>De-wei doesn&apos;t just think ahead - he sees ahead. He plays the long game, maneuvering people and events to his advantage, making sure every move he makes strengthens his position while others scramble to keep up. De-wei doesn&apos;t just avoid conflict - he redirects it. A well-placed phrase, a subtle shift in tone, or a carefully chosen silence can turn an argument into an opportunity, ensuring that things go his way without force. </personalityDescription>
