			<personalityDescription>Catherine doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - they believe in winning. They bend, break, and rewrite the rules to suit their needs, making sure that when the dust settles, they&apos;re the only one left standing. Catherine sees every situation as a business opportunity. If there&apos;s money to be made, they&apos;re already working the angles, cutting deals, and making sure they walk away with the biggest share - preferably at someone else&apos;s expense. </personalityDescription>
