			<personalityDescription>In a ruthless world, Kazimierz refuses to become another heartless warrior. He watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs him. The weight of every choice lingers in his mind, but he&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. No matter where he is, Kazimierz can&apos;t stop apologizing. He&apos;ll say &quot;Sorry&quot; for calling a warning too late, for calling it too early, for asking a question, and sometimes just for existing. He fights hard, but his squad suspects he&apos;d apologize to an inbound PPC if given the chance. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
