			<personalityDescription>Laura never gives a straight answer. They dodge questions, avoid commitments, and keep people guessing about where they really stands. It&apos;s not outright lying - it&apos;s just never letting anyone get close enough to see the truth. Laura keeps their hands busy because if they stop, their mind wanders. Back to the names they&apos;ve crossed out. Back to the missions that went wrong. So they spin the pen. Over and over. Faster. Slower. Anything to keep their fingers moving, to keep the silence from creeping in. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never commits. Just enough truth to stay slippery.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
