			<personalityDescription>Cari always puts herself first. Whether it&apos;s resources, recognition, or survival, she makes sure she comes out on top - even if it means leaving others behind. Cari&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as her ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, she indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Comes first, stays first - everyone else is just background noise.&lt;br&gt;- Treats vice like victory. Always hunting the next high.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
