			<personalityDescription>To Zak, war is not just necessary - it is a craving, an addiction that only destruction can satisfy. They take no prisoners, showing no mercy, and relishes the moment an enemy&apos;s &apos;Mek crumples under their relentless assault. Zak doesn&apos;t just keep up - they stay ahead. They spot angles others miss, adapt on the fly, and always seem to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. </personalityDescription>
