			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Andrea has no interest in. She keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in her world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Andrea is always working an angle, always looking for a way to manipulate the situation to her advantage. She plays people like a chessboard, making sure they never realize they were just another piece in her game. </personalityDescription>
