			<personalityDescription>Nothing satisfies Kveta for long. She hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand her fortune - no matter the cost to those around her. Most people aren&apos;t worth Kveta&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how she sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath her notice, she brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
