			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, even death - none of it matters. Shun&apos;ichi will see their mission through to the bitter end, no matter the cost. Stubbornness and sheer willpower keep them standing long after others have fallen. Honesty is a tool Shun&apos;ichi only uses when it suits them. They weave deception effortlessly, leaving people second-guessing what&apos;s real and what&apos;s just another one of their carefully constructed falsehoods. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pain means nothing. Mission above all. Stands long after support falls.&lt;br&gt;- Only honest when it helps. Leaves allies guessing whats real.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
