			<performanceExamScore>45</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Gerwazy says what they mean and means what they say. They don&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - their words and actions come from a place of honesty, making them a rare presence in a world full of deception. Gerwazy doesn&apos;t hate without reason. They&apos;ve seen the ruins, the bodies, the aftermath of what the enemy has done. They don&apos;t fight for glory - they fight for revenge. &quot;You don&apos;t &apos;negotiate&apos; with butchers. You make sure they never get the chance to do it again.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
