			<personalityDescription>Manyura adapts faster than anyone else. She thrives in unpredictability, adjusting her approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes her way - no matter who gets left behind. Manyura has seen too many people die waiting for a solution instead of making one. She refuses to be one of them. If something needs fixing, if a problem needs solving, she will find a way, no matter what it takes. &quot;We can wait for a miracle, or we can make one. Your call.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrives in chaos. Adapts instantly, leaves others scrambling to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
