			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Ryan refuses to bend. He will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in his mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. While others waste time with diplomacy, Ryan gets straight to the point. He values efficiency over politeness and doesn&apos;t believe in dancing around the truth. Some find his approach refreshing - others just find it frustrating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;br&gt;- Talks like time is short and patience shorter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
