			<personalityDescription>Diana doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if she&apos;s daring the world to give her a reason to lash out. Diana doesn&apos;t just hear people - she understands them. She picks up on the emotions others try to hide, offering quiet reassurances or firm guidance exactly when they need it most. </personalityDescription>
