			<personalityDescription>For Kristine, compromise is just another word for weakness. She sticks to her principles, strategies, and orders with unwavering determination, even when logic - or survival - suggests a different path. Kristine&apos;s drive is more than ambition - it&apos;s an unshakable force. She doesn&apos;t just work hard; she outworks everyone, refusing to rest until she&apos;s accomplished what she set out to do. </personalityDescription>
