			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Conrad is probably already doing it. He doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - he buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Conrad operates with a singular, unyielding drive. Whether it&apos;s perfecting his skills or executing a plan, he devotes himself completely, unwilling to let anything stand in his way. </personalityDescription>
