			<personalityDescription>Patience has never been Agnes&apos;s strong suit. She leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, her restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - she lives for action, for motion, for doing something. No matter the cost, Agnes refuses to let her allies fall. She pushes herself to exhaustion, takes risks no one else will, and puts others before herself - even when it means she&apos;s the one left bleeding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds for others, and wont stop until everyones safe.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
