			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a bad idea, Akemi will be the first to try it. She hates waiting, hates planning, and definitely hates being told to slow down - because she always believes the best way forward is straight through the enemy. When others falter, Akemi keeps moving. She refuses to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. </personalityDescription>
