			<personalityDescription>To Siraj, every situation holds potential - he just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into his gain, he never lets an opening go to waste. Siraj believes in results, not feelings. He dismisses emotions as distractions and refuses to waste time comforting others. To him, facts, logic, and action matter - sympathy does not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats crisis as currency. Turns every shift into personal gain.&lt;br&gt;- No room for grief. Moves on before the body hits the ground.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
