			<personalityDescription>Jasmyn doesn&apos;t believe in overthinking - if an idea crosses their mind, it&apos;s already halfway to reality. Every decision is made in the moment, with no time wasted on doubt or second-guessing. Every move Jasmyn makes is deliberate. They calculate risks, anticipate outcomes, and manipulate situations with ease, ensuring that no matter what happens, they&apos;re always in control. </personalityDescription>
