			<personalityDescription>Indecision is just another form of weakness, and Milena refuses to entertain it. She makes the call, moves forward, and never looks back - because in the brutal reality of war, second-guessing gets people killed. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Milena knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what she wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
