			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Pramila has no patience for nonsense. She cuts through distractions and emotions, keeping her mind locked onto the mission. While others get lost in doubt or debate, she moves forward with ruthless efficiency. Pramila isn&apos;t just skilled - she&apos;s honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake she won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Pramila&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping her alive. </personalityDescription>
