			<personalityDescription>Onfrio charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. He believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. Onfrio doesn&apos;t just win fights - he ensures absolute destruction. Whether it&apos;s an enemy force or an already-crippled target, he keeps firing. &quot;If there&apos;s still salvage left, I obviously didn&apos;t fire enough.&quot; </personalityDescription>
