			<personalityDescription>To Daisy, control isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. She demands obedience and tolerates no weakness, bending others to her will through sheer force of personality or, if needed, raw intimidation. Daisy doesn&apos;t waste time on fair deals when an unfair one gets her more. She plays on desperation, weaknesses, and ambition, twisting every situation to ensure that, in the end, Daisy is the one who profits most. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Controls through pressure or intimidation. Weakness is punished.&lt;br&gt;- If theres a win to be had, they&apos;ll take the lion&apos;s share and call it fair.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
