			<personalityDescription>Henrik has a gift for understanding situations at a glance, spotting the key players and seeing paths to victory that others overlook. Whether in strategy, diplomacy, or battle, his ability to read the moment gives him an undeniable edge. Henrik treats pronouns like any other battlefield precision - you don&apos;t mess them up. He&apos;ll make a correction without missing a beat, right alongside calling out enemy positions or tactical shifts. &quot;Enemy at your nine o&apos;clock, fallback route is clear, and you misgendered them again - fix it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategic sixth sense. Finds the leverage before the rest of us even blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
