			<personalityDescription>The line between confidence and recklessness is one Shouket never bothers to acknowledge. He acts on impulse, ignores warnings, and barrels forward at full speed, trusting that he&apos;ll figure things out before it&apos;s too late. Shouket picks up on unspoken words and subtle cues, adjusting his approach based on the emotions and ideas of those around him. His ability to read people makes him an effective leader, negotiator, and ally. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t care if it&apos;s reckless - just that it&apos;s fast and loud.&lt;br&gt;- Reads the room better than the brief.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
