			<personalityDescription>Brandon doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - he&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. He&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw his way to the top, no matter who gets in his way. Brandon knows that persuasion isn&apos;t just about words - it&apos;s about presence. A well-timed silence, a knowing look, a carefully measured response - all of it works together to make sure, by the end of the conversation, he gets exactly what he wants. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t talk at you - talks through you.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
