			<personalityDescription>No matter how hardened the universe tries to make them, Floyd refuses to shut themself off from others. They carry their burdens as if they were their own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. Floyd doesn&apos;t just wake up early - they need to. They&apos;ve seen too many people go to sleep and never wake up again. They refuse to waste a single morning, because every sunrise might be the last one they see. </personalityDescription>
