			<personalityDescription>Albertine treats the impossible like an invitation. She never slows down, never looks back, and never lets fear dictate her choices - because, to her, fear is just an excuse she refuses to entertain. Albertine has no patience for obstacles - she removes them. Promotions, power, and prestige don&apos;t come to those who wait; they go to those who take them, and Albertine fully intends to claim what she believes is her. </personalityDescription>
