			<personalityDescription>Mukhtar has a sharp eye for opportunities and a mind built for strategy. He quickly size up situations, makes smart decisions, and always seems to be one step ahead of the competition. Mukhtar doesn&apos;t believe in titles. The lead mechanic is &apos;Grease,&apos; the MedTech is &apos;Patches,&apos; and the newest recruit is &apos;Grass&apos; until they earn something better. It&apos;s all part of the company&apos;s culture now - at this point, even he probably doesn&apos;t remember their real names. </personalityDescription>
