			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Michelle doesn&apos;t just take charge - she demands it. Every situation must unfold according to her design, and she has little patience for anyone who questions her authority. Michelle doesn&apos;t see convoy missions as boring logistics - she sees them as a real test of skill. Protecting a moving force, managing ambush points, bottlenecks, and chokepoints - to her, that&apos;s the real game. &quot;Stationary fights are predictable. Convoy missions? That&apos;s where you prove you know what you&apos;re doing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Authority is non-negotiable. No tolerance for dissent.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
