			<personalityDescription>Steve doesn&apos;t just take charge - he owns every situation he steps into. His presence alone demands compliance, and he has little patience for those who hesitate to fall in line. Steve knows that power isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s taken. He maneuvers people like game pieces, striking deals with one hand and slipping a dagger in with the other. If there&apos;s an opportunity to get ahead, he&apos;ll take it before anyone else even sees it coming. </personalityDescription>
