			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Carl avoids - it&apos;s something he seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, He meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Carl&apos;s attention to detail is unmatched. Whether reviewing battlefield intel or adjusting a targeting system, he works tirelessly to ensure every factor is in his favor - because in his world, overlooking one detail is a mistake he refuses to make. </personalityDescription>
