			<personalityDescription>Luppe&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. He scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts his will so thoroughly that those around him rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Where others see only the surface, Luppe digs deeper. He picks up on the smallest tells, the hidden motivations, the why behind every action - turning knowledge into power before anyone realizes he has it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;br&gt;- Sees the motive, not the motion. Can predict a betrayal before it starts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
