			<personalityDescription>Maximilian never does anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s firepower, preparation, or just sheer intensity, he goes all-in, often pushing beyond what&apos;s necessary - or even reasonable. Maximilian doesn&apos;t see narrow escapes as luck - he sees them as confirmation. Every bullet that whizzes past, every enemy that fails to land a hit just fuels his belief that he&apos;s invincible. &quot;You see that? Didn&apos;t even graze me. Like I said, they can&apos;t hit me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
