			<personalityDescription>Georgio doesn&apos;t just break the rules - he rewrites them to suit his needs. Every lie, every scheme, every calculated betrayal is just another step toward consolidating his power while leaving his enemies scrambling in the dark. Georgio cracks puns even in the heat of battle. &quot;Looks like that guy&apos;s having a meltdown,&quot; he quips after overheating an enemy &apos;Mek. His squad groans at his constant wordplay, but they can&apos;t deny it lightens the tension - just enough to keep them steady when the situation turns grim. </personalityDescription>
