			<personalityDescription>Maurice moves through life with absolute certainty, his presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When he speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Maurice&apos;s loyalty is as fleeting as a paycheck. He makes allies when it&apos;s convenient, breaks deals when it suits him, and always keeps an escape route ready in case things turn south. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commands attention by presence alone. No showmanship - just certainty.&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
