			<personalityDescription>Planning has never been Dayita&apos;s strong suit. He follows instinct over strategy, letting adrenaline and quick thinking dictate his path. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&apos;t - but either way, he never hesitates. Dayita doesn&apos;t flinch at incoming fire, surprise ambushes, or desperate last stands. He&apos;s been through worse, and he never lets it show. &quot;Panic won&apos;t save you. Keep moving.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy ignored. Runs on instinct and adrenaline. Sometimes lucky, always fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
