			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no telling what Jiri will do next, and that&apos;s what makes him dangerous. His moods swing wildly, his plans shift without warning, and his reactions can be as destructive to his allies as they are to his enemies. Jiri struggles with routine but flourishes under pressure. If everything is calm and stable, he gets bored. But the moment things start falling apart, he snaps into focus. &quot;I swear, you only work properly when the whole system is burning down.&quot; Jiri grins. &quot;Well, yeah.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Volatile. Could win the day or get someone killed.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
