			<personalityDescription>Libor has never met a fight he didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, he runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Libor can fix a supply chain issue in minutes, negotiate a contract loophole, and recite the complete corporate history of the Inner Sphere - mostly because he reads everything. Need a regulation cited or an obscure planetary fact? Libor&apos;s already flipping to the right page. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
