			<performanceExamScore>70</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Ameena refuses to become just another manipulator. She holds onto her integrity, even when it costs her, because she knows that if she loses that, she&apos;s lost everything. Ameena doesn&apos;t need ideal circumstances - she excels in the worst ones. Whether it&apos;s repurposing old materials, finding alternatives, or just knowing exactly what to prioritize, she gets it done. &quot;You think we don&apos;t have what we need? We do. You just don&apos;t see it yet.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 67%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Holds the line on integrity, even when it hurts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
