			<personalityDescription>Nella stands firm when others falter, facing danger with unwavering resolve. she doesn&apos;t flinch under fire, believing that true bravery isn&apos;t about being fearless - it&apos;s about acting despite the fear. Nella rigs the barracks door to announce everyone&apos;s full rank and name when they enter. She swaps someone&apos;s comm ID so they sound exactly like the unit commander. Even in the middle of a war, she finds ways to make people laugh - because sometimes, that&apos;s the only thing keeping them from breaking. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 62%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t flinch. Acts despite fear. Quiet strength - solid under pressure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
