			<personalityDescription>Alyona&apos;s drive is infectious. Her sheer enthusiasm and determination make people believe in her, rallying allies to her side and pushing them to go further than they ever thought possible. Alyona&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as her ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, she indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes others by sheer force of will. Drive spreads like fire.&lt;br&gt;- Treats vice like victory. Always hunting the next high.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
