			<personalityDescription>Marka is most comfortable in the quiet, away from the noise and chaos of crowded rooms. They don&apos;t mind company, but they prefer to keep their circle small - only those they trust, and even that list is short. Marka sings softly, barely audible over the crackle of comms. It&apos;s an old war tune, a bar song, or some half-forgotten melody from a planet they barely remember. The squad knows that if they hear them singing, the fight hasn&apos;t really started yet. If they stop? That&apos;s when things have gone bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trust is earned. Rarely given.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
