			<personalityDescription>Some people accept their place in the universe - Ryan refuses to. He dreams big, fights hard, and never stops striving for something greater, no matter how distant or impossible it may seem. Ryan&apos;s energy is contagious. He has a way of making even the worst situations seem manageable, keeping morale high with a well-timed joke, an inspiring speech, or a simple &quot;You&apos;ve got this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
