			<personalityDescription>Sorin doesn&apos;t believe in limits. Whether it&apos;s effort, firepower, or sheer presence, he always pushes past what&apos;s necessary, turning every task into something grander, louder, and more overwhelming than it has to be. Sorin picks up on unspoken words and subtle cues, adjusting his approach based on the emotions and ideas of those around him. His ability to read people makes him an effective leader, negotiator, and ally. </personalityDescription>
