			<personalityDescription>Chris never sits back and lets events unfold - he&apos;s always moving, always planning, always ensuring he&apos;s the one shaping the outcome rather than reacting to it. Chris&apos;s vengeance isn&apos;t always loud, but it&apos;s always calculated. A missing ration pack, an inconvenient reassignment, a subtle but devastating rumor - he plays the long game when it comes to payback, and he enjoys every second of it. </personalityDescription>
