			<personalityDescription>Kiandra operates with a relentless sense of purpose, never allowing distractions or setbacks to pull them off course. Every failure is just another lesson, every victory another step toward their ultimate goal. No matter where they are, Kiandra can&apos;t stop apologizing. They&apos;ll say &quot;Sorry&quot; for calling a warning too late, for calling it too early, for asking a question, and sometimes just for existing. They fight hard, but their squad suspects they&apos;d apologize to an inbound PPC if given the chance. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats setbacks as fuel. Purpose overrides all distractions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
