			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Virginia sees every resource as her to claim and her to keep. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage or simple supplies, she takes what she can and shares only when absolutely necessary - if at all. Virginia sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, she doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in her mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thinks the company&apos;s inventory is theirs. Good luck prying it loose.&lt;br&gt;- Truth hits hard. So do they. Doesnt apologize for either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
