			<personalityDescription>Gordania sees everything else as background noise - only the goal in front of her matters. Once she&apos;s committed to something, nothing short of disaster can pull her away. &quot;That&apos;s a snake plant. Tough as hell, doesn&apos;t need much, survives in low light. Kind of like us.&quot; Gordania&apos;s the type to compare a campaign to crop rotation and an ambush to invasive species competition. Her squad has learned to just nod along when she starts explaining plant biology mid-patrol. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Everything but the objective is noise. Won&apos;t stop until it&apos;s done.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
