			<personalityDescription>Oginga sees adaptability as another word for indecision. Once they commit to a course of action, there&apos;s no turning back - no matter how much the situation changes around them. Every conversation with Oginga is a game of unseen moves and hidden motives. They weave lies with truth, controlling the flow of information so effortlessly that by the time anyone realizes they&apos;ve been played, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Views flexibility as weakness. Once committed, won&apos;t pivot.&lt;br&gt;- Talks in moves and motives. Controls the game long before anyone sees the board.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
