			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Adum has no patience for it. He charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry him through - because hesitation gets people killed. Adum doesn&apos;t just lead - he elevates those around him. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, he makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Relies on audacity and instinct. High survivability or quick death.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt bark orders - just makes you want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
