			<personalityDescription>Anantya approaches everything with methodical precision. He doesn&apos;t believe in shortcuts or luck - only in putting in the work, refining his craft, and ensuring that he never leaves anything to chance. People trust Anantya because he&apos;s real. He doesn&apos;t fake emotions, doesn&apos;t manipulate, and doesn&apos;t care about putting on an act. His honesty may be blunt at times, but it makes him both respected and reliable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Methodical and tireless. Trusts hard work over luck every time.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fake it. Wont break it. Trustworthy to a fault.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
