			<personalityDescription>Yaksha doesn&apos;t just think she&apos;s invincible - she acts like it. She takes unnecessary risks, dismisses warnings, and underestimates opponents, convinced that sheer skill (or luck) will always pull her through. One day, it won&apos;t. Yaksha fights efficiently, wasting zero movements, always predicting the next step. If something looks like luck, it&apos;s actually precision. &quot;You think that was instinct? No. That was reading the field before it happened.&quot; </personalityDescription>
