			<personalityDescription>To Aurelia, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits them, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. They&apos;re not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits them most in the moment. Aurelia simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even their own well-being are secondary to whatever they deem important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of their inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not their. </personalityDescription>
