			<personalityDescription>Eugene walks into every room like he owns it and onto every battlefield like victory is already assured. Whether it&apos;s skill, luck, or sheer arrogance, Eugene makes it look easy - and he makes sure everyone knows it. Eugene knows exactly what to say to get people on his side, but his words rarely match his true intentions. He smiles, flatters, and makes promises, but beneath it all, he&apos;s only looking out for himself. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enters every situation like it&apos;s already won. Walks the line between skill and arrogance.&lt;br&gt;- All charm, no substance. Says the right things, means none of them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
