			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Teriieroo is convinced they can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. They stretche themself thin, takes on risks they shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether they can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of their vocabulary. Yet. Teriieroo will go an entire day without eating, only to inhale three full MREs right before a drop. Sometimes, they forget to eat at all, other times, they&apos;re gnawing on a ration bar mid-skirmish. Their lance has stopped questioning it - except for the tim they casually sipped a protein shake while under heavy fire. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thinks confidence replaces planning. Runs headfirst into collapse.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
