			<personalityDescription>Nevaeh doesn&apos;t just give orders - she expects them to be followed, no questions asked. Every battle, every decision, every moment is another chance to prove that only the strongest hand can guide the weak to victory. Nevaeh doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - she believes in winning. She bends, breaks, and rewrites the rules to suit her needs, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Orders aren&apos;t requests. Views questioning as defiance.&lt;br&gt;- Victory at all costs. Leaves scorched earth behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
