			<personalityDescription>Angela doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise, and certainly doesn&apos;t entertain alternatives. Her way is the right way - end of discussion, no exceptions. Once, Angela might have cared. Now, she just drifts. Wars rage, alliances shift, people come and go, and none of it moves her. She does what&apos;s necessary to get by, but passion and purpose are long-forgotten luxuries. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No deviation, no negotiation. Their way or nothing.&lt;br&gt;- Burned out long before we met them. Just ash in uniform.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
