			<personalityDescription>Lasran doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - he&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. He&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw his way to the top, no matter who gets in his way. Lasran enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, he sees no reason to deny himself what he desires. </personalityDescription>
