			<personalityDescription>Haajara&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. She tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that her loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. Haajara isn&apos;t just comfortable in chaotic battles - she lives for them. When formations break, when plans crumble, when everything turns into an unpredictable mess, that&apos;s when she&apos;s at her best. &quot;You&apos;re panicking? Relax. This is when things get fun.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes you feel seen - until you realize you were just a mark.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
