			<personalityDescription>Melaina refuses to waver, no matter the odds. Once she sets a goal, she sees it through with unshakable determination, standing firm even when everything around her is falling apart. Melaina never acts without a plan. Every move she makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time her opponents realize what&apos;s happening, she&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
