			<personalityDescription>Trang knows where he wants to be, and he knows how to get there. With a mix of charm, strategy, and just the right amount of risk-taking, he maneuvers his way toward success, making the right allies and cutting loose the dead weight as needed. Trang always seems like he&apos;s one bad moment away from snapping. Whether it&apos;s a broken piece of gear, a slow-witted subordinate, or just a long day, his irritation simmers just beneath the surface, waiting for an excuse to boil over. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategic climber. Makes allies, cuts weight, eyes always on the prize.&lt;br&gt;- Complains the whole op. Still finishes first.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
