			<personalityDescription>The more dangerous the path, the more certain Ertan is that it&apos;s the right one. He moves forward without fear, seeing every unknown as a puzzle to solve, a victory to claim, or a story to tell later. People trust Ertan because he&apos;s real. He doesn&apos;t fake emotions, doesn&apos;t manipulate, and doesn&apos;t care about putting on an act. His honesty may be blunt at times, but it makes him both respected and reliable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- The harder the path, the more they want it. Danger is proof they&apos;re on track.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fake it. Wont break it. Trustworthy to a fault.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
