			<personalityDescription>Kauser is a walking powder keg, always a moment away from igniting. Their temper flares fast and burns bright, leaving little room for reason once they&apos;re set on a path - whether right or wrong. Compassion is a weakness Kauser can&apos;t afford. They don&apos;t hesitate to make hard decisions, sacrifice allies, or eliminate threats with cold efficiency. In their mind, survival means shutting out anything that might make them hesitate. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always one spark from exploding. Reason stops mattering once temper flares.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts ties as easily as throats - doesn&apos;t blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
