			<personalityDescription>Vic has an insatiable appetite for life, whether it&apos;s for knowledge, wealth, or victory. He throws himself into everything he does with relentless energy, always hungry for more. Whether he&apos;s giving orders, lining up a shot, or listening to a mission briefing, Vic does not blink. His lance jokes that he doesn&apos;t need targeting computers - he just looks at a target long enough and the shot finds its mark. It&apos;d be impressive if it weren&apos;t so unsettling. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always eating the world alive - never full, never done.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
