			<personalityDescription>Freddy doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. He weaves half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while he walks away unscathed - and usually richer. &quot;This reminds me of a fight we had on Kelenfold. Same terrain, same bad odds.&quot; Freddy always has a story, always a comparison to something before. His lance listens - sometimes for wisdom, sometimes just to hear about a time when things weren&apos;t so bad. </personalityDescription>
