			<personalityDescription>To Mesrak, control isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He demands obedience and tolerates no weakness, bending others to his will through sheer force of personality or, if needed, raw intimidation. Mesrak has seen things that don&apos;t make sense. Forces that shouldn&apos;t have lost, but did. Enemies that should have survived, but vanished. He believes in the Black Marauder because he needs to. Because if it&apos;s not real, then what the hell is happening out there? </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Controls through pressure or intimidation. Weakness is punished.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
