			<personalityDescription>Septi is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. They roll their eyes, mutter under their breath, and get annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, they still get the job done. Septi has a knack for finding strange things in the ruins of battlefields - enemy insignias, discarded dog tags, fragments of &apos;Mek armor with odd markings. Their lance jokes that they could start a museum, but they&apos;ve all seen them pull out a bent bullet casing mid-fight, rub it like a lucky charm, and somehow walk away unscathed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No time for fools - barely any for friends.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
