			<personalityDescription>Experience has made Annum sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. She reads between the lines, recognizes hidden motives, and plays every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what she is. Annum knows exactly how to get under people&apos;s skin, and sometimes she does it on purpose. She claims it&apos;s to sharpen teamwork, but really, she just likes seeing how people react. &quot;You two gonna figure this out, or should I start placing bets?&quot; </personalityDescription>
