			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for doubt in Suzana&apos;s world - they already knows they&apos;re right. They speaks with absolute authority, rarely bother to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of their valuable time. Suzana doesn&apos;t waste time on fair deals when an unfair one gets them more. They play on desperation, weaknesses, and ambition, twisting every situation to ensure that, in the end, Suzana is the one who profits most. </personalityDescription>
