			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and restraint are foreign concepts to Eithna. She meets every challenge, real or imagined, with immediate intensity, her first instinct always to escalate rather than back down. While others waste time with diplomacy, Eithna gets straight to the point. She values efficiency over politeness and doesn&apos;t believe in dancing around the truth. Some find her approach refreshing - others just find it frustrating. </personalityDescription>
