			<personalityDescription>Moire never doubts herself, even when she absolutely should. She struts into battle like she&apos;s already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions her skills, she&apos;ll be the first to bet her wages on proving them wrong. Moire doesn&apos;t panic because she knows what real fear looks like. She&apos;s been through worse, lost too much, seen things she won&apos;t talk about. Compared to that? Incoming fire is just background noise. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never doubts, even when wrong. Swagger first, strategy later.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
