			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Halim - it&apos;s an obsession. He sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in his relentless pursuit of fortune. Halim&apos;s actions rarely follow a clear pattern. One moment, he&apos;s cautious and methodical; the next, he&apos;s diving headfirst into chaos. His unpredictability keeps enemies - and sometimes allies - on edge. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Greed isnt a flaw here - its the mission.&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable. Keeps everyone guessing - sometimes that&apos;s an asset.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
