			<personalityDescription>No matter what gets thrown at her, Liliane bounces back. Whether it&apos;s a brutal loss, a catastrophic failure, or a battlefield injury, she refuses to let anything break her. Liliane says what she means and means what she says. She doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - her words and actions come from a place of honesty, making her a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes the hit, gets back up. Nothing breaks them for long.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
