			<personalityDescription>Fizza&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. They adapt on the fly, find solutions where others see dead ends, and always seem to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in their favor. Fizza isn&apos;t loud about their kindness, but it&apos;s there. A quiet word of encouragement, a favor done without asking for thanks, or a small sacrifice to make someone&apos;s life easier - they pay attention to what people need and act on it, whether they notice or not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into leverage without blinking.&lt;br&gt;- Helps without being asked. Quiet kind - the kind that keeps units together.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
