			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Seeta refuses to be infected. She knows she&apos;s the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment she does, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. Seeta&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats doubt like weakness. Believes they&apos;re the best - and fights like it.&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
