			<personalityDescription>Khurshid walks into every room like he owns it and onto every battlefield like victory is already assured. Whether it&apos;s skill, luck, or sheer arrogance, Khurshid makes it look easy - and he makes sure everyone knows it. Khurshid&apos;s calendar isn&apos;t just personal - it&apos;s the real company schedule. Payroll deadlines, JumpShip departures, contract negotiations - he&apos;s got it all mapped out. If the commander wants to know when they&apos;re leaving, they don&apos;t ask the XO. They ask Khurshid. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enters every situation like it&apos;s already won. Walks the line between skill and arrogance.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
