			<personalityDescription>Matt doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, he&apos;ll do it his way - whether anyone asked for his help or not. Matt doesn&apos;t believe in taking the high road - not when the low road is so much more satisfying. He remembers every slight, every insult, and every moment someone underestimated him, and he takes special pleasure in evening the score. </personalityDescription>
