			<personalityDescription>Mercy is just another word for weakness in Kostanca&apos;s mind. She eliminates threats before they become problems and never lets emotions stand in the way of her ambition. Kostanca doesn&apos;t worry about not having the right tools - she makes do. A broken weapon, a missing component, an unexpected failure? She&apos;s already rigging up a solution with whatever she can scavenge. &quot;You&apos;d be amazed what you can build with a little ingenuity and a complete lack of better options.&quot; </personalityDescription>
