			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in You-yi&apos;s eyes. He meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in his way is just another problem to crush. You-yi doesn&apos;t make a big deal about it, but half the squad is wearing something he&apos;s made. He&apos;ll hand you a scarf or a jacket with zero fanfare, like he&apos;s handing over ammo. &quot;Just take it. You&apos;ll freeze otherwise. Don&apos;t make it weird.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Patience dismissed as weakness. Crushes obstacles with brute force.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
