			<personalityDescription>Lee doesn&apos;t just want success - he demands it. He climbs over anyone in his way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In his mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Lee has a natural ability to sense what others are feeling. He listens without judgment, offers genuine support, and always seems to know exactly what someone needs to hear - whether they realize it or not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts deals, cuts throats - climbs to the top by any means.&lt;br&gt;- Reads people like a book. Knows when to speak - and when not to.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
