			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Ahio has a habit of stretching the truth - sometimes a little, sometimes a lot. Whether it&apos;s exaggerating her accomplishments, fudging numbers, or making promises she can&apos;t keep, she always finds a way to make herself look better than she really is. Ahio doesn&apos;t get involved unless she has to. Other people&apos;s problems, moral dilemmas, or even the bigger picture don&apos;t concern her - she focuses on what directly affects her and ignores the rest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Shines up mediocrity like it&apos;s gold - good at making nothing sound impressive.&lt;br&gt;- Does the job. Doesn&apos;t care who signs the check.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
