			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Tomohiko pushes ahead. Risk doesn&apos;t concern him, and consequences are an afterthought - if there&apos;s a way through, he&apos;ll find it, no matter how dangerous the path. Tomohiko doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action he takes is calculated to serve his own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rushes where others pause. Sees risk, ignores it. Goal matters more.&lt;br&gt;- No favors, no debts. Operates on pure self-interest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
