			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Mea, the kind that makes people listen when they speak and follow when they lead. They don&apos;t need to prove themself - they already know where they stand. Mea likes that convoy missions matter. There&apos;s something different about ensuring something critical gets through, rather than just destroying a target. &quot;You&apos;re not just fighting to win. You&apos;re fighting to deliver something that matters.&quot; </personalityDescription>
