			<personalityDescription>Wienczyslaw doesn&apos;t make rash decisions - he plays the long game. Every battle, every move, and every choice is carefully calculated to maximize his advantage and ensure victory with minimal risk. No strategy is ever good enough for Wienczyslaw. He picks apart every formation, every maneuver, every decision. &quot;That&apos;s a weak flank. That exit is a death trap. This timing is off by at least three seconds.&quot; It&apos;s exhausting - but more than once, his nitpicking has saved lives. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t act - engineers outcomes. Everyone else is playing checkers.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
