			<personalityDescription>Delu doesn&apos;t believe in rules - only results. She&apos;ll step on allies, deceive enemies, and manipulate anyone in her way, all with a cold efficiency that leaves no room for doubt or regret. Delu has seen how large-scale strategies sacrifice the people actually fighting. She&apos;s seen plans drawn up by those who never have to bleed for them. She trusts what&apos;s real, what she can see, what she can control. Because she knows that when things go wrong, it&apos;s not the planners who suffer - it&apos;s the ones actually in the fight. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks rules, breaks people. Leaves no one behind - unless it benefits them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
