			<personalityDescription>Shannon&apos;s loyalty is as fleeting as a paycheck. She makes allies when it&apos;s convenient, breaks deals when it suits her, and always keeps an escape route ready in case things turn south. Shannon wasn&apos;t always like this. Maybe it was the stress, the years of battle, the losses piling up. Whatever the cause, her mouth can&apos;t always keep up with her brain anymore. &quot;It&apos;s j-j-just a voice, r-right? As long as I c-can still f-f-fight, it d-doesn&apos;t matter.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
