			<personalityDescription>Minh-Phuong doesn&apos;t hesitate when faced with the impossible - She meets it head-on, with a steady gaze and an unshakable will. She knows that fear is inevitable, but surrender is a choice. Minh-Phuong believes she&apos;s the best, and she acts like it. Whether she&apos;s fighting for her life, strategizing, or calling the shots, she never doubts herself - even when she really should. </personalityDescription>
