			<personalityDescription>Bahadur always has people&apos;s backs. Whether it&apos;s offering words of encouragement, stepping in when someone&apos;s struggling, or making sure their unit feels valued, they&apos;re the kind of person others can always count on. Bahadur doesn&apos;t handle things - they manhandle them. They type hard  enough to shake the terminal, closes panels with enough force to make them rattle, and tightens bolts to the point where no one else can loosen them again. </personalityDescription>
