			<performanceExamScore>35</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Ahn-Na thrives on momentum, always pressing forward with an intensity that makes backing down seem impossible. She refuses to slow down, always demanding more, pushing herself and everyone around her past their limits. Ahn-Na doesn&apos;t believe in pre-fabricated anything. If there&apos;s a problem, she builds her own fix. Her workspace is filled with half-finished projects, custom tools, and modifications that no one else quite understands. &quot;Why use stock solutions when you can make something better?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Momentum junkie. Pushes self and team hard. Could overextend.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
