			<personalityDescription>Cetas acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, he prefers action over hesitation - sometimes to his own detriment. Cetas has a sharp eye for the right moment to strike - whether it&apos;s on the battlefield, in business, or in personal dealings. He&apos;s always looking for an angle, ready to seize any advantage that presents itself. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps before looking. Trusts instinct over outcome. Risk to self and mission.&lt;br&gt;- Always scanning for openings. Strikes fast when advantage appears.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
