			<personalityDescription>After seeing too much death and betrayal, Batool has stopped caring. She doesn&apos;t form attachments, doesn&apos;t believe in causes, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on emotions. In her mind, caring only leads to pain. Batool fights like a demon and hugs like a bear. Before a mission, she&apos;s patting backs, ruffling hair, and making sure everyone knows they&apos;re her &apos;family.&apos; Even in the middle of a skirmish, she&apos;ll crack jokes and shout encouragement over comms. Some love her for it - others just tolerate the inevitable post-mission shoulder squeeze. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Seen too much, feels nothing. Not dead - just numb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
