			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Sinclair would rather go down in flames than play it safe. He lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy he can get - and somehow, he usually pulls it off. Sinclair doesn&apos;t just move - he propels himself forward with unstoppable energy. He thrives in fast-paced environments, where quick thinking and decisive action separate the victors from the forgotten. </personalityDescription>
