			<personalityDescription>Yachne acts first and deals with the consequences later. She thrives on instinct, making split-second decisions with unshakable confidence - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always decisive. Yachne doesn&apos;t wait for chances - she takes them, regardless of the cost. Allies, morals, and promises are all secondary to survival and success. If there&apos;s a gap to exploit, she&apos;ll find it, and if there isn&apos;t one, she&apos;ll make one. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Instinct-driven. Bold or foolish - depends on the day. Decisive, not always smart.&lt;br&gt;- Takes chances without hesitation. Morals are optional - results aren&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
