			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the slow and the dead, and Irus refuses to be either. She rushes headlong into danger, making split-second decisions that could be called bravery - or  sheer madness. One way or another, Irus never stands still. Irus isn&apos;t just quick - she&apos;s calculated. She anticipates problems before they arise and maneuvers people and situations to her advantage. By the time others react, she&apos;s already executing her next move. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Speed over safety. Bravery or recklessness - depends on the day.&lt;br&gt;- Anticipates, then executes. Already in motion while others are thinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
