			<personalityDescription>To Cristina, every situation holds potential - she just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into her gain, she never lets an opening go to waste. Cristina speaks in the same steady, flat tone whether she&apos;s giving orders, dodging fire, or watching a disaster unfold. She operates like a machine, precise and deliberate, even as everything around her burns. &quot;We handle it. That&apos;s all. Doesn&apos;t matter how bad it looks.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats crisis as currency. Turns every shift into personal gain.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
