			<personalityDescription>Erik believes she&apos;s the best, and she acts like it. Whether she&apos;s fighting for her life, strategizing, or calling the shots, she never doubts herself - even when she really should. Erik&apos;s words carry weight because they come from a place of honesty. She doesn&apos;t waste time with false flattery or empty promises - when she speaks, people listen, because they know she means it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts like the best, even when they&apos;re not. Doubt doesn&apos;t register.&lt;br&gt;- When they talk, people listen.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
