			<personalityDescription>Laria doesn&apos;t slow down, doesn&apos;t stop, doesn&apos;t rest. Whether in battle, in business, or in pursuit of power, she demands more - more resources, more control, more everything - because anything less feels like losing. When others are ready to retreat, Laria is already planning her next move. No matter how hopeless the situation looks, she refuses to stop. &quot;We&apos;ve lost when we&apos;re dead. And last time I checked, we&apos;re still breathing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Operates like the universe owes them more. Never stops collecting.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
