			<personalityDescription>Chaos isn&apos;t an obstacle for Kristian; it&apos;s the natural state of things. He is most alive when everything around him is on the edge of collapse, thriving in the turmoil where others falter. In a universe full of deception, Kristian is refreshingly straightforward. He says what he means, does what he promises, and refuses to play games just to gain favor. His word is one of the few things that can be trusted. </personalityDescription>
