			<personalityDescription>Once, Isaac might have wanted more, but now? He&apos;s seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Isaac has long since stopped caring. Isaac doesn&apos;t just fight against the enemy - he fights because of them. Every engagement is personal, every battle another chance to wipe them from existence. &quot;No mercy. No second chances. If they&apos;re standing, they&apos;re still a threat.&quot; </personalityDescription>
