			<personalityDescription>Once, Arsen might have wanted more, but now? He&apos;s seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Arsen has long since stopped caring. Arsen clutches onto everything he can get his hands on, unwilling to share or let anything slip through his fingers. He&apos;ll betray, deceive, and exploit if it means keeping himself ahead - because in his mind, scarcity is just another battlefield. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Burned out or just gave up - either way, not climbing.&lt;br&gt;- Grips every scrap like it&apos;s life support. Won&apos;t share. Won&apos;t blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
