			<personalityDescription>Planning has never been Shafiq&apos;s strong suit. They follow instinct over strategy, letting adrenaline and quick thinking dictate their path. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&apos;t - but either way, they never hesitates. Shafiq&apos;s energy is contagious. They have a way of making even the worst situations seem manageable, keeping morale high with a well-timed joke, an inspiring speech, or a simple &quot;You&apos;ve got this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
