			<performanceExamScore>64</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Every situation is a potential fight in Jeewon&apos;s mind. They don&apos;t care if it&apos;s an argument, a rivalry, or a full-scale war - they treat them all the same: something to be won, and preferably in the loudest, most aggressive way possible. Jeewon once showed up late to a fight. They don&apos;t talk about what happened afterward, but their lance didn&apos;t walk away intact. Now, they&apos;re never late. Never behind. Never a second off schedule. Because if they are, it means someone else might not make it. And they refuse to let that happen again. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees all conflict as war. Solves everything loud and hard.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
