			<personalityDescription>Heather refuses to acknowledge limits - her own or anyone else&apos;s. She constantly takes on more than she should, convinced that sheer willpower and stubbornness will carry her through, even as the cracks begin to show. Heather has taken so many lives. Bombed forests, scorched farmland, turned green fields into battlefields. So she grows plants - not to balance the scales (nothing could), but to remind herself that creation is still possible. That not everything has been reduced to ash. </personalityDescription>
