			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Hildegarde doesn&apos;t just steal - she takes. Money, gear, secrets - nothing is off-limits. She sees ownership as a temporary state, and if someone isn&apos;t strong or smart enough to hold onto what&apos;s theirs, they don&apos;t deserve to keep it. Hildegarde always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. She might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, she&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t believe in ownership - only opportunity.&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
