			<personalityDescription>Anthon doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - he believes in winning. He bends, breaks, and rewrites the rules to suit his needs, making sure that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the only one left standing. Anthon has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. He gets frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding his annoyance. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Victory at all costs. Leaves scorched earth behind.&lt;br&gt;- Barks before they speak. Might bite.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
