			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Experience and instinct guide Briruc&apos;s every move. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess - he just executes with the confidence of someone who&apos;s done this a thousand times before. Briruc has stopped counting the things he&apos;s lost. He&apos;s seen too much, survived too many close calls, and watched too many people die to believe in luck anymore. &quot;You don&apos;t walk away from things like that without losing something. Sometimes you don&apos;t realize what it was until it&apos;s already gone.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t flinch. Just acts - and it works.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
