			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Calandra&apos;s world. She steps forward without looking back, her decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether she&apos;s right or wrong, she never lingers in uncertainty. Calandra jokes about things that no one should be joking about. Her comrades laugh nervously, but Calandra&apos;s grin never quite reaches her eyes. &quot;Oh, that? Yeah, no big deal. Just another day of watching people die.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
