			<personalityDescription>Giribhu sees every situation as a business opportunity. If there&apos;s money to be made, they&apos;re already working the angles, cutting deals, and making sure they walk away with the biggest share - preferably at someone else&apos;s expense. Giribhu&apos;s obsessiveness isn&apos;t just habit - it&apos;s desperation. They can&apos;t stop tweaking their loadout, refining battle plans, checking their gear again and again - because the moment they stop? The moment they trust things to go as expected? That&apos;s when people die. And they&apos;ve already lost too many. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns every crisis into a payday.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
