			<personalityDescription>Ray is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. He rolls his eyes, mutters under his breath, and gets annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, he still gets the job done. Ray fully believes in the coolest, most dramatic ways to fight. If there&apos;s a stylish, over-the-top holovid maneuver that probably shouldn&apos;t work, he&apos;s trying it anyway. &quot;Okay, hear me out - if I time this just right, it&apos;ll look incredible.&quot; </personalityDescription>
