			<personalityDescription>Max refuses to settle for mediocrity. Every step he takes is calculated, every move designed to propel him forward - because in his mind, staying still is just another form of failure. Max doesn&apos;t just hear callsigns - he remembers them. Every hero, every ace, every fallen comrade - he keeps a mental log. &quot;Stormbringer? Yeah, I fought against them once. Tough bastard. Still out there?&quot; </personalityDescription>
