			<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Anandam like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. They fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Anandam chases every high, every challenge, every risk like they&apos;re possessed. Whether it&apos;s wealth, battle, or adrenaline, they can&apos;t stop themself from pushing further, faster, and harder - because the moment they slow down, they get bored. And that is unacceptable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fueled by anger. Never lets an insult slide - on or off the field.&lt;br&gt;- Restless, reckless, always hunting the next rush. Can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
