			<personalityDescription>Uditi refuses to acknowledge limits - her own or anyone else&apos;s. She constantly takes on more than she should, convinced that sheer willpower and stubbornness will carry her through, even as the cracks begin to show. Even when Uditi offers help, it comes wrapped in barely concealed disdain. Her advice drips with superiority, her compliments feel backhanded, and every conversation leaves people wondering if they&apos;ve just been insulted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks under pressure but hasn&apos;t noticed the cracks yet.&lt;br&gt;- Leads with ego. Expects everyone to thank them for the privilege.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
