			<personalityDescription>Once Jasny sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping him. He thrives on momentum, constantly pushing himself and those around him to reach new heights. Jasny says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 71%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Once committed, won&apos;t stop. Drags others up with them.&lt;br&gt;- Speaks plain. Earns trust the old-fashioned way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
