			<performanceExamScore>61</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Alexei always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. He might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. Alexei never leaves a room the way he found it. He&apos;ll shift crates in the hangar, move chairs around briefing rooms, and completely rearrange the break area just because it didn&apos;t feel right. No one knows why he does it, but at this point, the unit just waits for &apos;The Alexei Edition&apos; of any given room before getting comfortable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 65%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
