			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Lucie never doubts herself, even when she absolutely should. She struts into battle like she&apos;s already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions her skills, she&apos;ll be the first to bet her wages on proving them wrong. Every skirmish, every engagement, every ambush reminds her of a past war. &quot;This is just like the Hesperus II siege, different scale, same mistakes,&quot; she mutters, adjusting her sights. Her lance has learned that whenever she starts recounting military history mid-skirmish, it&apos;s either a sign of her confidence - or a really bad omen. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never doubts, even when wrong. Swagger first, strategy later.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
