			<personalityDescription>Bror isn&apos;t content with where he is - his eyes are always on the horizon. He sees every challenge as a stepping stone, every setback as a lesson, all leading toward the future he&apos;s determined to claim. To Bror, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits him, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. He&apos;s not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits him most in the moment. </personalityDescription>
