			<personalityDescription>Kiana doesn&apos;t believe in playing it safe. She thrives on risk, constantly pushing limits and daring fate to keep up - because to her, caution is just another word for hesitation. Kiana picks up on unspoken words and subtle cues, adjusting her approach based on the emotions and ideas of those around her. Her ability to read people makes her an effective leader, negotiator, and ally. </personalityDescription>
