			<personalityDescription>Libor&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. He tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that his loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. Libor doesn&apos;t just win fights - he ensures absolute destruction. Whether it&apos;s an enemy force or an already-crippled target, he keeps firing. &quot;If there&apos;s still salvage left, I obviously didn&apos;t fire enough.&quot; </personalityDescription>
