			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Carol&apos;s strengths. She speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then she considers herself a saint. Carol doesn&apos;t keep a list of callsigns for fun - she keeps it because so many are gone now. Callsigns are all that&apos;s left of them, and if she doesn&apos;t remember them, who will? &quot;Lancer. Coldsteel. Widowmaker. They fought. They mattered. I won&apos;t forget.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
