			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Danny doesn&apos;t waste time with hesitation - once a decision is made, he commits fully. On the battlefield, he acts with precision and confidence, knowing that in the chaos of war, a fast decision is often better than a perfect one. Danny never acts on impulse - every move he makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, he plays the long game, ensuring he always comes out ahead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commits fast, no waffling. Values momentum over precision. Trusts instinct.&lt;br&gt;- Every move is measured. Long-game thinker, never impulsive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
