			<personalityDescription>Alma&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. She adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in her favor. No matter how hardened the universe tries to make her, Alma refuses to shut herself off from others. She carries their burdens as if they were her own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into leverage without blinking.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t harden - chooses to feel. Risky, but admirable.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
