			<personalityDescription>Some people call it grit, others call it madness, but Aura doesn&apos;t care what they think. No matter how much the world tries to grind her down, she keeps going, long after anyone else would have quit. Aura makes sure her personal emblem is visible in every engagement. She believes in its meaning, its history, and what it stands for. &quot;If I go down,&quot; she mutters, adjusting it before a battle, &quot;I go down under this symbol.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grit or madness - hard to tell. Doesn&apos;t care. Just keeps moving.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
