			<personalityDescription>Urvasi isn&apos;t interested in quick victories - she&apos;s interested in certain victories. She waits, watches, and maneuvers every piece into place before making her move, ensuring that when the moment comes, her enemies never see it coming. Urvasi doesn&apos;t trust anyone to provide for her, so she keeps everything for herself. Every credit, every round of ammo, every salvageable scrap is hidden away because she knows that when things go bad, only those who&apos;ve prepared will survive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Prefers certainty to speed. Strikes only when the board is set.&lt;br&gt;- Survivalist mindset. Would rather let others go without than run dry.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
