			<personalityDescription>Amsia doesn&apos;t lead - she rules. Fear and obedience are her weapons, and she has no patience for weakness. Those who resist her are crushed, those who fail her are discarded, and those who follow her do so because they fear the alternative. Most people aren&apos;t worth Amsia&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how she sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath her notice, she brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leads by fear alone. Loyalty is just silence under pressure.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t even look back when leaving someone behind - already onto the next thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
