			<personalityDescription>Marjorie doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - she&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. She&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw her way to the top, no matter who gets in her way. Marjorie doesn&apos;t intentionally ignore responsibilities - she just gets caught up in her own world. Whether it&apos;s distractions, forgetfulness, or a lack of organization, things tend to slip through the cracks more often than they should. </personalityDescription>
