			<personalityDescription>Mary doesn&apos;t just think ahead - she sees ahead. She plays the long game, maneuvering people and events to her advantage, making sure every move she makes strengthens her position while others scramble to keep up. Mary always seems like she&apos;s one bad moment away from snapping. Whether it&apos;s a broken piece of gear, a slow-witted subordinate, or just a long day, her irritation simmers just beneath the surface, waiting for an excuse to boil over. </personalityDescription>
