			<personalityDescription>Voleta approaches everything with methodical precision. She doesn&apos;t believe in shortcuts or luck - only in putting in the work, refining her craft, and ensuring that she never leaves anything to chance. Voleta moves furniture, gear, everything - not because it matters, but because it&apos;s something she can change. She can&apos;t control which contracts they take, who lives or dies, or when the next battle will come. But she can control where the damn chairs go. And some days, that&apos;s the only thing keeping her from losing her mind. </personalityDescription>
