			<personalityDescription>Bhadrakumbha makes it seem like he&apos;s a team player, but everything he does is carefully crafted to benefit himself first. He&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for him, making sure that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the one standing on top. Bhadrakumbha&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, he keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts like a team player - until there&apos;s something better on the table.&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
