			<personalityDescription>Cupid isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - she simply doesn&apos;t think about them. She jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for her, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. Cupid doesn&apos;t panic, doesn&apos;t flinch, doesn&apos;t react to chaos like everyone else does. Whether it&apos;s losing an advantage, being outnumbered, or watching allies fall, she just keeps moving. &quot;Fear won&apos;t save you. Acting will.&quot; </personalityDescription>
