			<personalityDescription>War isn&apos;t personal for Fannie - it&apos;s a business. They weigh risks like investments, treat allies like temporary partners, and know that in the end, survival isn&apos;t about honor - it&apos;s about profit. Fannie doesn&apos;t just stand beside their allies - they lift them up. Whether it&apos;s covering for a mistake, offering quiet reassurance, or taking the weight off someone&apos;s shoulders, they ensure that no one fights alone. </personalityDescription>
