			<personalityDescription>Jannet doesn&apos;t just give orders - she expects them to be followed, no questions asked. Every battle, every decision, every moment is another chance to prove that only the strongest hand can guide the weak to victory. Jannet moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze her - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. She does what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
