			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for debate when Kina is around. She dictates the course of action with absolute certainty, expecting others to fall in line without question - because, in her mind, there&apos;s no alternative. People trust Kina because they know she&apos;s real. She doesn&apos;t put on a facade or tell people what they want to hear - she tells them what they need to hear. Her sincerity makes her a reliable friend and an unwavering ally. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No tolerance for disagreement. Only one path forward: theirs.&lt;br&gt;- No sugar, no spin. Just truth.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
