			<personalityDescription>Perouze doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs their skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does their interest. Perouze doesn&apos;t move loudly because they know better. Being heard, being seen, being noticed? That&apos;s just an invitation for trouble. They&apos;ve learned that the longer they stay quiet, the more likely they are to make it through whatever&apos;s coming next. &quot;The moment they forget you&apos;re there, you&apos;ve already won.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t move unless the C-Bills do. Motivation ends where the payment does.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
