			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy soaked in blood, Dwayne refuses to be just another killer. He clings to the belief that there&apos;s a better way, even as war drags on around him, testing convictions that grow harder to uphold with every battle. Dwayne doesn&apos;t just fight - he fights with style. Whether it&apos;s a dramatic duel, a well-timed flourish, or a perfectly executed maneuver, he makes battle look good. &quot;If you&apos;re going to fight,&quot; he grims, dodging incoming fire, &quot;you might as well make it memorable.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Holds tight to idealism. War tests it, but they endure - for now.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
