			<personalityDescription>Lucie is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. They look out for their allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. Lucie has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect them. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to them, it&apos;s all just noise. They do what&apos;s necessary and move on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always bringing extras - makes sure no one&apos;s left empty-handed.&lt;br&gt;- Sees war as noise. Filters everything but orders.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
