			<personalityDescription>Iver doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. They dissect enemy formations, anticipate movements, and execute plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, they&apos;ve already won. Iver used to trust the chain of command. But then they saw too many bad calls, too many good people thrown away like resources. Now, they assume any order could be the one that gets them - or their lance - killed for someone else&apos;s ambition. </personalityDescription>
