			<personalityDescription>Shama is always watching, always analyzing, never letting her guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, she stays one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. Experience and instinct guide Shama&apos;s every move. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess - she just executes with the confidence of someone who&apos;s done this a thousand times before. </personalityDescription>
