			<personalityDescription>Ichi believes leadership isn&apos;t about consensus - it&apos;s about control. She doesn&apos;t ask for loyalty; she assumes it, and those who resist quickly learn that standing in her way is never a good idea. Ichi doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights or noble causes. She shifts alliances, bends the truth, and rewrites the rules as she goes, ensuring that no matter what happens, she&apos;s the one who wins. </personalityDescription>
