			<personalityDescription>Rashida treats every challenge like a war of attrition - she doesn&apos;t have to be the fastest or the strongest, just the one still standing at the end. And she always is. Rashida understands that words are as powerful as weapons. She navigates tense situations with precision, knowing exactly how to disarm hostility, defuse tempers, and guide conversations to a favorable outcome. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Outlasts every challenge. Doesn&apos;t need to win fast - just win last.&lt;br&gt;- Turns powder kegs into polite handshakes.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
