			<personalityDescription>Compromise is just another word for weakness in June&apos;s mind. She doesn&apos;t negotiate or accommodate - she dictates, expecting the world to move according to her vision, whether others like it or not. June can talk to anyone and make them feel like an old friend. Her charm, humor, and ability to find common ground make her the kind of person others naturally gravitate toward, whether she&apos;s leading a unit or sharing a drink. </personalityDescription>
