			<personalityDescription>Mollie doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow them down. Every decision, every action is a step toward their goal. While others waver or compromise, they stay locked onto their objective, no matter what it takes to get there. Mollie is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, they bring an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. </personalityDescription>
