			<personalityDescription>Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Qabir. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining his gear, or following through on commitments, he tends to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. Qabir never stays just with his unit - he integrates into local life. He&apos;ll be found talking with vendors, learning regional slang, and making himself at home. &quot;You want to know what&apos;s really going on? Talk to the people who actually live here. Not the ones just passing through.&quot; </personalityDescription>
