			<personalityDescription>The line between confidence and recklessness is one Alysia never bothers to acknowledge. She acts on impulse, ignores warnings, and barrels forward at full speed, trusting that she&apos;ll figure things out before it&apos;s too late. Alysia makes it seem like she&apos;s a team player, but everything she does is carefully crafted to benefit herself first. She&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for her, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the one standing on top. </personalityDescription>
