			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a bad idea, Jay will be the first to try it. They hate waiting, hate planning, and definitely hate being told to slow down - because they always believes the best way forward is straight through the enemy. Jay&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, they keep a running tally of offenses and find creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. </personalityDescription>
