			<personalityDescription>Glen acts before thinking, always ready to throw himself into a fight at the slightest provocation. Patience isn&apos;t his strong suit, and keeping Glen in check is often as dangerous as facing the enemy. Glen always eats, even when no one else can stomach it. He chews as he sighs off another casualty report. He nibbles on dried meat as he calculates supply losses. Because if he keeps eating, keeps living like normal, then maybe - just maybe-things aren&apos;t as bad as they look. </personalityDescription>
