			<personalityDescription>Lindsey trusts exactly one person to get things done right - herself. She nitpicks every detail, overrides decisions she doesn&apos;t like, and refuses to delegate unless she has no other choice. Compassion is a weakness Lindsey can&apos;t afford. She doesn&apos;t hesitate to make hard decisions, sacrifice allies, or eliminate threats with cold efficiency. In her mind, survival means shutting out anything that might make her hesitate. </personalityDescription>
