			<personalityDescription>To Dominique, control isn&apos;t a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He dictates every move, barks orders without question, and refuses to tolerate disobedience. In his world, authority isn&apos;t earned - it&apos;s enforced. Dominique doesn&apos;t wait for opportunity - he creates it. Whether it&apos;s training, strategizing, or climbing the ranks, he throws himself into every task with relentless determination, always pushing toward his next goal. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enforces authority, not leadership. Obedience expected, not requested.&lt;br&gt;- Makes their own opportunities. Relentless pursuit of the next goal.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
