			<personalityDescription>Valentin never doubts himself, even when he absolutely should. He struts into battle like he&apos;s already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions his skills, he&apos;ll be the first to bet his wages on proving them wrong. Valentin always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. He knows when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never doubts, even when wrong. Swagger first, strategy later.&lt;br&gt;- Times every deal perfectly. Leaves the rest of us holding the receipt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
