			<personalityDescription>Alicia makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through her unshakable resolve, her fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where she reminds someone of their worth, she sparks hope in even the darkest times. Alicia doesn&apos;t just swear - she weaponizes it. Her profanity is so aggressive that it either rallies her allies or completely rattles her enemies. &quot;Listen here, you miserable pack of rusted ****-stains, either you run now or I&apos;ll show you what a real ****ing disaster looks like.&quot; </personalityDescription>
