			<personalityDescription>If Moyna&apos;s doing something, everyone is going to know about it. She doubles down on every decision, throws herself into everything at full speed, and refuses to settle for anything that isn&apos;t over-the-top. Moyna never gives a straight answer. She dodges questions, avoids commitments, and keeps people guessing about where she really stands. It&apos;s not outright lying - it&apos;s just never letting anyone get close enough to see the truth. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Everything&apos;s a performance. Goes full tilt, no matter the stakes.&lt;br&gt;- Never commits. Just enough truth to stay slippery.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
