			<personalityDescription>Candace doesn&apos;t just take charge - she owns every situation she steps into. Her presence alone demands compliance, and she has little patience for those who hesitate to fall in line. Candace&apos;s generosity isn&apos;t just about giving - it&apos;s about ensuring others have what they need. Whether she&apos;s sacrificing her own comfort, pulling strings to help a friend, or making sure no one is left behind, she never hesitates to step up. </personalityDescription>
