			<personalityDescription>Jake doesn&apos;t entertain the idea of failure. Whether it&apos;s natural talent, unbreakable will, or sheer force of personality, he carries himself like someone who expects to win - and usually does. In a ruthless world, Jake refuses to become another heartless warrior. He watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs him. The weight of every choice lingers in his mind, but he&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Failure isn&apos;t an option. Victory is an expectation, not a goal.&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
