			<personalityDescription>Fiorella charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. She believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. Fiorella knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for her own. She pulls strings, applies pressure, and always ensures that the cost of her success is paid by someone else. </personalityDescription>
