			<personalityDescription>Once Muta sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping him. He thrives on momentum, constantly pushing himself and those around him to reach new heights. Muta&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just his skill, but his ability to think. He sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when he moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. </personalityDescription>
