			<personalityDescription>Yok-sing doesn&apos;t just take charge - he smothers every situation with his presence. Whether giving orders or offering &quot;advice,&quot; he makes sure his voice is the loudest and his will is the only one that matters. Yok-sing isn&apos;t interested in quick victories - he&apos;s interested in certain victories. He waits, watches, and maneuvers every piece into place before making his move, ensuring that when the moment comes, his enemies never see it coming. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Dominates every room. Advice feels like orders - can&apos;t be ignored.&lt;br&gt;- Prefers certainty to speed. Strikes only when the board is set.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
