			<personalityDescription>Cidem thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Cidem simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Cidem doesn&apos;t waste time on sentiment - she does what it takes to win. Morality, loyalty, and fairness are just obstacles, and she has no patience for those too weak to do what&apos;s necessary. </personalityDescription>
