			<personalityDescription>While others argue and analyze, Rusty is already in motion. They don&apos;t need endless deliberation to see the best path forward - Rusty weighs the options, picks a course, and executes it with ruthless efficiency. Rusty always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear they think they&apos;re the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, they have a way of making others feel small without ever raising their voice. </personalityDescription>
