			<personalityDescription>Michael&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. They can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what they want. Michael has seen too much to care about petty concerns. They ignore emotions, disregard complaints, and barely acknowledge those they considers beneath them. If someone isn&apos;t immediately useful, they might as well not exist. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Born dealmaker. If they&apos;re smiling, you&apos;ve already lost something.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t see people - just obstacles or irrelevancies.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
