			<performanceExamScore>49</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Selim is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. His tactics shift constantly, his decisions keep enemies guessing, and his sheer momentum makes him nearly impossible to stop once he sets his sights on something. Selim cracks a finger gun after every fight, no matter how bad it got. It&apos;s habit, a ritual, a lifeline. Because if he stops joking - if he stops acting like any of this is normal - then he&apos;ll have to face just how much of himself this war has taken. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable, high-pressure operator - don&apos;t get in their way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
