			<personalityDescription>Some call it bravery, others call it stubbornness, but Tom simply sees it as doing what needs to be done. No matter the stakes, no matter the danger, He refuses to take a step back when it matters most. Tom doesn&apos;t pressure people - he makes them think they&apos;re making their own choices. His calm demeanor, well-placed words, and ability to read a situation let him guide conversations where he wants them to go, without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been led. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stubborn courage. Holds ground when others retreat. Reliable in critical moments.&lt;br&gt;- You think it was your idea. It wasn&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
