			<personalityDescription>Misao doesn&apos;t pressure people - he makes them think they&apos;re making their own choices. His calm demeanor, well-placed words, and ability to read a situation let him guide conversations where he wants them to go, without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been led. Misao knows war has always been brutal, but he can&apos;t help but feel that something was different back then. Fights were personal, weapons required craftsmanship, and victory was skill, not just tech superiority. He wonders if warriors of the past would laugh at how detached war has become - or pity him for how much worse it&apos;s gotten. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- You think it was your idea. It wasn&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
