			<personalityDescription>Devent never lets the truth get in the way of a good opportunity. Whether she&apos;s bluffing, sweet-talking, or outright fabricating, she always makes sure her version of reality is the one people believe. Enemy forces closing in? Devent still finds time to compliment someone for their &quot;magnificent trigger discipline&quot; or the lance&apos;s scout for &quot;nailing that stealthy approach.&quot; Some think it&apos;s just her way of keeping morale up. Others think she&apos;s stalling, trying to keep herself from processing the violence happening around her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reality is whatever they say it is - until it isn&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
