			<personalityDescription>Nurzhan moves like she&apos;s got an internal reactor running at full burn. Whether it&apos;s work, combat, or downtime, she tackles everything with relentless enthusiasm, always ready for the next challenge. Nurzhan doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. She dissects enemy formations, anticipates movements, and executes plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, she&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Moves like they&apos;re burning fuel nonstop. Thrives on constant engagement.&lt;br&gt;- Strategy-first operator - kills with planning, not firepower.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
