			<personalityDescription>Olympia has survived things that should have killed her - more than once. No matter how many times she gets knocked down, she just keeps getting back up, proving that sometimes, sheer refusal to die is a strategy all its own. Olympia always pushes for more than she can realistically handle. Whether it&apos;s taking on impossible missions, making reckless bets, or biting off more than she can chew, she refuses to accept her limits - often to her own detriment. </personalityDescription>
