			<personalityDescription>Joshua could sell shorts on an ice world and still walk away with a profit. They weave half-truths, dodge direct answers, and always has an excuse ready - because if you can talk your way out of trouble, why bother telling the truth? Joshua is a natural at what they do. Whether it&apos;s piloting, strategy, or problem-solving, they pick things up quickly and executes with precision, making even the most difficult tasks look effortless. </personalityDescription>
