			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Serafim has no patience for hesitation. He faces overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop him. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. People rally behind Serafim because he makes them believe. His confidence, determination, and unwavering presence push others to go beyond their limits, knowing that if he&apos;s leading, victory feels possible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats fear like weakness. Smiles at overwhelming odds. Borderline reckless.&lt;br&gt;- People push harder when {0} walks in. That&apos;s not luck - that&apos;s leadership.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
