			<personalityDescription>Subtlety? Restraint? Cyprian&apos;s never heard of them. If one LRM is good, twenty are better. If a fight can be won cleanly, they&apos;ll still make sure it ends in a glorious fireball. Everything they do is bigger, louder, and more chaotic than it ever needed to be. Cyprian&apos;s voice stays calm and even while everyone else is losing their minds. It doesn&apos;t matter how bad things get - their response is always unshaken, controlled, and matter-of-fact. &quot;Yeah, it&apos;s bad. No, that doesn&apos;t change what we need to do.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 65%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bigger, louder, messier - never clean, never subtle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
