			<personalityDescription>When the moment demands action, Zhao-Yuan doesn&apos;t hesitate. They thrive in high-pressure situations, cutting through doubt and disorder with a clear, unwavering sense of purpose. Zhao-Yuan used to care, used to feel. But war doesn&apos;t care, and eventually, they learned to stop wasting energy on emotions no one had time for. If something&apos;s wrong, they fix it. If something hurts, they push through it. &quot;Pain means you&apos;re still alive. That&apos;s all it means.&quot; </personalityDescription>
