			<personalityDescription>No task is too small, no detail too minor for Orestes to overlook. He works tirelessly, knowing that success isn&apos;t about talent alone - it&apos;s about dedication, preparation, and an unwillingness to settle for mediocrity. Orestes has seen too much, lost too much, to care anymore. The only thing that matters is getting the job done, and if that means making brutal decisions, so be it. In his world, kindness is just another word for weakness. </personalityDescription>
