			<personalityDescription>Falala has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. She lies, cheats, and takes whatever she pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In her mind, the only crime is getting caught. The war never stops, the work never ends, but Falala finds a way to make it just a little less awful. She sticks pun-laden sticky notes on schedules, makes groan-worthy jokes during routine maintenance, and ensures no report leaves her desk without at least one bad pun. No one likes it - but no one really wants her to stop, either. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Laughs at guilt like it&apos;s a bad joke.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
