			<personalityDescription>Meredith isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - she simply doesn&apos;t think about them. She jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for her, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. Meredith never acts on impulse - every move she makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, she plays the long game, ensuring she always comes out ahead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 37%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No thoughts of consequence. Laughs at disaster, races toward it.&lt;br&gt;- Every move is measured. Long-game thinker, never impulsive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
