			<personalityDescription>Markus sees every interaction as a transaction, and he always makes sure he comes out ahead. If there&apos;s a choice between helping others or helping himself, there&apos;s never really a choice at all. Markus doesn&apos;t just want - he takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, he ensures every advantage lands in his pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. </personalityDescription>
