			<personalityDescription>Kassia doesn&apos;t just see the game being played - she plays it better than everyone else. She spots weaknesses, exploits blind spots, and reads people like open books. By the time others realize they&apos;ve been outmaneuvered, it&apos;s already too late. Small talk? Useless. Second-guessing orders? Infuriating. Kassia&apos;s tolerance for anything that slows her down is nonexistent. She&apos;s not always outright angry, but the scowl, the sharp tone, and the way she glares say more than words ever could. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Playing three games at once and winning all of them.&lt;br&gt;- Mood? Permanent scowl. Voice? Razor-edged.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
