			<personalityDescription>Violence isn&apos;t just a tool for Jessica - it&apos;s the default setting. She sees every interaction as a challenge, every stare as a provocation, and every battle as a chance to break something... or someone. Peace is just the pause before the next conflict. Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Jessica - it&apos;s an obsession. She sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in her relentless pursuit of fortune. </personalityDescription>
