			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and restraint are foreign concepts to Amadi. She meets every challenge, real or imagined, with immediate intensity, her first instinct always to escalate rather than back down. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Amadi knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what she wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Escalates everything. First instinct is force, not strategy.&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like strings - never needs to raise a voice.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
