			<personalityDescription>Most people call it bravery, but Marina just calls it fun. She thrives on chaos, laughs in the face of danger, and treats every brush with death like just another story to tell over drinks. Marina thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. She&apos;s impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but her. </personalityDescription>
