			<personalityDescription>Relia knows exactly how to turn on the charm, and she&apos;s not shy about using it. Whether it&apos;s smooth talk, playful banter, or lingering glances, she thrives on attraction and never passes up an opportunity for a little fun. After seeing too much death and betrayal, Relia has stopped caring. She doesn&apos;t form attachments, doesn&apos;t believe in causes, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on emotions. In her mind, caring only leads to pain. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Weaponizes charm. Knows how to smile and take what they want.&lt;br&gt;- Seen too much, feels nothing. Not dead - just numb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
