			<personalityDescription>Margaret meets everyone with suspicion and barely concealed aggression, always expecting betrayal. She sees the universe as a battlefield, where trust is a liability and violence is the only language that truly matters. Margaret sees strength not just in leading but in empowering others. She pushes people to be their best, celebrates their victories, and makes sure they know that, no matter how hard things get, they have someone in their corner. </personalityDescription>
