			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and restraint are foreign concepts to Tracy. She meets every challenge, real or imagined, with immediate intensity, her first instinct always to escalate rather than back down. Tracy doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. </personalityDescription>
