			<personalityDescription>To Bona, every situation is a battlefield, and they play it like a master tactician. They anticipate actions before they happen, positioning themself for success while others struggle to keep up. Bona refuses to rely on digital records, still handwrites reports, and triple-checks every automated system by hand. &quot;What happens when the system crashes?&quot; they ask, tapping their paper records. &quot;I&apos;ll still know where everything is. Will you?&quot; </personalityDescription>
