			<personalityDescription>Barnabá has no patience for nonsense. He cuts through distractions and emotions, keeping his mind locked onto the mission. While others get lost in doubt or debate, he moves forward with ruthless efficiency. Barnabá simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even his own well-being are secondary to whatever he deems important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of his inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not his. </personalityDescription>
