			<personalityDescription>Carl doesn&apos;t believe in playing it safe. He thrives on risk, constantly pushing limits and daring fate to keep up - because to him, caution is just another word for hesitation. Carl doesn&apos;t rush - he refines. Every plan, every shot, every move is calculated and practiced until it&apos;s second nature. He believes that mastery comes from discipline, and discipline comes from doing the work no one else is willing to. </personalityDescription>
