			<personalityDescription>Once, Sylvaine might have wanted more, but now? They&apos;ve seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Sylvaine has long since stopped caring. Sylvaine is never satisfied - their hunger for power, resources, and dominance knows no limits. They devour opportunities, crush competition, and take what they want without hesitation. Sooner or later, even their allies will wonder if they&apos;re next. </personalityDescription>
