			<personalityDescription>Good enough is never good enough for Kifaaya. She grind herself to the bone, pushing past exhaustion, knowing that even the slightest lapse in preparation could mean failure - or death. She doesn&apos;t stop, because stopping means weakness. To Kifaaya, restraint is a foreign concept. She surrounds herself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy her endless cravings - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
