			<personalityDescription>Eirica isn&apos;t interested in debates or second opinions - she&apos;s here to get things done. Her confidence is a stabilizing force, her direction clear, and when others waver, they instinctively look to her to lead the way. Eirica refuses to do anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s war, business, or pleasure, she throws herself into everything with a level of intensity that&apos;s exhilarating - or terrifying, depending on where you stand. </personalityDescription>
