			<personalityDescription>Nova refuses to back down, no matter the circumstances. Once she sets her mind on something, there&apos;s no changing it - whether that&apos;s holding the line in battle or refusing to admit she was wrong. Loyalty is just another tool to be used and discarded. Nova lies, betrays, and manipulates without hesitation, making promises she never intends to keep. If someone still trusts her, it&apos;s only because they haven&apos;t been burned yet. </personalityDescription>
