			<personalityDescription>Rossano never plays fair - he plays to win. Every promise, every alliance, every deal is just another tool in his arsenal, and he always ensures he comes out ahead. Rossano doesn&apos;t let morality get in the way of what he wants. Rules, ethics, and ideals are just obstacles to be sidestepped when necessary - he does whatever works, and if that means playing dirty, so be it. </personalityDescription>
