			<personalityDescription>Violence isn&apos;t just a tool for Marriba - it&apos;s the default setting. She sees every interaction as a challenge, every stare as a provocation, and every battle as a chance to break something... or someone. Peace is just the pause before the next conflict. Marriba&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. She takes and takes, pushing herself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. Her drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 64%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Interprets peace as waiting room for violence. Every glance is a challenge.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes past limits like they don&apos;t exist. Burnout risk? Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
