			<personalityDescription>Carletta never hides behind false pretenses or empty words. She stands by her beliefs, never bending to fit expectations, and makes no apologies for who she is - whether people like it or not. Carletta doesn&apos;t just have a rival - she has a fixation. A constant presence in her life that keeps her pushing forward, staying sharp, refusing to slip into complacency. Without that challenge, she&apos;s not sure she&apos;d know what to do with herself anymore. &quot;Without them, I don&apos;t know who I&apos;d be. And that scares me more than losing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No masks. No spin. Just one stubborn, honest bastard.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
