			<performanceExamScore>55</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Doubt and hesitation have no place in Chiyono&apos;s mind. Once they set their course, nothing - not fear, not failure, not even overwhelming odds - will make them stray from it. Chiyono tracks wins and losses, not just their own, but everyone&apos;s. How many battles won, how many contracts failed, how many comrades lost. They used to think if they could just get ahead, just win enough, it would mean something. But the names on the &quot;Losses&quot; side of their ledger keep growing, and they&apos;re starting to realize - maybe, in this life, nobody really wins. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No room for doubt. Once locked in, nothing sways them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
