			<personalityDescription>Gerrit doesn&apos;t hesitate when faced with the impossible - They meet it head-on, with a steady gaze and an unshakable will. They know that fear is inevitable, but surrender is a choice. Between adjusting their sleeves and straightening their belt, Gerrit runs things with unsettling speed. They can load a DropShip in record time while never once standing still. Some think they&apos;re just high-strung, but the company keeps running because of them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Faces the impossible with level focus. Fear acknowledged, never obeyed.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
