			<personalityDescription>Syed sees morality as a luxury he can&apos;t afford. If there&apos;s a faster, more efficient way to get ahead - no matter how brutal - he&apos;ll take it without hesitation or regret. Syed&apos;s trash talk isn&apos;t cruel - it&apos;s just how he interacts. If he&apos;s not making fun of you, it&apos;s probably a bad sign. &quot;Oh, you actually got it right this time? Guess miracles do happen.&quot; </personalityDescription>
