			<personalityDescription>Juan doesn&apos;t care about honor, mercy, or sentiment - only results. They dissect every situation with ruthless precision, seeing people as assets, obstacles, or liabilities. If a sacrifice needs to be made, they won&apos;t hesitate to pull the trigger. Juan&apos;s presence is electric, their passion infectious. Whether rallying troops, seizing opportunities, or leading the charge, they command attention and action, making things happen while others are still thinking. </personalityDescription>
