			<personalityDescription>Steve lives by one rule: act now, figure out the details later. He barrels through obstacles with sheer confidence, trusting that if things go wrong, he&apos;ll deal with it when he gets there - assuming he even cares. Steve isn&apos;t heartless, just detached. He doesn&apos;t feel the need to intervene, fix things, or fight for anything beyond his own survival. If someone expects him to care, they&apos;ll be sorely disappointed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges through obstacles. Plans on-the-fly, if at all. May improvise into disaster.&lt;br&gt;- Detached, not cruel - but don&apos;t count on backup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
