			<personalityDescription>Steve treats the impossible like an invitation. He never slows down, never looks back, and never lets fear dictate his choices - because, to him, fear is just an excuse he refuses to entertain. Nothing Steve does is by chance - he plays the long game, reading between the lines and thinking five steps ahead. By the time others realize what&apos;s happening, he&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
