			<personalityDescription>Enakai walks into every room like he owns it and onto every battlefield like victory is already assured. Whether it&apos;s skill, luck, or sheer arrogance, Enakai makes it look easy - and he makes sure everyone knows it. Enakai believes in his unit and makes sure they know it. Whether it&apos;s a few words of confidence before a mission or lifting someone up after a failure, he always pushes others to be their best. </personalityDescription>
