			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, and impossible odds mean nothing to Alberto. They will fight until the mission is done, even if it means crawling from the wreckage to finish the job with their bare hands. &quot;It&apos;ll hold.&quot; &quot;We&apos;ll figure something out.&quot; &quot;Things&apos;ll work out.&quot; Alberto repeats the same reassurances over and over, not because they believe them, but because it&apos;s what people need to hear. They know the truth. But saying it wouldn&apos;t help anyone, least of all themself. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will finish the mission bleeding and broken if needed. Pure willpower.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
