			<personalityDescription>Herkole&apos;s patience is as short as his temper is explosive. He doesn&apos;t wait, doesn&apos;t deliberate - he reacts, fast and forceful, often leaving those around him scrambling to keep up. Herkole always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. He knows when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Zero patience. Reacts fast, hits hard. Team scrambles to keep pace.&lt;br&gt;- Times every deal perfectly. Leaves the rest of us holding the receipt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
