			<personalityDescription>Lodoiska never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, she&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - she calls it smart business. Lodoiska doesn&apos;t ask for thanks - she just hands over a jacket or a pair of gloves and moves on. She treats it like it&apos;s basic maintenance, not a personal favor. &quot;It&apos;s cold. You didn&apos;t have gloves. Problem solved.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds every deal dry. Doesn&apos;t care who&apos;s on the other end.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
