			<personalityDescription>Trust is a liability, and Wyatt trusts no one. He watches every angle, anticipating betrayal, ambushes, and unseen threats. Whether it&apos;s paranoia or wisdom, his constant vigilance has kept him alive this long. Wyatt isn&apos;t loud about his support, but it&apos;s always there. A nod at the right time, an unspoken gesture of help, or simply being present when it matters - his strength lies in knowing exactly what people need, even when they don&apos;t ask for it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 62%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one. Sees betrayal coming - or assumes it&apos;s already here.&lt;br&gt;- Knows what you need before you ask. Delivers, quiet and sure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
