			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Ruth&apos;s world. She steps forward without looking back, her decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether she&apos;s right or wrong, she never lingers in uncertainty. No achievement satisfies Ruth for long. She devours challenges with reckless enthusiasm, only to discard them once conquered, already looking for the next impossible feat to chase. </personalityDescription>
