			<personalityDescription>Chris is convinced he&apos;s the best warrior, the best tactician, and probably the smartest person in the room. He doesn&apos;t just believe in himself - he assumes everyone else is playing catch-up, whether they realize it or not. Chris fights for one thing: the highest bidder. He&apos;s not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps him alive and well-paid. </personalityDescription>
