			<personalityDescription>Eleonore doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. She weaves half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while she walks away unscathed - and usually richer. Eleonore doesn&apos;t stop moving, doesn&apos;t stop talking, because stopping means having to think about how bad things really are. If she just keeps moving, keeps explaining, analyzing, summarizing, maybe she won&apos;t have to acknowledge just how close  everything is to falling apart. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Words over weapons. Turns enemies on each other, walks off clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
