			<personalityDescription>Waluyo doesn&apos;t see battle as a contest - he sees it as extermination. There&apos;s no such thing as a fair fight or an honorable duel, only the absolute certainty that when the dust settles, he&apos;ll be the last one standing. Waluyo approaches every obstacle with the unshakable certainty that he can overcome it. He thrives in high-stakes moments, his excitement infectious as he drives himself and those around him forward with almost reckless enthusiasm. </personalityDescription>
