			<personalityDescription>Why wait when you can act? Alana leaps before looking, speaks before thinking, and never backs down from a challenge. Whether it&apos;s a high-stakes battle or a bad bet, she is always rolling the dice, just to see what happens. Alana doesn&apos;t waste time on people or ideas she deems unimportant. If she thinks someone&apos;s opinion is useless, she brushes them off without a second thought and moves forward on her own terms. </personalityDescription>
