			<personalityDescription>Doubt and hesitation have no place in Jaffar&apos;s mind. Once he sets his course, nothing - not fear, not failure, not even overwhelming odds - will make him stray from it. Jaffar doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t make sacrifices, and doesn&apos;t waste time on anyone who can&apos;t offer him something in return. His survival, success, and comfort always come first - everything else is secondary. </personalityDescription>
