			<personalityDescription>Loc measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To him, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw he has no intention of indulging. Everything revolves around him - at least, that&apos;s how he sees it. Loc uses people for his own gain, dismisses anyone who doesn&apos;t serve his interests, and considers loyalty a one-way street where he&apos;s always at the top. </personalityDescription>
