			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fine line between bravery and recklessness, but Jill doesn&apos;t care. She leaps before she looks, convinced that if no one else dares to try, it just means she&apos;s the only one bold enough to succeed. Jill has a habit of showing up where she&apos;s not supposed to be and knowing things she shouldn&apos;t know. If you ask her how, she just smirks and changes the subject. &quot;Oh, that? Let&apos;s just say I have sources.&quot; </personalityDescription>
