			<personalityDescription>Laverne isn&apos;t just chasing a dream - she&apos;s clawing for survival in a universe that doesn&apos;t care. She knows ambition alone won&apos;t get her there, and she&apos;s willing to fight, bleed, and sacrifice to make sure she&apos;s not just another forgotten warrior. Laverne doesn&apos;t slow down, doesn&apos;t stop, doesn&apos;t rest. Whether in battle, in business, or in pursuit of power, she demands more - more resources, more control, more everything - because anything less feels like losing. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fighting for more than glory - fighting to be remembered. Survival with purpose.&lt;br&gt;- Operates like the universe owes them more. Never stops collecting.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
