			<personalityDescription>Morality is just a tool for the naive. Saman does whatever it takes to get ahead, stepping over anyone who gets in her way and never looking back. Saman makes sure everyone feels wanted, needed, remembered. She laughs with the fresh-faced recruits, gives the Techs a warm shoulder squeeze after a long shift, and never lets a MekWarrior leave without a genuine, &quot;Be safe, okay?&quot; But in this line of work, people disappear - sometimes violently, sometimes just gone between contracts. Saman remembers all their names. And she never stops grieving. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 65%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks trust faster than necks. Cold. Efficient.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
