			<personalityDescription>Yessenia doesn&apos;t acknowledge fear as anything more than a passing thought. She moves forward with unwavering certainty, meeting every challenge as if failure were never a possibility. Yessenia always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear she thinks she&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, she has a way of making others feel small without ever raising her voice. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t consider failure. Confidence absolute - maybe dangerously so.&lt;br&gt;- Smirks before they speak. You know the tone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
