			<personalityDescription>Le charges headfirst into danger without hesitation, trusting instinct and luck to carry them through. Whether it&apos;s an impossible maneuver or a head-on assault, they never stop to ask if it&apos;s a good idea - only if it&apos;s exciting. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Le knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what they want - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rushes into danger without pause. Seeks excitement, not survival.&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like strings - never needs to raise a voice.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
