			<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Albina like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. She fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Albina measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To her, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw she has no intention of indulging. </personalityDescription>
