			<personalityDescription>Distractions are for other people - Guy doesn&apos;t indulge them. He keeps his attention locked onto the task at hand, tuning out anything that doesn&apos;t push him closer to success. Guy talks like he&apos;s drafting a contract in real time. Whether it&apos;s discussing orders, timelines, or options, every word is deliberate, precise. No one ever walks away confused - but they do sometimes walk away wondering if they just got outmaneuvered in a simple conversation. </personalityDescription>
