			<personalityDescription>Eudaldo has a sharp eye for the right moment to strike - whether it&apos;s on the battlefield, in business, or in personal dealings. They&apos;re always looking for an angle, ready to seize any advantage that presents itself. Eudaldo has a habit of stretching the truth - sometimes a little, sometimes a lot. Whether it&apos;s exaggerating their accomplishments, fudging numbers, or making promises they can&apos;t keep, they always find a way to make themself look better than they really are. </personalityDescription>
