			<personalityDescription>Ruwaida has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. She gets frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding her annoyance. While alarms blare and chaos erupts, Ruwaida is whistling a tune and getting to work. The DropShip might be on fire, the systems might be failing, but that won&apos;t stop her from casually humming an old folk song as she works. </personalityDescription>
