			<personalityDescription>Ambrose is a walking powder keg, always a moment away from igniting. His temper flares fast and burns bright, leaving little room for reason once he&apos;s set on a path - whether right or wrong. Ambrose doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action he takes is calculated to serve his own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always one spark from exploding. Reason stops mattering once temper flares.&lt;br&gt;- No favors, no debts. Operates on pure self-interest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
