			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Zefjm keeps moving. They refuse to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. Zefjm sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. They take what they need, wring every ounce of value out of those around them, and discard them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. </personalityDescription>
