			<personalityDescription>Compromise is just another word for weakness in Camilla&apos;s mind. She doesn&apos;t negotiate or accommodate - she dictates, expecting the world to move according to her vision, whether others like it or not. Loyalty is just a word, and Camilla has no use for it. She lies, schemes, and betrays without hesitation, using anyone and everyone to climb higher. If someone trusts her, they&apos;ve already lost. </personalityDescription>
