			<personalityDescription>Ryan plays to win, and he doesn&apos;t care how messy it gets. Whether it&apos;s business, politics, or the battlefield, he exploits weaknesses, eliminates competition, and ensures he&apos;s the last one standing - no matter the cost. Ryan sees every challenge as an opportunity, but his hunger for success often blinds him to reality. He pushes past safe margins, ignoring warnings, convinced that as long as he keeps moving forward, nothing can stop him - until it does. </personalityDescription>
