			<personalityDescription>If Aetos isn&apos;t in control, he isn&apos;t comfortable. He orchestrates every move, dictates every step, and ensures that nothing happens without his approval - because, in his mind, no one else can be trusted to do it right. Aetos sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, he doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in his mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. </personalityDescription>
