			<personalityDescription>Mahendra doesn&apos;t wait for things to happen - he makes them happen. Whether it&apos;s seizing the initiative in battle, fixing a problem before it escalates, or taking charge when others hesitate, he&apos;s always one step ahead. Mahendra has little patience for incompetence, delays, or pointless chatter. He gets frustrated easily, especially when things aren&apos;t going according to plan, and doesn&apos;t bother hiding his annoyance. </personalityDescription>
