			<personalityDescription>Kerianne believes she&apos;s the best, and she acts like it. Whether she&apos;s fighting for her life, strategizing, or calling the shots, she never doubts herself - even when she really should. The war grinds people down. Names disappear from rosters, beds go empty, another late-night report comes in full of losses. Kerianne sings because if she stops, she&apos;ll have to process it all. As long as the song keeps going, so does she. </personalityDescription>
