			<personalityDescription>Kazomas doesn&apos;t deal in half-truths or carefully worded pleasantries. She calls things exactly as she sees them, no matter how uncomfortable it makes people - because, to her, honesty is more valuable than diplomacy. Kazomas turns everything into exercise. Organizing inventory? She carries two crates at once for the added resistance. Long-haul travel on a JumpShip? She&apos;s doing workouts in zero-G. If she&apos;s standing still, she&apos;s probably clenching her abs just to make sure she&apos;s &quot;maximizing muscle engagement.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Says the thing everyone else avoids - loud, clear, and on purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
