			<personalityDescription>Mike doesn&apos;t just want to prove himself - he needs to. He throws himself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show he&apos;s worthy of something bigger. While he doesn&apos;t seek attention, Mike notices everything. He listens more than he speaks, analyzes before he acts, and values deep conversations over shallow chatter. His quiet nature makes his words all the more impactful when he chooses to share them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Desperate to prove something - watch for burnout.&lt;br&gt;- Quiet type. Won&apos;t lead the toast, but will notice who&apos;s missing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
