			<personalityDescription>Melissa&apos;s excitement is contagious. They approach every challenge with boundless energy, hyping up their team and keeping morale high. Even when the odds look bad, they&apos;re the first to grin and say, &quot;Let&apos;s do this.&quot; Supplies are running low, requests are piling up, another lance isn&apos;t coming back - but Melissa&apos;s still smiling. &quot;Don&apos;t worry, we&apos;ll figure it out,&quot; they say, flashing a grin that&apos;s just a little too forced. No one believes them. </personalityDescription>
