			<personalityDescription>Nothing slows Abhijeet down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. He grinds forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in his mind, stopping is just another way of dying. Nothing Abhijeet does is without calculation. He manipulates trust, extracts favors, and keeps people close just long enough to drain them of their usefulness before moving on to the next opportunity. </personalityDescription>
