			<personalityDescription>Nora walks into every fight like she owns the battlefield, radiating confidence and daring anyone to prove her wrong. Whether it&apos;s leading the charge or taunting an enemy over open comms, she thrives on being the center of attention - and usually has the skills to back it up. Nora knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, she&apos;ll take the best deal for herself. She&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, she&apos;ll make sure she walks away with the biggest share. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Owns every fight. Loud, showy, competent. Uses confidence as a weapon.&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
