			<personalityDescription>Some call it paranoia; Liam calls it survival. He keeps his eyes open, his mind sharp, and his instincts honed, because the moment he lets his guard down, he knows that&apos;s when disaster will strike. Liam doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights - he believes in surviving. He&apos;ll lie, cheat, betray, and destroy without hesitation, because in his world, there&apos;s no room for second place. If someone isn&apos;t strong enough to keep up, they don&apos;t deserve to be here. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Calls it survival, not paranoia. Guard never drops, not for a second.&lt;br&gt;- Fair fights are for fools. Ruthless, deceptive, and deadly efficient.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
