			<personalityDescription>Judy has a knack for turning every situation into a payday. Whether it&apos;s salvage rights, lucrative contracts, or well-placed investments, they always find a way to make sure their time and effort result in cold, hard cash. Judy rarely takes others seriously, rolling their eyes at concerns they don&apos;t find valid. Whether it&apos;s a risky plan, a personal grievance, or a suggestion they think is dumb, they shut it down with a snide remark and move on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always walks away with more than they came in with. Smiles while others scrape.&lt;br&gt;- Eye-rolls and shutdowns. Doesn&apos;t bother pretending to care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
