			<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Katarine like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. She fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Katarine - it&apos;s an obsession. She sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in her relentless pursuit of fortune. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fueled by anger. Never lets an insult slide - on or off the field.&lt;br&gt;- Greed isnt a flaw here - its the mission.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
