			<personalityDescription>Yelena adapts faster than anyone else. She thrives in unpredictability, adjusting her approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes her way - no matter who gets left behind. Yelena doesn&apos;t just have a battle plan - she has twelve. If the enemy flanks, if they get pinned down, if weather conditions shift unexpectedly - she&apos;s already thought it through. Her lance used to roll their eyes at her paranoia, but after surviving one too many ambushes thanks to Yelena&apos;s foresight, they don&apos;t complain anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrives in chaos. Adapts instantly, leaves others scrambling to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
