			<personalityDescription>Julia doesn&apos;t just want - she takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, she ensures every advantage lands in her pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. Julia wears the uniform, the gear, the weight of the war - but none of it ever feels real. She moves like she&apos;s trapped in armor that isn&apos;t her own, unsure if the person she once was is even still underneath it all. &quot;I don&apos;t know if this body was ever mine. I just know it&apos;s the only one I&apos;ve got.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes first, asks never. If it&apos;s not nailed down, it&apos;s already theirs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
