			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Henrietta avoids - it&apos;s something she seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, She meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Henrietta. She&apos;s seen what chasing those things does to people, and she&apos;s perfectly happy staying right where she is, watching others run themselves into the ground. </personalityDescription>
