			<personalityDescription>Trust is a liability, and Jamie trusts no one. She watches every angle, anticipating betrayal, ambushes, and unseen threats. Whether it&apos;s paranoia or wisdom, her constant vigilance has kept her alive this long. Jamie isn&apos;t just smart - she understands why people do what they do. She offers sharp observations, unexpected wisdom, and just the right words to make others think twice. Whether leading or advising, her insight makes her a valuable ally. </personalityDescription>
