			<personalityDescription>Nothing satisfies Karajala for long. He hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand his fortune - no matter the cost to those around him. Karajala takes warfare very seriously - right up until the moment he tapes over someone&apos;s targeting reticle with a tiny, smiling skull sticker. His lance knows that if things have been too quiet, someone is about to find their personal comms blasting MekWarrior recruitment jingles in the middle of battle. </personalityDescription>
