			<personalityDescription>Towiko&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Towiko has a talent for convincing others to do the hard work while she reaps the rewards. She plays on emotions, dangles promises just out of reach, and always manages to walk away with more than she put in. If someone ends up shortchanged, that&apos;s their problem. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;br&gt;- Lets others do the work, then pockets the rewards with a smile.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
