			<personalityDescription>Nighean fights for one thing: the highest bidder. She&apos;s not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps her alive and well-paid. &quot;You really think a giant walking target is the best way to fight a war?&quot; Nighean scoffs. She doesn&apos;t trust &apos;Meks, doesn&apos;t like &apos;Meks, and won&apos;t stop reminding everyone that half of history&apos;s worst battles were fought with people betting their lives on unreliable metal coffins. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hired gun. No cause, no loyalty - just money.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
