			<personalityDescription>Nicholas builds their life on lies, and they&apos;re good at it. False identities, rigged contracts, and backroom deals are just part of the game they play. The real trick isn&apos;t just fooling people - it&apos;s making sure they never realize they&apos;ve been fooled at all. The universe is broken, and Nicholas knows it. They don&apos;t get involved in arguments, don&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly don&apos;t stick their neck out for anyone. As far as they&apos;re concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lives in a house of cards and dares you to knock.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fight. Doesnt flinch. Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
