			<personalityDescription>Carl believes the best defense is an overwhelming offense, always pushing forward and keeping up the pressure. Hesitation is weakness, and they refuse to give their opponents a chance to recover. Carl measures success in wealth and power, and they refuse to settle for anything less than everything. If there&apos;s something to gain, they&apos;ll take it - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes in pressure. Always attacking. No room for defensive fallback.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt take a slice - takes the whole damn pie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
