			<personalityDescription>Jamie sees strength not just in leading but in empowering others. She pushes people to be their best, celebrates their victories, and makes sure they know that, no matter how hard things get, they have someone in their corner. Jamie&apos;s speech patterns are completely unpredictable. One moment, she&apos;s speaking with a crisp, formal tone; the next, she&apos;s dropped into a thick drawl or clipped military jargon. &quot;Aye, lad, ye best watch yer flank - oh, wait, I mean, move your ass before they frag you.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes others forward, never needs the spotlight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
