			<personalityDescription>Jyotika approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. She doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. Jyotika has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect her. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to her, it&apos;s all just noise. She does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
