			<personalityDescription>Loan doesn&apos;t just set goals - she demands results. No matter the challenge, no matter the obstacles, she pushes herself relentlessly forward, refusing to accept anything less than success. Loan doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, she&apos;s already onto the next big score. </personalityDescription>
