			<personalityDescription>Josep never forgets a slight, no matter how small. Whether it&apos;s a lost bet, a sarcastic remark, or someone taking his favorite mug, he finds ways to get back at people - usually with just enough humor to keep it from being outright malicious. Managing his tasks isn&apos;t just a job for Josep - it&apos;s a game. Every day is another piece in the ever-changing puzzle of how to keep the company running. He doesn&apos;t ust solve problems - he anticipates them. </personalityDescription>
