			<personalityDescription>Ambuvica is convinced he can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. He stretches himself thin, takes on risks he shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether he can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of his vocabulary. Yet. &quot;Alexander once said-&quot; &quot;Ambuvica, please.&quot; Whether it&apos;s an ancient philosopher or a forgotten MekWarrior, he always has a quote to fit the situation. His lance tolerates it because, somehow, his endless library of words actually makes them think. </personalityDescription>
