			<personalityDescription>To Tolono, control isn&apos;t a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. She dictates every move, barks orders without question, and refuses to tolerate disobedience. In her world, authority isn&apos;t earned - it&apos;s enforced. Tolono measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To her, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw she has no intention of indulging. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enforces authority, not leadership. Obedience expected, not requested.&lt;br&gt;- Emotion is leverage, not weakness. Hesitation isn&apos;t tolerated.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
