			<personalityDescription>Rose chases every high, every challenge, every risk like they&apos;re possessed. Whether it&apos;s wealth, battle, or adrenaline, they can&apos;t stop themself from pushing further, faster, and harder - because the moment they slow down, they get bored. And that is unacceptable. Rose used to wonder why they had to log their every action. Why they had to check in with command even for minor tasks. Why their reports were always cross-checked against surveillance logs. But they stopped asking questions when they saw what happened to the last guy who didn&apos;t follow procedure. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Restless, reckless, always hunting the next rush. Can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
