			<personalityDescription>Krystyna doesn&apos;t keep score - she gives freely, whether it&apos;s supplies, favors, or hard-earned wisdom. She believes that lifting others up strengthens everyone, and she never hesitates to share what she has. Krystyna eats like someone who&apos;s seen real hunger. She never throws food away, never turns down a meal, and has a habit of keeping emergency rations even when food is plentiful. Sometimes, she chews slower, as if trying to make each bite last, staring at her plate like she&apos;s seeing something the rest of them can&apos;t - like she&apos;s remembering. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t ask for anything back - gives like it&apos;s strategy, not charity.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
