			<personalityDescription>For Chan-su, hesitation is just another form of failure. He throws himself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, he never slows down. Chan-su doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. He does what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in his world, only the strong deserve to survive. </personalityDescription>
