			<personalityDescription>Corine has a habit of stretching the truth - sometimes a little, sometimes a lot. Whether it&apos;s exaggerating her accomplishments, fudging numbers, or making promises she can&apos;t keep, she always finds a way to make herself look better than she really is. Corine is the kind of person who remembers names, listens to stories, and makes people feel valued. Whether in the heat of battle or in downtime between missions, her ability to connect with others makes her the heart of any crew. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Shines up mediocrity like it&apos;s gold - good at making nothing sound impressive.&lt;br&gt;- Even the grunts open up to them. That says a lot.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
