			<personalityDescription>Sevita&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in battle - it&apos;s in people. She connects with others effortlessly, making them feel heard, valued, and understood. Whether leading a unit or comforting a friend, her empathy draws others to her. Sevita knows the universe is cruel, that fate doesn&apos;t care. But omens? Omens give order to the chaos. They tell her when to act, when to wait, when to prepare for the worst. Because if she ever stops believing in the signs, she&apos;ll have to accept that nothing is watching out for them at all. </personalityDescription>
