			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fire in Yusa&apos;s eyes that never dims, a relentless drive that refuses to acknowledge limits. Whether facing a challenge or simply making her presence known, she moves through life like she&apos;s already won. People want to believe Yusa. Her words are smooth, her arguments airtight, and her timing impeccable. She plants ideas like seeds, letting them take root until others think they were their own all along. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fire-eyed. Acts like the outcome&apos;s already certain - and it favors them.&lt;br&gt;- Ideas take root. You only notice when it&apos;s too late.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
