			<personalityDescription>Olivia doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. They do what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in their world, only the strong deserve to survive. It doesn&apos;t matter if they&apos;re in a war room, a DropShip, or an active battlefield - if Olivia has a pen, they&apos;re clicking it. &quot;Do you have to do that?&quot; someone groans during a mission briefing. &quot;Yes,&quot; they say, still clicking. The others don&apos;t believe them, but they never stop. </personalityDescription>
