			<personalityDescription>Nivens doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if he&apos;s daring the world to give him a reason to lash out. Nivens doesn&apos;t see the point in fighting for a bigger slice of the pie when he&apos;s already got enough to get by. Others can stress over promotions and prestige - he&apos;ll take his time, do what&apos;s necessary, and enjoy life without all the extra pressure. </personalityDescription>
