			<personalityDescription>Giustino has a knack for finding common ground, turning tense situations into opportunities. Whether negotiating a ceasefire or keeping a lance from falling apart, he knows the right words can be as powerful as a loaded autocannon. Giustino says exactly what&apos;s on his mind, with no concern for sugarcoating or social niceties. If the truth is harsh, so be it - he sees no point in dressing it up. </personalityDescription>
