			<personalityDescription>Eytor doesn&apos;t just set goals - he demands results. No matter the challenge, no matter the obstacles, he pushes himself relentlessly forward, refusing to accept anything less than success. Patience has never been Eytor&apos;s strong suit. He leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, his restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - he lives for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sets high goals and demands results. Accepts nothing short of success.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
