			<personalityDescription>Igider doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects them to stick their neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. Loyalty is just another tool to be used and discarded. Igider lies, betrays, and manipulates without hesitation, making promises they never intend to keep. If someone still trusts them, it&apos;s only because they haven&apos;t been burned yet. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one, helps no one, and always walks away richer.&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty lasts exactly one paycheck. Maybe less.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
