			<personalityDescription>Ann doesn&apos;t go down easy. Even when the odds are stacked against her, she grits her teeth, digs in, and keeps pushing forward. She&apos;s the kind of fighter who walks out of a wrecked &apos;Mek, bleeding but grinning, ready for round two. Trusting Ann is a mistake most people only make once. She weaves a careful web of half-truths and false assurances, making it nearly impossible to tell where her real motives lie - until she&apos;s already gotten what she wanted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grits teeth, keeps moving. Bleeding, grinning, ready for more.&lt;br&gt;- Smiles like a friend, schemes like an enemy. Don&apos;t turn your back.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
