			<personalityDescription>Good enough is never good enough for Felizitas. They grind themself to the bone, pushing past exhaustion, knowing that even the slightest lapse in preparation could mean failure - or death. They don&apos;t stop, because stopping means weakness. Felizitas doesn&apos;t trust standard-issue gear - they prefer their own  meticulously maintained, custom-modified weapons. Each one has a purpose, a history, and a reason for being in their collection. &quot;Command says &apos;stick to regs.&apos; Command can borrow my backups when theirs fail.&quot; </personalityDescription>
