			<personalityDescription>Rahmat has survived things that should have killed them - more than once. No matter how many times they get knocked down, they just keep getting back up, proving that sometimes, sheer refusal to die is a strategy all its own. Rahmat has a sharp eye for the right moment to strike - whether it&apos;s on the battlefield, in business, or in personal dealings. They&apos;re always looking for an angle, ready to seize any advantage that presents itself. </personalityDescription>
