			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Dwan pushes ahead. Risk doesn&apos;t concern her, and consequences are an afterthought - if there&apos;s a way through, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how dangerous the path. Compassion is a weakness Dwan can&apos;t afford. She doesn&apos;t hesitate to make hard decisions, sacrifice allies, or eliminate threats with cold efficiency. In her mind, survival means shutting out anything that might make her hesitate. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rushes where others pause. Sees risk, ignores it. Goal matters more.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts ties as easily as throats - doesn&apos;t blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
