			<personalityDescription>Refugio doesn&apos;t keep score - she gives freely, whether it&apos;s supplies, favors, or hard-earned wisdom. She believes that lifting others up strengthens everyone, and she never hesitates to share what she has. Refugio doesn&apos;t just think highly of herself - she expects everyone else to recognize her supposed brilliance. Whether it&apos;s in combat, leadership, or simple conversation, she makes sure everyone knows they&apos;re in the presence of greatness. </personalityDescription>
