			<personalityDescription>Claudina doesn&apos;t just want success - she demands it. She climbs over anyone in her way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In her mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Claudina wrings her hands while waiting for battle to start, during mission briefings, even mid-skirmish. She sees every possible way things could go wrong and can&apos;t help but fret over them. Her lance jokes that if she ever stops rubbing her hands together, that&apos;s when they should start panicking. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts deals, cuts throats - climbs to the top by any means.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
