			<personalityDescription>Armand thrives on momentum, always pressing forward with an intensity that makes backing down seem impossible. He refuses to slow down, always demanding more, pushing himself and everyone around him past their limits. Armand doesn&apos;t panic, doesn&apos;t flinch, doesn&apos;t react to chaos like everyone else does. Whether it&apos;s losing an advantage, being outnumbered, or watching allies fall, he just keeps moving. &quot;Fear won&apos;t save you. Acting will.&quot; </personalityDescription>
