			<personalityDescription>Sesto trusts exactly one person to get things done right - themself. They nitpick every detail, override decisions they don&apos;t like, and refuse to delegate unless they have no other choice. Sesto always looks out for number one. If a situation doesn&apos;t benefit them directly, they&apos;re not interested. They&apos;ll work with others when it suits them, but the moment it stops being profitable, they&apos;re already moving on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one to do it right. Overrides and nitpicks constantly.&lt;br&gt;- Helps when it helps them - otherwise, not their problem.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
