			<personalityDescription>Sigifrid thrives on audacity. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether he&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, he does it all with a smirk and a shrug. Sigifrid connects everything to a larger plot. If an enemy force is moving strangely, if supply lines are disrupted, if things just feel off - he has a theory. It might be paranoia, but sometimes, he&apos;s right, and that&apos;s the most dangerous part. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Built from brass and boldness. No filter, no fear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
