			<personalityDescription>Some call it paranoia; Harley calls it survival. He keeps his eyes open, his mind sharp, and his instincts honed, because the moment he lets his guard down, he knows that&apos;s when disaster will strike. Harley has an instinct for reading between the lines. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield, a business deal, or a negotiation, he sees angles others miss and exploits them before anyone realizes what&apos;s happening. </personalityDescription>
