			<personalityDescription>Lugunjia doesn&apos;t just want success - she demands it. She climbs over anyone in her way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In her mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Reading between the lines is second nature to Lugunjia. She picks up on tone, body language, and unspoken concerns, responding with careful precision to make sure no detail - no matter how small - goes unnoticed. </personalityDescription>
