			<personalityDescription>Ella notices the details others miss - the flicker of movement in the distance, the shift in tone during negotiations. She stays sharp, ready to act at a moment&apos;s notice, because the one time she isn&apos;t prepared might be the last. Ella never forgets a slight, no matter how small. Whether it&apos;s a lost bet, a sarcastic remark, or someone taking her favorite mug, she finds ways to get back at people - usually with just enough humor to keep it from being outright malicious. </personalityDescription>
