			<personalityDescription>Sarah doesn&apos;t just do things - she masters them. Her skill and precision make even the most complex tasks seem simple, setting her apart as someone who truly knows her craft. Sarah has seen too many people get left behind. She won&apos;t let it happen again. If her squad is in trouble, she&apos;s already moving to cover them. Because if someone has to take the risk, it&apos;ll be her - every time. </personalityDescription>
