			<personalityDescription>Conrad has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to his side. Whether he&apos;s negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking his way out of trouble, his confidence and charm make it hard to say no. Conrad doesn&apos;t just check the forecast - he studies it. He can predict how wind speeds affect projectile trajectories, how moisture messes with sensor readouts, how cloud cover changes visibility. His squad used to ignore him - until he started being right. </personalityDescription>
