			<personalityDescription>Lucas has a knack for knowing when to act and when to hold back. He listens, observes, and only steps in when the timing is perfect, earning a reputation for making smart, level-headed decisions under pressure. Lucas moves through life like a ghost, detached from the surrounding chaos. Orders are followed, tasks are completed, but there&apos;s no fire behind his actions - just a quiet acceptance that nothing really changes. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 37%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows when to strike. Doesn&apos;t waste moves or words.&lt;br&gt;- Operates on autopilot. Body moves. Mind&apos;s already gone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
