			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fine line between bravery and recklessness, but Saniye doesn&apos;t care. They leap before they look, convinced that if no one else dares to try, it just means they&apos;re the only one bold enough to succeed. Saniye has a way of making everyone feel welcome. Whether it&apos;s a rookie looking for guidance or an old rival at a bar, their easygoing nature and open demeanor put people at ease, breaking down walls before they&apos;re even built. </personalityDescription>
