			<personalityDescription>Umberto&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. He adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in his favor. Umberto doesn&apos;t just fight - he loots. Every battle is a chance to pick up better weapons, spare armor, or rare tech. If it&apos;s not nailed down, he&apos;s already figuring out how to use it. &quot;Waste not, want not. That guy&apos;s not using those boots anymore, so I will.&quot; </personalityDescription>
