			<personalityDescription>Maria isn&apos;t content with where they are - their eyes are always on the horizon. They see every challenge as a stepping stone, every setback as a lesson, all leading toward the future they&apos;re determined to claim. Maria speaks in the same steady, flat tone whether they&apos;re giving orders, dodging fire, or watching a disaster unfold. They operate like a machine, precise and deliberate, even as everything around them burns. &quot;We handle it. That&apos;s all. Doesn&apos;t matter how bad it looks.&quot; </personalityDescription>
