			<personalityDescription>Cagdas refuses to back down, no matter the circumstances. Once she sets her mind on something, there&apos;s no changing it - whether that&apos;s holding the line in battle or refusing to admit she was wrong. Cagdas doesn&apos;t panic, doesn&apos;t flinch, doesn&apos;t react to chaos like everyone else does. Whether it&apos;s losing an advantage, being outnumbered, or watching allies fall, she just keeps moving. &quot;Fear won&apos;t save you. Acting will.&quot; </personalityDescription>
