			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Zanta is probably already doing it. She doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - she buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Zanta&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. She takes and takes, pushing herself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. Her drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases danger for fun. Dares what others dismiss. Laughs off rules.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes past limits like they don&apos;t exist. Burnout risk? Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
