			<personalityDescription>Albina doesn&apos;t just win - she makes sure everyone knows she won. She taunts enemies, overplays her hand, and takes flashy risks just for the sake of proving she can. She&apos;s good - she just might not be as good as she thinks. Albina doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs her skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does her interest. </personalityDescription>
