			<personalityDescription>Louise doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. Louise&apos;s presence alone is enough to lift spirits. Her confidence is contagious, her words ignite courage, and her actions prove that even against impossible odds, there&apos;s always a way forward. </personalityDescription>
