			<personalityDescription>Flavia&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in skill or strategy - it&apos;s in sheer, unyielding willpower. Once she starts something, she&apos;ll see it through to the bitter end, no matter what it costs. Flavia needs to solve puzzles, because once, she couldn&apos;t. A battle gone wrong, a mystery that cost lives, a decision that left her with too many empty chairs around the table. Now, she pieces things together obsessively, trying to prove to herself that there&apos;s always a way out - she just has to find it in time. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will sees them through. Won&apos;t stop until the job&apos;s done - or they are.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
