			<personalityDescription>To Pedro, control isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He demands obedience and tolerates no weakness, bending others to his will through sheer force of personality or, if needed, raw intimidation. Pedro runs himself ragged - pushing his body to the limit, past the pain, past exhaustion. It&apos;s not just discipline - it&apos;s a way to feel something other than this quiet, crawling wrongness. &quot;If I stop moving, I start thinking. And I don&apos;t like where that leads.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Controls through pressure or intimidation. Weakness is punished.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
