			<personalityDescription>Ginata doesn&apos;t just want to prove themself - they need to. They throw themself into battles, push limits, and take on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show they&apos;re worthy of something bigger. Ginata has a natural ability to sense what others are feeling. They listen without judgment, offer genuine support, and always seem to know exactly what someone needs to hear - whether they realize it or not. </personalityDescription>
