			<personalityDescription>Ezana understands that the right words, delivered at the right time, can shift the course of history. He navigates conflicts like a battlefield, always searching for the perfect balance between persuasion and power. Ezana doesn&apos;t explain things - he just does them. If someone asks for a plan, he gives a three-word response. &quot;We win. Let&apos;s go.&quot; Anything beyond that? Unnecessary. </personalityDescription>
