			<personalityDescription>Subtlety? Restraint? Ok-Sun&apos;s never heard of them. If one LRM is good, twenty are better. If a fight can be won cleanly, they&apos;ll still make sure it ends in a glorious fireball. Everything they do is bigger, louder, and more chaotic than it ever needed to be. Ok-Sun enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, they see no reason to deny themself what they desire. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bigger, louder, messier - never clean, never subtle.&lt;br&gt;- No impulse control - if they want it, they take it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
