			<personalityDescription>Pedro&apos;s mind is razor-sharp, cutting through noise and distractions to find the truth hidden beneath. He notices patterns, anticipates outcomes, and always seems to be one step ahead of the game. Pedro used to trust the chain of command. But then he saw too many bad calls, too many good people thrown away like resources. Now, he assumes any order could be the one that gets him - or his squad - killed for someone else&apos;s ambition. </personalityDescription>
