			<personalityDescription>Nothing satisfies Yoon-Hae for long. She hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand her fortune - no matter the cost to those around her. When the fight begins, Yoon-Hae&apos;s voice is calm, rhythmic, measured. A stanza here, a line there, whispered into comms like a battle hymn. Her squad doesn&apos;t know whether to be inspired or unsettled. Her enemies? They just think she&apos;s insane. </personalityDescription>
