			<personalityDescription>Dobromila approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. They don&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. Dobromila rarely takes others seriously, rolling their eyes at concerns they don&apos;t find valid. Whether it&apos;s a risky plan, a personal grievance, or a suggestion they think is dumb, they shut it down with a snide remark and move on. </personalityDescription>
