			<personalityDescription>Some people call it grit, others call it madness, but Ondrej doesn&apos;t care what they think. No matter how much the world tries to grind them down, they keep going, long after anyone else would have quit. Nothing slows Ondrej down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. They grind forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in their mind, stopping is just another way of dying. </personalityDescription>
