			<personalityDescription>Ken acts before thinking, always ready to throw himself into a fight at the slightest provocation. Patience isn&apos;t his strong suit, and keeping Ken in check is often as dangerous as facing the enemy. Ken isn&apos;t just chasing a dream - he&apos;s clawing for survival in a universe that doesn&apos;t care. He knows ambition alone won&apos;t get him there, and he&apos;s willing to fight, bleed, and sacrifice to make sure he&apos;s not just another forgotten warrior. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Impulsive and volatile. Can be as dangerous to friendlies as hostiles.&lt;br&gt;- Fighting for more than glory - fighting to be remembered. Survival with purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
