			<personalityDescription>Ugdada always puts himself first. Whether it&apos;s resources, recognition, or survival, he makes sure he comes out on top - even if it means leaving others behind. Ugdada&apos;s habit of collecting callsigns isn&apos;t just trivia - it&apos;s a survival tactic. He knows who&apos;s on the other side of the radio before they say a word. &quot;That&apos;s Razor on comms. If he&apos;s talking, it&apos;s already bad.&quot; </personalityDescription>
