			<personalityDescription>Kathryn follows a plan to the letter and expects others to do the same. Once she has made a decision, nothing short of disaster - or outright force - will make her change course. Once, Kathryn might have cared. Now, she just drifts. Wars rage, alliances shift, people come and go, and none of it moves her. She does what&apos;s necessary to get by, but passion and purpose are long-forgotten luxuries. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Follows plans rigidly. Won&apos;t adapt unless forced. Expects total conformity.&lt;br&gt;- Burned out long before we met them. Just ash in uniform.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
