			<personalityDescription>Magdalena isn&apos;t loud about their support, but it&apos;s always there. A nod at the right time, an unspoken gesture of help, or simply being present when it matters - their strength lies in knowing exactly what people need, even when they don&apos;t ask for it. Magdalena doesn&apos;t see narrow escapes as luck - they see them as confirmation. Every bullet that whizzes past, every enemy that fails to land a hit just fuels their belief that they&apos;re invincible. &quot;You see that? Didn&apos;t even graze me. Like I said, they can&apos;t hit me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows what you need before you ask. Delivers, quiet and sure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
