			<personalityDescription>To Karima, every situation holds potential - they just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into their gain, they never lets an opening go to waste. Karima eats like someone who&apos;s seen real hunger. They never throw food away, never turn down a meal, and has a habit of keeping emergency rations even when food is plentiful. Sometimes, they chew slower, as if trying to make each bite last, staring at their plate like they&apos;re seeing something the rest of them can&apos;t - like they&apos;re remembering. </personalityDescription>
