			<personalityDescription>Eileen doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if they&apos;re daring the world to give them a reason to lash out. Eileen doesn&apos;t just look down on others - they barely acknowledge them. They see themself as superior in every way, treating allies as tools and enemies as annoyances. If someone disagrees with them, it&apos;s because they&apos;re too stupid to understand why they&apos;re right. </personalityDescription>
