			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Christian has no patience for it. He charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry him through - because hesitation gets people killed. Christian doesn&apos;t bark commands, doesn&apos;t dictate tactics - he just moves with purpose, and people follow. He sets an example, makes decisions without making a show of it, and somehow, his squad ends up doing exactly what needs to be done. &quot;I didn&apos;t tell you what to do,&quot; he shrugs. &quot;You just figured it out.&quot; </personalityDescription>
