			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a goal for Alicia - it&apos;s a skill. They spot opportunities others miss, investing in the right places at the right time, always ensuring that whatever they put in, they get twice as much back. Alicia moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze them - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. They do what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
