			<personalityDescription>Some people accept their place in the universe - Lia refuses to. She dreams big, fights hard, and never stops striving for something greater, no matter how distant or impossible it may seem. While the rest of the squad sticks to standard-issue gear, Lia finds ways to stand out. Maybe it&apos;s a bright red scarf tied around her neck, a custom-painted helmet with flair, or a ridiculous pair of aviator shades that she insists improve her targeting. She fights just as hard as anyone else, but she&apos;ll be damned if she does it without style. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects complacency. Dreams big, fights bigger - refuses to settle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
