			<personalityDescription>Nawfa doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. They dissect enemy formations, anticipate movements, and execute plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, they&apos;ve already won. Nawfa doesn&apos;t just listen - they understand. They pick up on the small things, noticing when someone needs support before they even ask, and do what they can to lighten their load, no matter how insignificant it might seem. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy-first operator - kills with planning, not firepower.&lt;br&gt;- Reads the room before anyone speaks. Acts before folks even know they need it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
