			<personalityDescription>Sophia is a walking powder keg, always a moment away from igniting. Her temper flares fast and burns bright, leaving little room for reason once she&apos;s set on a path - whether right or wrong. Sophia doesn&apos;t just plan missions - she schedules them down to the second. &quot;If we&apos;re not moving in ten seconds, we&apos;re already behind.&quot; Her squad groans, but when her precision means the difference between making an ambush or falling into one, they stop arguing. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always one spark from exploding. Reason stops mattering once temper flares.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
