			<personalityDescription>Ogunte&apos;s strength isn&apos;t in speed or firepower - it&apos;s in sheer, immovable will. No matter how hard the universe tries to wear her down, she stands firm, proving that persistence is just another kind of victory. Ogunte&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. She scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts her will so thoroughly that those around her rarely get the chance to think for themselves. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 35%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Wins through endurance. Willpower is their greatest weapon.&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
