			<personalityDescription>Cory doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make them walk away from something they&apos;ve committed to. Cory is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, they bring an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees setbacks as challenges, not endings. Keeps advancing.&lt;br&gt;- Fast mover - keeps the rest scrambling to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
