			<personalityDescription>Eun-Young charges headfirst into danger without hesitation, trusting instinct and luck to carry them through. Whether it&apos;s an impossible maneuver or a head-on assault, they never stop to ask if it&apos;s a good idea - only if it&apos;s exciting. No matter what&apos;s happening, Eun-Young can connect it to something they saw, heard about, or was totally involved in. &quot;Supply problems? Ha! Back on Trellwan, we ran an entire op on half-rations. Let me tell you-&quot; Everyone knows once they start, it&apos;s impossible to stop them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rushes into danger without pause. Seeks excitement, not survival.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
