			<personalityDescription>Abena trusts exactly one person to get things done right - herself. She nitpicks every detail, overrides decisions she doesn&apos;t like, and refuses to delegate unless she has no other choice. Abena doesn&apos;t just keep up - she stays ahead. She spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. </personalityDescription>
