			<personalityDescription>Some people make friends. Kareem makes enemies - and seems to prefer it that way. Whether through biting sarcasm or outright aggression, he turns every interaction into a fight waiting to happen, and frankly, Kareem wouldn&apos;t have it any other way. Kareem has a reputation for bending the truth, cutting corners, and looking out for himself first. He&apos;s likable, sure, but trusting him? That&apos;s a gamble few are willing to take. </personalityDescription>
