			<personalityDescription>Nighean treats every challenge like a battle of endurance, convinced that if they just hold out long enough, the world will bend before they do. Sometimes it works - sometimes it just makes life harder for everyone around them. While they don&apos;t seek attention, Nighean notices everything. They listen more than they speak, analyze before they act, and value deep conversations over shallow chatter. Their quiet nature makes their words all the more impactful when they choose to share them. </personalityDescription>
