			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Jagat has no patience for hesitation. They face overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop them. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. Every request, every review, every inventory count - click, click, click. Jagat doesn&apos;t even realize they&apos;re doing it. But if you hear the rapid-fire clicking of a pen, you know they&apos;re deep in thought, solving a problem no one else has noticed yet. </personalityDescription>
