			<personalityDescription>Ka-Sin doesn&apos;t do safe. She thrives in the unknown, the uncertain, the dangerous - where risk is high and the rewards even higher. Whether it&apos;s luck, skill, or sheer nerve, she always seems to come out the other side with a grin. Ka-Sin puts on a friendly face, but it&apos;s a survival tactic as much as anything. She knows being likable keeps people from turning on her, but deep down, she&apos;s always waiting for the moment when trust becomes a liability. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Avoids safety by choice. Risk is the goal. Somehow, keeps surviving.&lt;br&gt;- Knows every name, every story. Makes people feel like they matter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
