			<personalityDescription>Gerrit carries themself with exaggerated confidence, talking up their achievements and acting as if they&apos;re the best warrior, strategist, and leader in the Inner Sphere. While their boasting can be exhausting, there&apos;s just enough charm behind it to make it entertaining. Managing their tasks isn&apos;t just a job for Gerrit - it&apos;s a game. Every day is another piece in the ever-changing puzzle of how to keep the company running. They don&apos;t ust solve problems - they anticipate them. </personalityDescription>
