			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Sandra&apos;s world. She steps forward without looking back, her decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether she&apos;s right or wrong, she never lingers in uncertainty. New tech, new protocols, new disasters - Sandra absorbs them all instantly. She doesn&apos;t dwell on how things were done before - she just adapts. &quot;The system changed again? Cool. I already figured it out.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Decides quickly and moves on. Doesn&apos;t second-guess, right or wrong.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
