			<personalityDescription>Cassidy&apos;s hunger is endless - victory, wealth, status, she craves it all. Even when she has more than enough, it never feels like enough, and she&apos;ll push boundaries until there&apos;s nothing left to take. After seeing too much death and betrayal, Cassidy has stopped caring. She doesn&apos;t form attachments, doesn&apos;t believe in causes, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on emotions. In her mind, caring only leads to pain. </personalityDescription>
