			<personalityDescription>Vicenta never truly relaxes - their mind is always scanning, always assessing. Every situation is a puzzle, every interaction a potential threat, and they refuse to be caught  off guard. Vicenta never forgets a slight, no matter how small. Whether it&apos;s a lost bet, a sarcastic remark, or someone taking their favorite mug, they find ways to get back at people - usually with just enough humor to keep it from being outright malicious. </personalityDescription>
