			<personalityDescription>To Bryce, obstacles are just opportunities that haven&apos;t realized they&apos;ve lost yet. He meets every challenge with unwavering confidence, his presence alone enough to make people second-guess their own hesitation. Bryce doesn&apos;t just hear people - he listens. Whether it&apos;s a new strategy, a fresh perspective, or a hard truth, he takes in information without letting pride or stubbornness get in the way of growth. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns problems into stepping stones. Confidence shakes others out of doubt.&lt;br&gt;- Ego&apos;s quiet. Adaptability isn&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
