			<personalityDescription>Doubt and hesitation have no place in Momcilo&apos;s mind. Once he sets his course, nothing - not fear, not failure, not even overwhelming odds - will make him stray from it. Momcilo doesn&apos;t stop - ever. Even when reason, exhaustion, or sheer survival say he should walk away, he grits his teeth and keeps going. He&apos;ll finish what he started, even if it kills him. </personalityDescription>
