			<personalityDescription>Yeow-whye doesn&apos;t know the meaning of the word quit. No matter how many times they&apos;re knocked down, outmaneuvered, or told something is impossible, they keep pushing forward until they get the result they want. Nothing satisfies Yeow-whye for long. They hoard wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand their fortune - no matter the cost to those around them. </personalityDescription>
