			<personalityDescription>To Joshua, control isn&apos;t a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. He dictates every move, barks orders without question, and refuses to tolerate disobedience. In his world, authority isn&apos;t earned - it&apos;s enforced. Joshua is always ready for action, diving headfirst into challenges with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s a new mission, a tough fight, or a high-stakes gamble, he thrives on the thrill of what&apos;s next. </personalityDescription>
