			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Ezedine&apos;s eyes. He meets every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in his way is just another problem to crush. Ezedine has an instinct for spotting opportunities before anyone else. He&apos;s always watching, always analyzing, ready to capitalize on any weakness, hesitation, or shift in circumstance. </personalityDescription>
