			<personalityDescription>Bor-zeng acts before thinking, always ready to throw himself into a fight at the slightest provocation. Patience isn&apos;t his strong suit, and keeping Bor-zeng in check is often as dangerous as facing the enemy. Bor-zeng doesn&apos;t pressure people - he makes them think they&apos;re making their own choices. His calm demeanor, well-placed words, and ability to read a situation let him guide conversations where he wants them to go, without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been led. </personalityDescription>
