			<personalityDescription>Melissa doesn&apos;t just take charge - she smothers every situation with her presence. Whether giving orders or offering &quot;advice,&quot; she makes sure her voice is the loudest and her will is the only one that matters. Melissa&apos;s words don&apos;t always line up with her thoughts. Sometimes she&apos;s too precise, other times her speech spirals into disconnected, looping statements. She catches herself repeating things under her breath - things that don&apos;t make sense anymore. And when people ask if she&apos;s okay, she just laughs and says &quot;Define okay.&quot; </personalityDescription>
