			<personalityDescription>Charles doesn&apos;t believe in aimless effort - every action, every decision serves a purpose. He keeps his eyes on the prize, unwilling to let anything pull him off course. Charles doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action he takes is calculated to serve his own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. </personalityDescription>
