			<personalityDescription>In Mona&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. She seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. Mona moves through life like a ghost, detached from the surrounding chaos. Orders are followed, tasks are completed, but there&apos;s no fire behind her actions - just a quiet acceptance that nothing really changes. </personalityDescription>
