			<personalityDescription>Jeevankala doesn&apos;t wait for things to happen - she makes them happen. Whether it&apos;s seizing the initiative in battle, fixing a problem before it escalates, or taking charge when others hesitate, she&apos;s always one step ahead. Jeevankala doesn&apos;t soften words because too many people have died believing the wrong ones. False optimism has cost lives. Misleading reports have led to disasters. If the truth is brutal, then so be it. At least with the truth, people have a chance to prepare for what&apos;s coming. </personalityDescription>
