			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Persuasion is just another tool for control. Nelson knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what he wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. Nelson always eats, even when no one else can stomach it. He chews as he sighs off another casualty report. He nibbles on dried meat as he calculates supply losses. Because if he keeps eating, keeps living like normal, then maybe - just maybe-things aren&apos;t as bad as they look. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like strings - never needs to raise a voice.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
