			<personalityDescription>Helmer doesn&apos;t waste time on distractions. He measures success not by effort but by results, constantly driving forward with a clear vision of where he&apos;s going and how he&apos;ll get there. Helmer has a way with words and an even better way with deals. He can navigate complex negotiations, twist situations in his favor, and come out ahead in any conversation. If someone tries to con him, they&apos;d better be ready to lose. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Measures success by outcome, not effort. Keeps the path clear and forward.&lt;br&gt;- Silver tongue and iron grip - gets what they want, walks away clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
