			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, and impossible odds mean nothing to Delu. She will fight until the mission is done, even if it means crawling from the wreckage to finish the job with her bare hands. War isn&apos;t personal for Delu - it&apos;s a business. She weighs risks like investments, treats allies like temporary partners, and knows that in the end, survival isn&apos;t about honor - it&apos;s about profit. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will finish the mission bleeding and broken if needed. Pure willpower.&lt;br&gt;- Treats battle like a spreadsheet. Risk/reward to the decimal.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
