			<personalityDescription>Jakob&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. He scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts his will so thoroughly that those around him rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Jakob sees the universe as one giant stockpile, and he&apos;s determined to take the biggest share. Every resource and every opportunity is something to be claimed, and he refuses to be left wanting. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;br&gt;- Sees the galaxy as a buffet - won&apos;t leave until the table&apos;s cleared.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
