			<personalityDescription>Yolanda has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. They lie, cheat, and take whatever they please, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In their mind, the only crime is getting caught. Others come first - always. Yolanda willingly steps into danger to protect their unit, gives up resources without hesitation, and never asks for anything in return. Strength, in their eyes, is meant to shield, not to exploit. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Laughs at guilt like it&apos;s a bad joke.&lt;br&gt;- Would rather bleed than watch someone else suffer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
