			<personalityDescription>Caution is for the weak, and Erwin has no patience for it. He charges headlong into the most dangerous situations with reckless abandon, trusting skill and sheer audacity to carry him through - because hesitation gets people killed. Erwin sees strength not just in leading but in empowering others. He pushes people to be their best, celebrates their victories, and makes sure they know that, no matter how hard things get, they have someone in their corner. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects caution. Relies on audacity and instinct. High survivability or quick death.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes others forward, never needs the spotlight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
