			<personalityDescription>Dave doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if he&apos;s daring the world to give him a reason to lash out. Dave works fast, his brain running just ahead of his hands, his teeth worrying at his nails between quick jobs. &quot;Hold still, almost done - just let me - &quot; crunch. The nervous habit doesn&apos;t slow him down, but his workspace is often slick with antiseptic from another self-inflicted cut. </personalityDescription>
