			<personalityDescription>Carla never plays fair - she plays to win. Every promise, every alliance, every deal is just another tool in her arsenal, and she always ensures she comes out ahead. Carla moves furniture, gear, everything - not because it matters, but because it&apos;s something she can change. She can&apos;t control which contracts they take, who lives or dies, or when the next battle will come. But she can control where the damn chairs go. And some days, that&apos;s the only thing keeping her from losing her mind. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t play fair - plays to win. Every alliance is a setup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
