			<personalityDescription>Ken walks into every room like he owns it and onto every battlefield like victory is already assured. Whether it&apos;s skill, luck, or sheer arrogance, Ken makes it look easy - and he makes sure everyone knows it. Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Ken. He&apos;s seen what chasing those things does to people, and he&apos;s perfectly happy staying right where he is, watching others run themselves into the ground. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enters every situation like it&apos;s already won. Walks the line between skill and arrogance.&lt;br&gt;- Eyes open, but already checked out. Let others chase ghosts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
