			<personalityDescription>Yasemin doesn&apos;t just reach for power - she grabs for it, no matter the cost. Her ambition drives her to overextend, making enemies and burning bridges as she chases goals that always seem just out of reach. One day, she&apos;ll push too far, and there&apos;ll be no coming back. Yasemin has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. She can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get her way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where she wants them to go. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition outweighs sense. Making enemies faster than allies.&lt;br&gt;- Gets agreement without argument. Smooth operator.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
