			<personalityDescription>Success, power, recognition - none of it matters to Torra. She&apos;s seen what chasing those things does to people, and she&apos;s perfectly happy staying right where she is, watching others run themselves into the ground. Torra keeps everything - ammo, supplies, spare parts - because you never know when you&apos;ll need them. She refuses to let go of anything useful, even if it means stockpiling more than she could ever realistically use. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Eyes open, but already checked out. Let others chase ghosts.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps everything that isn&apos;t nailed down. Doesn&apos;t share. Doesn&apos;t trust.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
