			<personalityDescription>Madalina trusts exactly one person to get things done right - themself. They nitpick every detail, override decisions they don&apos;t like, and refuse to delegate unless they have no other choice. Madalina doesn&apos;t trust stability. They&apos;ve seen entire operations fall apart in seconds. They know the ones who survive aren&apos;t the strongest or the smartest - they&apos;re the ones who change first. Because if you can&apos;t keep up, you&apos;re already falling behind. </personalityDescription>
