			<personalityDescription>To Mitchell, control isn&apos;t about leadership - it&apos;s about domination. He micromanages, manipulates, and enforces his will through intimidation or force. If someone steps out of line, they&apos;ll regret it. Mitchell has hidden stockpiles everywhere. Rations in the storage bay, extra weapons in unmarked crates, an escape route planned for any disaster. People think he&apos;s paranoid - until the first real crisis hits. &quot;What do you mean you didn&apos;t pack three months&apos; worth of emergency food?&quot; </personalityDescription>
