			<personalityDescription>Peter doesn&apos;t just want success - he demands it. He climbs over anyone in his way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In his mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Peter can&apos;t resist a puzzle. &quot;Peter, we need those power cells moved.&quot; &quot;Sure thing - oh, but look at this encryption key, someone tried to hide something here...&quot; His coworkers have learned to either give him puzzles on purpose or rip them out of his hands before he gets lost in them. </personalityDescription>
