			<personalityDescription>Moon knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for her own. She pulls strings, applies pressure, and always ensures that the cost of her success is paid by someone else. Moon has seen too many people fade into nothing, their stories, their impact erased by time and war. She refuses to be just another worker, just another body. Her signature move is more than just habit - it&apos;s a way to make sure no one forgets she was here. </personalityDescription>
