			<personalityDescription>Montay acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, they prefer action over hesitation - sometimes to their own detriment. For Montay, there&apos;s always a next step, a bigger challenge, a greater prize to chase. No victory is ever enough - they&apos;re always looking beyond the horizon for the next opportunity to climb higher. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps before looking. Trusts instinct over outcome. Risk to self and mission.&lt;br&gt;- No victory lasts. Chasing the next big thing is the real drive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
