			<personalityDescription>Danielle refuses to acknowledge limits - her own or anyone else&apos;s. She constantly takes on more than she should, convinced that sheer willpower and stubbornness will carry her through, even as the cracks begin to show. &quot;I have precisely four minutes for this discussion.&quot; &quot;I planned for this to take ten minutes, and now it&apos;s taking eleven. I don&apos;t approve.&quot; Her fixation on deadlines is impressive, frustrating, and sometimes a little scary. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks under pressure but hasn&apos;t noticed the cracks yet.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
